eshSources caches bound currentmesh handle and lazyunbound clone strippedjointattrs/recentered by part.rigid_center. These are two pipeline representations of onegeometry, not independentobservation; skins/presence choose representation eachframe.", "all_updates": "Sources initialized only when missing; unbound built only once. Ownership/scene/skin changes re-evaluated; worn withoutskin hidden; drop and reequip switchhandlescorrectly. Bound source content/currentMesh source replacement/rigidcenter changes afterinitialization have no comparison/invalidation in exact234linebody. FindingF002 is explicit dependency contractgap conditional on such allowedasset/partreplacement, no claim observednormalmutation.", "actual_receivers": "sync_render_bindings selects old sources.bound/unbound and may overwrite a new Mesh3d with olddesired113-115. Existing readonlytests confirm initialdrop/re-equip reuse only, not dependencyownership removal."}, {"fact": "Input selection, topology and presentation status", "representations": "GrabSession activehand/selection/repeatedinput/flash are local interaction facts; selectedtarget/currenthelditem/serverrevision are separate facts, fetchedatrequest. No copiedserverinventory authority in selection. HUD classification and joinedrects computedonread. Topology traversal reconstructslocation/socket eachpass withvisited32 guard; no stale retainedlocation label.", "all_updates": "PRrelease re-reads EquipmentActionState, failssafeifabsent, requestincludes exactcurrentheld anddestination expectation, clearsinteraction. P16 deliberately differs rawsequence wrapping and missingrevision->0 (existing historical gap, not a concurrent secondcanonicaltype). Scene/worn/held transforms and heldconstraint recomputed fromsource queries. Resolved/Failed marker lifecycle belongs further runtimegeneration/skin source roles pending; no blanket marker clearance."}], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F001", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F002"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "One