{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-014", "at": "2026-10-22T19:21:10.113564+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope019_index": 45, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "308714b71f7effc69b5f0d0314884b560472372f1746b1101147414253715b42", "actual_EOF": 43, "material_ranges": [[1, 43]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/45", "comparison": "Core package has one workspace dependency graph; runtime and build dependencies have distinct compiler roles. P16 adds neutral geometry to build dependencies; no copied physical default or runtime cache is defined here."}, {"scope019_index": 172, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "36987a2d79efdb7b873694038158a9b7ca916a8d1cf332427e2023b5311d487f", "actual_EOF": 32, "material_ranges": [[1, 32]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/172", "comparison": "Persistence package requests Core/world/determinism SpacetimeDB features and cdylib/rlib output. authority-tests is explicitly a disposable acceptance capability, not another production policy value. P16 alone includes neutral geometry dependency."}, {"scope019_index": 421, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "3a08ad5b69e06fb586e1ff7ace785e9b53c79345119fddc49c3f162b5f2f3bdb", "actual_EOF": 19, "material_ranges": [[1, 19]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/421", "comparison": "Weapon model requests serde_json float_roundtrip, hash, drawing and glam capabilities; these are codec/compiler requirements, not independent model digest/current geometry records."}, {"scope019_index": 453, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/fabelgeist-math/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "6aaf0cb94d1603d0d6cdd07f1bee8021c3c29c841d01d144143faa4be39a6321", "actual_EOF": 17, "material_ranges": [[1, 17]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/453", "comparison": "Standalone math package owns its package metadata and empty default feature set; optional wgpu backend requirements describe compilation capabilities. Compared current PR manifest from CONTRACT010: same source declarations and same metadata role."}, {"scope019_index": 498, "source_id": "pr-working:Cargo.toml", "sha256": "5ed2a487edaef9c2632e251c8d241d278352fed8a16d870149d980665388431d", "actual_EOF": 221, "material_ranges": [[1, 221]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/498", "comparison": "Workspace versions, members/exclusions, patches and optimization profiles configure resolution/builds. Root package metadata is inherited by members; explicit isolated creator/MHR workspaces are different build contexts. Requirements and lockfile resolutions are different facts. Fork provenance comments do not establish actual runtime backend semantics."}, {"scope019_index": 528, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "7b2672843eec305915871c4ba93c1e4c617e555e5a354eea2abc565b654b665f", "actual_EOF": 55, "material_ranges": [[1, 55]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/528", "comparison": "Building generator features select viewer/sign rendering and optional native dependencies; neutral geometry dependency selects reflect and bevy-math adapters. No roof/layout gameplay parameters or generated cache contents are authored here."}, {"scope019_index": 681, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-character-creator/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "b44ae2d0177b2c835054b53f233a12d93f7fffdce8ecbf20fad37d99796840a4", "actual_EOF": 79, "material_ranges": [[1, 79]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/681", "comparison": "Creator is an isolated workspace; offline-creator feature selects optional Burn/MHR and Bevy capabilities. Local path requirements and optimization profiles are build inputs, not copies of evaluated body/cloth properties. Hair comment versus feature spelling is not evidence of two current gameplay authorities."}, {"scope019_index": 849, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "feb7d553952f711d1296803b07e2ec1b7ee1cb555df59648b5bdef7e2cf5d4a9", "actual_EOF": 42, "material_ranges": [[1, 42]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/849", "comparison": "PR Core requests the same feature propagation and checked owner dependencies as P16; absence of P16 build geometry dependency is a compilation graph difference, not two competing runtime scalar policies."}, {"scope019_index": 1036, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-plant-generator/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "c62ef46d7f6ce6ce73bc52b18585d610a1417364a808ab3b0cd6d0ce5f8c4015", "actual_EOF": 29, "material_ranges": [[1, 29]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/1036", "comparison": "Plant viewer feature and optional GUI dependencies are separate compiler capabilities; plant dimensions/habitat values are not authored in this manifest."}, {"scope019_index": 1058, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-puzzles/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "776ef3b34040bd18cba056db05a10463f6838cbaef84a75f4d669ffe3966683f", "actual_EOF": 15, "material_ranges": [[1, 15]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/1058", "comparison": "Puzzle manifest contains package inheritance plus Serde/CLI/determinism dependencies only; no separate puzzle solution, size or rule table is retained here."}, {"scope019_index": 1072, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "88120e04c42c2e3a0dfa5100055838100a09da1e60fb3193f2aa8ab2a8867113", "actual_EOF": 31, "material_ranges": [[1, 31]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/1072", "comparison": "PR persistence manifest matches P16 output/feature contracts with no neutral geometry dependency. Core/world-schema/determinism feature selection wires native codec support; it does not make a parallel current database/gameplay authority."}, {"scope019_index": 1301, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "c57a0334ef2f29a999ad45e9d4714bc954669a429a1a95f3cd993b6cff8722e2", "actual_EOF": 131, "material_ranges": [[1, 131]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/1301", "comparison": "Client defaults enable debug/audio; native versus wasm Bevy feature branches intentionally differ by target. Meshgen/client netcode/sign-render flags select receiving adapters. Comments about shared Eidolon backend are provenance, not proof of cache invalidation or live rendering. No gameplay fallback value table exists here."}, {"scope019_index": 1749, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "a514b1eccfff839c875aaa5148d8299f119beb39ce645dc828e653399b6ef320", "actual_EOF": 44, "material_ranges": [[1, 44]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/1749", "comparison": "Tactical Core empty default, meshgen and avian_debug features describe optional compiled capabilities; references to Core/schema/building owners do not independently store their values. Dev codecs are test build inputs only."}, {"scope019_index": 2007, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-server/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "c966f29016d32aca39e17ea882e55271f208891ab003c331287114388a449a3a", "actual_EOF": 55, "material_ranges": [[1, 55]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/2007", "comparison": "Server debug/remote-types/iteration switches and server netcode selection are build capabilities. SpacetimeDB client dependency is an external service adapter, not persistence of transient tactical tick state in this source."}, {"scope019_index": 2670, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-world-schema/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "3c5bed9bdba2fe4d9a73522f70749beccc5240021b04af3755167af288735655", "actual_EOF": 31, "material_ranges": [[1, 31]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/2670", "comparison": "World-schema runtime optional SpacetimeDB-lib and build dependency have distinct runtime-codec versus build-generator roles. Same version source is workspace-owned; no independent acceptance flag or gameplay cache."}, {"scope019_index": 2671, "source_id": "physical-p16:Cargo.toml", "sha256": "5ed2a487edaef9c2632e251c8d241d278352fed8a16d870149d980665388431d", "actual_EOF": 221, "material_ranges": [[178, 182]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/2671", "comparison": "Exact P16 SDK/runtime/lib/SATS requirements all pin 2.6.1 for different packages in one family. Requirement equality is not a duplicate live value; no package body/runtime-decoder credit."}, {"scope019_index": 2683, "source_id": "report-p17:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "7fea1b7354749df8baa74d64f7de52d31252f38ef3e631722c694b113d60e8b7", "actual_EOF": 55, "material_ranges": [[1, 27]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/2683", "comparison": "Exact P17 feature/dependency prefix selects neutral geometry reflection and Bevy namespace; unlike PR it does not request bevy-math in this line. Different adapter availability is not a second scalar policy. Lines28+ excluded."}, {"scope019_index": 2685, "source_id": "report-p17:Cargo.toml", "sha256": "5ed2a487edaef9c2632e251c8d241d278352fed8a16d870149d980665388431d", "actual_EOF": 221, "material_ranges": [[85, 85], [95, 95]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/2685", "comparison": "Only geometry local path/version and opening Bevy requirement line are scoped. These namespace requirements are build facts; incomplete Bevy feature array below95 is expressly not analyzed or credited."}, {"scope019_index": 2723, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-client/Cargo.toml", "sha256": "cf3964f3ac12941d5266ff1285c0ce08d8a608eaf93a4a4840126288b937534c", "actual_EOF": 14, "material_ranges": [[11, 11]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-019.json#/files/2723", "comparison": "Only generated client SDK workspace dependency edge is scoped. This resolves the adapter identity; it does not introduce another authoritative application schema or prove any callback algorithm."}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh literal reads of every listed material range. Full manifests except explicitly bounded P16/P17 dependency edges and generated-client SDK edge; actual PR/P16 Core/persistence differences compared from both displayed bodies, not hash equality. Prior CONTRACT010 PR math manifest compared by actual declaration meaning.", "construction_update_receiver": "Cargo reads authored manifests and workspace references to resolve compile-time graph; Cargo.lock retains resolution for a build context. These sources define neither application value constructors nor a mutable current gameplay cache. Runtime behavior in imported modules remains separately inventoried.", "disposition": "No redundant gameplay authority in these exact metadata contracts. Do not consolidate distinct package requirements, build/runtime/dev roles, target feature branches or separate workspace resolutions merely because literals repeat.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "No repair from these declarations under lens07; F005 authored gameplay mirror repair remains separately scoped.", "source_or_later_lens_clearance": false}
