[[1, 72]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-021.json#/files/2741"}, {"scope021_index": 871, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_round/commitment.rs", "sha256": "52eb21ff762fa1bb6d55c4237bf1d1d66638a7929d996eb94074726727b563f6", "actual_EOF": 239, "material_ranges": [[1, 239]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-021.json#/files/871"}, {"scope021_index": 873, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_round/mod.rs", "sha256": "3ada1de8aa9e1322565a5f1ae9b5882e0beba1d5ad024cc4705f7eb35ba0982b", "actual_EOF": 595, "material_ranges": [[1, 595]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-021.json#/files/873"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh full PR roundmod595 (1-435 before compaction,436-595 now), commitment239 before compaction, exchange293 and assignment72 now. Complete actual P16 differences read: commitment/assignment bodies identical with actual same immutable-operation/current-selection roles compared; roundmod597 adds typed center construction before health mutation and fallible SignedLength contacts; exchange293 differences confined checked test helpers. No hash-only semantic credit.", "contracts": ["Assignment derives active, melee and ranged index lists from current combatants on each call, orders melee before ranged before remaining active, and computes local flank rank. No retained membership/class flag; fallback ranged priorities and active set intentionally different selections. Current caller gates nonempty defenders separately; no accepted-empty-list policy invented.", "Prepared exchange captures actual contact, phase and timing before applying mutations. exchange.result is unscaled native result, prepared.result applies consumed one-shot attack_power_multiplier via mem::replace(1); these are different stages. Applying attacker work, defender response, attack result then recording observes this operation, not two independent live damage authorities. Response cancellation clears all queued timing fields together; subsequent scheduling checks captured identity before acting.", "Commitment phase/readiness computes from current engagement target, recovery and current start/contact rather than storing redundant phase labels. Adaptation time and incoming impact time have distinct roles. Counter increments/decrements are historical outcomes; before/after and canceled/transformed timeline records preserve transition evidence. Armor chain selected/intersected are emitted together for the one currently intersected layer and retain geometry/provenance observations.", "Source defensive work and recovery helper each use nominal0.5s. Their roles are work effort charge versus busy window; equal literals alone do not prove both one authored fact. Retain policy comparison qualification, no unsupported duplicate-authority finding. Transformed offhand one-shot power changes current multiplier while returned observed power reports its result.", "Exchange builds one selected melee equipment view and computes body contact then weapon-defense alignment then effective physical response; original intended response versus resulting effective response are distinct stages, not competing labels. Existing equality test compares shared tactical/autoresolve equation using current source, does not remove independently retained base weapon ambiguity.", "Fresh roundmod381-394 confirms F009 at actual contact facts: preferred measure and grip/head/style/material select melee weapon while effective reach still reads base weapon. This composes the normal ranged-to-melee switch traced in025. F008 public distal_headed latent divergence remains separate. Existing movement fixtures manually copy melee_weapon into base weapon and therefore do not remove authority mismatch."], "explicit_dependencies": "Lower shared combat equations/calibration/body policies remain own exact source inventory; current full helper coverage does not clear their source. No executed battle/outcome claim.", "findings": "F009 normal selected-owner mismatch plus F008 latent public computed flag retained; no new numbered finding.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve distinct selected alternatives, temporal observations, deterministic sampling/order and actual errors. Repair F009 with one explicit selected-mode view through movement/contact/work; F008 derive classification or seal coordinated owner. No tests/runtime/source edits or later-lens credit.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventory; no other lens credit"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-031", "at": "2026-10-22T19:59:29.785263+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope021_index": 50, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve.rs", "sha256": "0b6aef0b8e1be9846beaae48cc8f7130333b0b4634acbd0b2f8b393ee40d5cef", "actual_EOF": 2879, "material_ranges": [[1, 2879]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-021.json#/files/50"}, {"scope021_index": 857, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve.rs", "sha256": "cc0f6780e86a9e0eebd3af3862517b7b99a63d7f9712e2f63de5d8b4d174c46a", "actual_EOF": 2878, "material_ranges": [[1, 2878]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-021.json#/files/857"}], "actual_source_proof": "Current07 fresh PR production1-1332 and critical existing2090-2117 in main-partial026; full actual P16 delta now reviewed including production typed distances and existing test fixture changes. Personally reconsumed actual full source facts CAMERA-ADM03-054 (all P16 1-2879, complete PR2878 comparison and existing1333+ fixture meanings), reanalyzed for07 using current actual child update paths029/030/025 and source facts, not prior admission verdict. No new test execution.", "contracts": ["Current incapacitation/defeated predicates derive from current contributions rather than storing a competing bool. Starting blood/incapacitation versus accumulated battle blood loss and current wound flow are baseline, time integral and instantaneous source respectively. General fatigue remains one value; active_work_seconds is remaining effort/recovery budget, not another fatigue pool.", "new/from_strategic reset all private tactical transients and capture initial ammo as history. Current ammo and initial ammo are intentionally distinct; preferred attack mode derives current ammo/capability on demand. This does not coordinate base equipment selection, so F009 remains a source-backed normal hybrid mismatch.", "Recorder record_attack updates hit/attack/damage summary and immutable log in one actual method. Sequence derives log length; applied damage partition records actual health outcome, not independent raw incoming damage. Final ammo usage is derived initial-current at battle end; opening counts are phase subsets. Stealth summary fields remain unused because external awareness supplies opening classification, with explicit no-second-roll policy.", "BattleOutcome consumes final combatants and captures wound/terminal/incapacitation/encumbrance/blood observations together. Incapacitated bool and numeric incap, terminal cause and damage components are different explanatory observations at one immutable result epoch, rather than proven independently updated live caches. Public raw DTO admission/correlation is broader and remains other lens finding, not evidence of a normal stale outcome update.", "Opening volley plans preserve initial opportunity/time budget and later check current targets/defeat; normal ranged turn consumes available ammo after counting current progress. Target lists/queued work reflect scheduling epoch versus current activity. Deterministic RNG/seed, before-after events and final resolution are histories; rounds elapsed differs terminal resolution. Existing tests cover simultaneity/cancellation, deterministic order, fatigue, native Inf armor/NaN log policy and raw precision4, so no finite-all-input reinterpretation.", "Current P16 private engagement/scheduled/telemetry distances use SignedLength versus PR rawf32 and checked center construction can return before health/log update. Actual role comparisons preserve this error boundary, signed geometry policy and historic tick/float observations. Remaining main body changes are native extraction and fixture typed construction; no independent authored current state introduced."], "explicit_dependencies": "Core combat damage/fatigue/encumbrance/recovery definitions and iteration/structured-output receivers still require own07 source coverage; no whole-feature clearance from main source closure.", "findings": "F009 and F008 retained; no actual partially updated final outcome found. Root reports no contrary source-backed04 evidence; this conclusion comes from actual coordinated factories/update traces.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve distinct selected alternatives, temporal observations, deterministic sampling/order and actual errors. Repair F009 with one explicit selected-mode view through movement/contact/work; F008 derive classification or seal coordinated owner. No tests/runtime/source edits or later-lens credit.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventory; no other lens credit"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-033", "at": "2026-10-22T20:00:28.749416+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope022_index": 54, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/incapacitation_tests.rs", "sha256": "82fefbb149fc497e21bc9a6807ba2c59a7ede49ce15681838342a37fdd4a6527", "actual_EOF": 86, "material_ranges": [[1, 86]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/54"}, {"scope022_index": 63, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_movement.rs", "sha256": "3fcb38f4034fe1eccf1d7d99ee3310fed62812d16ef25d547e79e009e4425c33", "actual_EOF": 392, "material_ranges": [[1, 392]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/63"}, {"scope022_index": 861, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/incapacitation_tests.rs", "sha256": "82fefbb149fc497e21bc9a6807ba2c59a7ede49ce15681838342a37fdd4a6527", "actual_EOF": 86, "material_ranges": [[1, 86]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/861"}, {"scope022_index": 870, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_movement.rs", "sha256": "086c2055231445836bac21e3ffa931c0909cd95def8d4fa7e4f041a2fe629e86", "actual_EOF": 389, "material_ranges": [[1, 389]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/870"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh PR incapacitation_tests86 and movement389 all production+existing tests. Complete actual P16 comparison: tests identical but same performance-vs-movement source policy explicitly compared; movement392 typed SignedLength complete-native-result readmission/fallible result changes only, all same integration/clip roles.", "contracts": ["Incapacitation source tests assert equal total incap from fatigue versus other starting source gives identical exchange, fatigue does not slow movement, and encumbrance appears once rather than hidden physical-skill penalty. These are intentional policy oracles, not a second runtime impairment authority; no test execution or new assertion.", "AxisMotion before/after speed, limit and displacement are a single integration observation with different units/epochs. Displacement is integral, not fully derivable from final speed alone under acceleration/capping. OpposedMovement before/after gap and independent actor contributions describe one simultaneous step. Collision clipping scales both displacements and clips both signed after velocities before returning one record; no subsequent setters mutate retained live paired values in this kernel.", "ground_drive derives acceleration each call from force/strength/mass/traction, no retained cached acceleration. Axis intent computes target rather than storing independent direction flag. Native ordered f32 additions/trapezoid/constant portions intentionally preserve path; P16 reconstructs checked signed lengths only at completed displacement/gap results. Error boundaries and signed closing/retreat/zero semantics preserved.", "Existing tests cover coasting/zero time, substep equivalence, positive mass effect, finite acceleration and collision floor; fixture SPEED/ACCELERATION are deliberate local inputs rather than independently authored runtime defaults. Actual pair publication/current receiver already compared025/029; this integration record is historical calculation, not extra gameplay movement authority."], "findings": "F009 selected weapon mismatch remains at caller; no new redundant current authority in integrator/test source.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep single coordinated clip result and current contribution provenance. Do not collapse signed velocity, displacement and gap or add hidden impairment. No source edits/later-lens credit.", "status": "exact source07 inventory complete"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-034", "at": "2026-10-22T20:01:41.339620+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope022_index": 58, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_iteration.rs", "sha256": "e1dac77a2c5ef7c2bb50b886c9b7340c83f2fcee27fe767788e48463ad6f737c", "actual_EOF": 866, "material_ranges": [[1, 866]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/58"}, {"scope022_index": 59, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_iteration/error.rs", "sha256": "a434a6844f7fc1634be9cab2e144ae9a6e7bc9b09a93c1b72b0bdca38140c197", "actual_EOF": 48, "material_ranges": [[1, 48]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/59"}, {"scope022_index": 60, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_iteration/evidence.rs", "sha256": "a806a6dd4779dabe9e140cdc109d4450a5d400c0460b862e157ad4f73b58c345", "actual_EOF": 447, "material_ranges": [[1, 447]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/60"}, {"scope022_index": 61, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_iteration/evidence/armor.rs", "sha256": "9a5f5b89b21f9f10d774f35eb8c9f2cc2c73ebd4a21faf917bae8cd0b428561c", "actual_EOF": 76, "material_ranges": [[1, 76]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/61"}, {"scope022_index": 62, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_iteration/evidence/timeline.rs", "sha256": "aeeb06c19efd75896544fd2d7d89f4e664f10d8c005772ccc8516d69e27f1126", "actual_EOF": 151, "material_ranges": [[1, 151]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/62"}, {"scope022_index": 865, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/autoresolve/melee_iteration.rs", "sha256": "2f56c5185ec61241a7e4607eef02ebb4051e24dee918f5200585d586a4d971a8", "actual_EOF