on#/files/900"}, {"scope022_index": 2690, "source_id": "p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/incapacitation.rs", "sha256": "a38c469cbc09f75a1d55f0050c74c54c9dba3adb5dfe9e13e88142dc10cff7e3", "actual_EOF": 115, "material_ranges": [[1, 54]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-022.json#/files/2690"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh all PR defense444/fatigue263/incap115 including existing tests, complete actual P16differences empty; actual same caller roles examined with current029/030/031. Alias p16:incap exactly1-54 is same physical body already freshly compared but explicitly narrower reached RecoveryTime/performance/nativeOption role: full115 physical-p16 role separate,55-115 excluded for alias. No hash/verdict coverage.", "contracts": ["CommittedThreatDecision records choice, probability, completed work and expected benefit from one operation; probability alone does not determine choice without sampled behavioral input. Completed work depends relative contact timing; recovery exposure, current vulnerability and learned consecutive-intercept count are independent decision facts. These are immediate operation/history outputs used by current commitment helper030, not two independently authored live willingness classifications.", "WeaponDefenseAlignment stores attempted response and effective response with actual sampled alignment/probability/engagement. Attempted work cost and effective intercept engagement explicitly differ. Current resolver builds effective from attempted+engagement together; actual exchange uses effective physical response while timeline retains original decision provenance. No independently stored global success flag; success_probability is distribution quantity, engagement is sampled continuous effect. They must not be collapsed into a binary outcome oracle.", "Shield frontal-lateral geometry derives resting side and bodypart/local coordinate; maximum traversal derives SHIELD_HALF_WIDTH+ARM_TRAVERSE. Each is distinct physical input, not a duplicate endpoint cache. Contact location projection is a local simplified body coordinate, not native world Position. Performance and physical alignment scale response at different stages, preserving actualinput_reflex/precision roles; current `is_weapon_contact` computes variant classification on demand.", "CombatActionWorkload stores only metabolicjoules; action work kind is independent input which selects weapon versus moving body work. Actual apply_workload adds once to one fatigue pool, recover subtracts from same value. Movement fatigue computes cost from current effort/sustainable speed/carry/endurance per call. No retained oxygen-debt/muscle fatigue/parallel speed penalty introduced; total incapacitation conversion remains single source and wheel rules preserved.", "Workload parameters come from canonical config CONTRACT013/015 rather than another authored default; current helper computes capacity per call. Mechanical energy and fatiguefraction have different units, no duplicate normalized budget stored. Actionduration clamping and zero sustainable speed behavior remain native arithmetic/admission concerns, not new samefact authority findings.", "RecoveryTime is a performance snapshot: After(duration) versus CannotRecover is one enum, available/SerdeOption project that state. No independently retained availablebool or infinitysentinel. Zero base recovery remains After0 even at zero performance, positive base at0 becomes CannotRecover, nonfinite arithmetic is error; current finite leaf definition supports exact imported bot contract without inferring permanent capability.", "Performance derives1-clamped totalincap, encumbrance derives1-current canonical carryingmultiplier. They are present transformations, not additional fatigue penalty. Existing tests source-only assert total-source equivalence, no hidden onset threshold and each work source contributing to singlefatigue; no execution/newcases."], "explicit_dependencies": "Canonical lower carrying-capacity, body/skill/precision/native policy remains own07 source scope; no whole tactical bot coverage from alias definition. Current retained DB capability table lifecycle stillpartial038.", "findings": "No new07 duplicate current authority in listed pure decisions/work/recovery; existingF009 selection and other raw-state findings preserved.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep explicit decision/input/effect epochs, current computed classifications and single fatigue owner; any aggregate sealing must preserve real history, zero recovery and errors. Source frozen/no laterlens credit.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventory complete"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-043", "at": "2026-10-22T20:13:48.845147+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope023_index": 87, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/weapon_contact.rs", "sha256": "6490cee01f9eeb43f5cb7201d193a93cb59f9e053ba093d3689c94008a24d140", "actual_EOF": 113, "material_ranges": [[1, 113]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-023.json#/files/87"}, {"scope023_index": 88, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/weapon_contact/tests.rs", "sha256": "1f06000f7544b5eef15b06fbce033930014e96dc50812d8b9dadfd3c2b850af9", "actual_EOF": 111, "material_ranges": [[1, 111]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-023.json#/files/88"}, {"scope023_index": 893, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/capability.rs", "sha256": "877f8932ea920a91c610829b96a637ad6d361189a28f41d464376763ca8d160c", "actual_EOF": 72, "material_ranges": [[1, 72]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-023.json#/files/893"}, {"scope023_index": 903, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/weapon_contact.rs", "sha256": "287ef23a8837049c44a05b856bcef61d536c382a5e3602b6755f434f02c177d5", "actual_EOF": 113, "material_ranges": [[1, 113]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-023.json#/files/903"}, {"scope023_index": 904, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/weapon_contact/tests.rs", "sha256": "fe810f795ff7e4d52786d5c51504c3f2c12154cabdbeb23ba90939923971bfe4", "actual_EOF": 111, "material_ranges": [[1, 111]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-023.json#/files/904"}], "additional_source": {"source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/combat/capability.rs", "sha256": "877f8932ea920a91c610829b96a637ad6d361189a28f41d464376763ca8d160c", "actual_EOF": 72, "material_ranges": [[1, 45]], "registration": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-REG005", "source_status": "actual bounded fresh after registration;46+excluded; global accountingpending"}, "actual_source_proof": "Fresh all PRprecision113/tests111/capability72, complete P16precision/testdiff (typed reach/getter and fixture constructor only). Prospectively registered then fresh actual P16capability1-45, exact current body comparison empty but actual selected-side/body predicate meaning independently compared. No P16test46+credit.", "contracts": ["ContactPrecision stores one checked concentration; value returns backing, resistance and concentrated_fraction derive from that same value on access. Concentration versus handling accuracy are explicitly different physical facts. Handling depends grip lever/balance and referencecontrol length, never precision or itemtext identity; no cached handling field here.", "precision_for_design derives concentration from actual Head working section dimensions and canonical contact parameters; multiple heads select maximum usable contact rather than additive precision. Shaft fallback is deliberate only when no head-derived concentration. Furniture does not contribute. All shape cases choose physical width/thickness/area convention, not a weapon-type string classifier; body shape definitions/canonical recipe gates remain their own source inventory.", "Contact scalar may exceed1, including4; concentratedfraction derives bounded share and resistance uses reciprocal with intentionalInfinity at0. No parallel stored fraction/resistance copied with mutable concentration, so no stale derived state. Publicnew assertion/admission failure remains priorfinding; do not invent<=1 invariant or fakezero default to cure it.", "Current capability enum is single current classification: selected holding side chooses controlling arm(s), current bodyhealth determines unavailable reason. is_available computes enumvariant each call. Offhand transfer is explicitly a distinct action rather than inferred fallback; no independent permanent disabled-arm flag. Core broad CharacterCapabilities projection and action-specific MeleeAttackCapability have different scopes/epochs and must not be collapsed.", "Existing tests source-only compare concentration with authored default designs, thickness changes, duplicated furniture invariance, handling independence and per-instance condition applied once. They are not runtime authoritative reference tables. Disabled-arm fixture asserts selected side health gate, labels militia/demi only diagnostic context. No test execution/newcase/source edit."], "explicit_dependencies": "Canonical weapon-model shape and per-instance geometry/condition factory definitions still own07 source roles; tests invoke them but do not provide wholecalleecoverage. Newly reached P16capability exact role pending globaldelta, no included test credit.", "findings": "No new07 duplicate current authority; selected equipment F009 and raw precision admission finding remain.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep concentration derived from authoritative recipe and config, handling separate and current capability derived from selected weapon/body. Preserve zero/Infinity/mathorder and distinct action authority. Source frozen.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventory complete"}
