num wire separate. Fresh DBnative boundary preserves typederror until encode; no blanket Webbody inference.", "HousingTier.economy is one canonical literal policy owner; authored_housing_catalog maps exact ALLtiers to that function. Desired validator ordering/prices compare actual authored contracts; no independent duplicate per-settlement defaults defined here. Purchase/rent/maintenance/tax and leisuremultiplier are distinct economic inputs, including11000..16000 factors greaterthanbaseline. totalcharge derives from lineitems everycall rather than stored duplicate sum.", "DueSettlementPlan records coordinated proposed transition: due/paid counts, spent/remaining funds, nextdue and optionalfirstunpaid derive one operation. They intentionally describe before/after and different auditlineitems, not two independent mutable current balances. Private DuePeriods advances one cursor through explicitfrontier and terminates overflow. Downstream persistence must apply plan coherently; DB source roles still owninventory.", "Residence and spouse morale are separate refreshable earned sources with independent expiry/cap, not duplicate totalmorale. Current total computes live capped sum on read; boundedrefresh reserves counterpart live value and updates amount+expiry together. Zero gain deliberately leaves record unchanged and doesnotprolong expiry. Source-specific cap and combinedcap differentpolicy, no extra cached livebool or total storedhere.", "LeisureIntervals carry realized start/end/location; joint elapsed computesintersection. MinuteSpans record claimed timecoverage used to derive uncovered sorteddisjoint portions so retries do not mintmoreleisure. Stored evidence of earlier realizedtime cannot collapse to currentlocation/time; current clockorigin and spanunits distinct.", "ConceptionQuantumState remainder+nextordinal represent conserved progress vs sequential eventidentity. QuantumPlan emits historical trials and coordinated newstate; ordinal count and crossingoffset ar