ons; sigil-to-array index is an explicit closed semantic adapter, not another puzzle solver. Rendered clue truth follows typed clue selection; reviewed natural-language clue tables are necessarily presentation while exact position255 indexing remains prior03 admission exposure, not an invented redundant solver."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F013"], "qualification": "REG008 effective material ends at function460;461-467 blank/next CategorizedThreatProfile declaration excluded from new material proof. That narrower final scope is mandatory. No current bad source/runtime case claimed.", "status": "exact P161-445 current07 inventory complete with finding; local helper scope reconciliation pending"}
