e namespace plus numeric ID identifies real separate storage tables, not redundant identity bits. Public fabricated plans remain admission concerns; actual DB plan recomputation/commit and error behavior need own source roles.", "MAX_FILTH and SOAP_CLEANSING_CAPACITY own different bounds/units. Per-deposit clipped amount, whole character total, washing priority and dose fraction are derived different projections. Deleting/cleaning a deposit must update DB cached totals at its own receiver; pure planner retains no separate live counter.", "Travel_dirt67-68 uses TRAVEL_DIRT_PER_DAY13, while exact travel_dirt_accrual73-78 repeats integer8 at75. They currently encode the same daily rate but have intentionally different rounding/chunk roles. A one-sided rate edit can make the public approximate helper and exact remainder operation disagree; this is a constant-authority strengthening opportunity, not evidence both are active competing DB routes. Canonical rate should feed both native arithmetic forms while preserving exact quotient/remainder and existing rounding."], "findings": [], "qualifications": "Retain prior03 bounded-deposit, raw remainder, plan admissibility and NaN exposure findings. No actual DB cache invalidation verdict or runtime mutation here; fresh actual DB source narrative may support later exact join.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "One typed integer daily accrual rate can derive the native floating presentation approximation and exact remainder operation. Preserve historical material provenance, same-epoch plan and actual fractional soap capacity units.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventory complete with qualified migration opportunity"}
