ithout actual misuse at a caller. focus_level is a separate input, not another fatigue pool here.", "Election derives living set and tallies for this invocation. Current leader versus proposed successor are before/after roles; current_leader_alive is an explicit external fact, not automatically equal to membership of an input list because alive and party membership differ. Thresholds for living/dead incumbent and deterministic low-ID tie break are one policy function. No retained duplicate winner/tally table inside helper.", "Repeated eligible voter entries remain prior03 ballot admission dependency. One authoritative ballot per voter must be supplied/validated by DB caller; this source does not establish that precondition. Tests encode intended threshold/tie behavior, not an alternative production election implementation."], "findings": [], "status": "exact listed source07 inventory complete with source-specific nonapplicability and caller qualification"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-057", "at": "2026-10-22T20:42:03.975132+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope025_index": 107, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/food.rs", "sha256": "e9a7252b38f6d0bd82da3c638879dbc08ad1bf8f5ab5ad154da759878366ffcf", "actual_EOF": 848, "material_ranges": [[7, 10], [171, 179], [309, 338]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-025.json#/files/107"}, {"scope025_index": 927, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/food.rs", "sha256": "e9a7252b38f6d0bd82da3c638879dbc08ad1bf8f5ab5ad154da759878366ffcf", "actual_EOF": 848, "material_ranges": [[1, 848]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-025.json#/files/927"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed Native current03 camera-support/contracts-013.json#food-raw-state-and-explicit-normalization actual fullPR848 incl all tests, not Camera165 metadata alone; original bounded P16 CAMERA-ADM03-089 facts compared. Fresh PR1-155/340-590 and scoped P16 constants/type/309-338; REG009 then fresh P16 exact156-170/195-215/247-307 (earlier broad companion context explicitly uncredited). Complete actual same-role PR/P16 diffs reviewed for every P16 material range, not wholeP16. Fresh supporting current PR/P16 item_catalog1-44 and P16 projection1-122 from053 establish static once-initialized read-only catalogue boundary; parent full-source07 accounting remains separate.", "contracts": ["FOOD_CATALOG LazyLock is a read-only projection of the process-immutable ItemCatalogue, not another independently authored food table. IDs/name/mass/nutrition/value/growth/cooking/flavor/quality all copy the same source entry together265-307. No supported live source mutation/hot reload is defined by these APIs, so a missing invalidation key for hypothetical file editing is not a current cache defect. FoodDefinition copies may be used as historical snapshots; mutable forged records remain admission concerns.", "FoodClass is reclassified from retained schema string via twelve-key match271-284. The complete food class vocabulary is duplicated between a raw textual schema/build gate and this closed enum/mapping; currently they agree. Canonical retained catalogue can carry the typed class through this boundary; raw authored DTO text remains valid input evidence. This is an owner/propagation strengthening opportunity, not a current invalid class or an assertion every display label must equal a stable wire key.", "DonenessOutcome carries progress, calorie factor, microbial kill progress and quality penalty for one retrieval epoch, computed together31-81. These are distinct effects of heat/time, and Stew/Roast intentionally have different post-ready policies from pan/oven. Ingredient safety time, overhead reduction, nutrition retention and quality tier do not represent the same derived fact merely because skill affects each.", "Initial microbial concentration is deterministic source initialization; later anchor/time/growth calculate current concentration on demand. Raw concentration versus total microbial load, final mass, and per-ingredient contribution loads use different physical units/purposes. Cooked survival scales contributions relative to the same raw/surviving ratio; a retained decomposition must stay coordinated in actual DB recipes, not certified by these raw functions.", "Flavor potency coordinates and final subjective/objective quality are different physical/observer values; preparation action, material preparation and terminal cooked-meal policy differ. is_cookable_ingredient exact cooked_meal identity is a semantic classification dependency that must match the actual cooked output producer; full DB source inventory remains separate rather than assuming all FoodPreparation variants imply identical pipeline eligibility.", "Travel calorie deficit and explicit fullness-limit meal consumption are different decisions delegated to one respective policy; retained_component scales each material component rather than separately storing a total. Existing tests assert boundaries as regression evidence only."], "findings": [], "qualification": "Existing named-source raw/checked admission, factory provenance and nonfinite policies preserved. P16 current scope credits only constants7-10/CookingMethod171-179/helpers309-338; REG009 new definitions/projection ranges are additional fresh current07 proof awaiting global reconciliation. No other P16 body or excluded tests credited.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one typed retained food class and one source catalogue; derive immutable projections from it. Preserve different doneness effects, concentration-versus-load units, snapshot epochs and native malformed-input policies; actual DB updates must coordinate all material components.", "status": "exact source07 inventory complete within listed limits; new local role pending global metadata"}
