e_violation represents the adapter classification used for stealth exposure; direct resolve is pure. Global privilege and local restriction must not be conflated. Actual DB adapter must derive the same legality input consistently; this Core file alone does not prove browser authority or persistent cache invalidation.", "ForageLicenseDecision privately binds actor/source/question digest/decision together and verifies exact question purpose. build_forage_plan724-747 rederives expected legality from exact matching bound decisions and local restriction before accepting supplied legality. Redundant input is immediately checked against its source, rather than two unchecked live policies. Requirements bools are external snapshot evidence, not independent copies of world state validated merely by naming them authoritative.", "Resolution contains the actual sampled yield and stealth outcome for one interval. build_plan uses exact realized elapsed time; an interruption clears yield and retains stealth exposure. CommitResolution.permits_yield and cleared yields are coordinated at805-811, not two independently mutable normal outputs. Requested duration, realized elapsed and terminal boundary describe different epochs and may differ intentionally.", "Sampling uses a single purpose->StreamId mapping and byte-framed source/item identity; fractional discovery, base yield and stealth are independent decisions. The single deterministic stream depends on exactly those inputs; no cached random result is reused after a source change. Normal positive upper bounds use the actual resource table and resolve validation; original nonzero API cleanup is not an extra07 authority finding.", "PreparationPlanAuthority custody/revision/transition/tool and rights decision are distinct gates. Rights question binds object/actor/place, plan effect records accepted action/revision/display name at one epoch. AttemptWait always occurs, completion effect only with planner completion, and public preview is a deliberate information-limited projection. Current source does not prove reducer revalidation or persistence update atomicity; those parents remain separately inventoried.", "IngredientPreparationAction requested Cut/Grind differs from resulting material state. stable_id/parse share the same constants, so no duplicated spelling source. Stable hash byte1/2 and definition namespace string are distinct protocol coordinates; ordinary Serde variant names intentionally differ from lowercase request parser. Physical work base/tool/skill constants have one owning timing helper; cooking safety factors are different effects from preparation work duration."], "findings": [], "qualification": "No actual extra authority or hidden current seasonal/market policy proven in these Core contracts. Keep original admission/rights provenance findings and exact lower shared-plan/source-boundary dependencies; no current03 clearance reused.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain typed source/action identities through actual adapter state, derive legality and complete membership lists from one intended owner, coordinate completion projections from one time result, and preserve distinct local law/global licenses/raw rejected evidence.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventories complete with explicit receiving-parent dependencies"}
