.json#/files/1179"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh P16 reducer_error100 and reputation331 complete current source incl original tests; complete actual PR scoped reducer100/reputation1-280 diffs empty, roles separately compared. Fresh exact currently material DB P1685-356 and PR74-179/258-361 recipients; complete corresponding actual body differences empty. Premature displayed nonmaterial DB lines explicitly uncredited QUAL078. P16 local read tail357-360 only freshly read after REG013.", "contracts": ["ReducerErrorCode is canonical behavior; string transport prefix encodes it and prose detail is independently changeable presentation. Current as_str and FromStr independently list the same nine wire words; their current bijection holds but the inverse vocabulary repeats one fact, supporting F010 migration to one canonical key definition. Prefix scanning is intentional transport wrapping, not parsing detail prose. Existing original test roster is detection, not a replacement authority owner.", "Reputation fame and infamy are independent accumulated reactions, not a net score stored twice. Reaction modifier/net are derived on query. Explicit population estimate is preferred whenever nonzero; coarse population level supplies only the documented zero-estimate fallback, so no equality invariant or demand to overwrite one from the other. Distance map and priority queue are coordinated transient shortest-path state, with stale queue entries explicitly rejected against current best distance128; destination/weight arrays are derived in one order and bounded to24.", "Core contributions produces origin plus terminal spill from one action. In actual DB record_event258-348, nonnegative request and origin existence are checked, existing event ID exits, contributions computed from current road/population snapshot then immutable event and each capped aggregate are written in the reducer transaction. Aggregate values are cumulative projections, not a second action source; record_event