nt Allowed/Unavailable/Refused are specific contextual decisions, not simply global speaker type; prose cannot grant their authority. Review markers are author attestations, not cached automatic verse truth.", "F016: Four SharedCharacterInteraction markers repeat exact mechanics: Combat iff StartCombat, InvestigationInformation iff Information effect, ItemInventoryTransfer iff grant/consume/currency effect, RelationshipPersonality iff nonempty personality. Validator523-568 checks both directions before immutable publication, so current installed values agree. Derive these summaries from typed choices rather than independently authoring and retaining equality-checked copies. ConversationContact/Treatment lack that derivation and remain explicit; requires_treatment168 actually queries the independent Treatment marker.", "Outcome tags, quest reward eligibility and provenance are distinct authored semantic intent, not automatically identical to effects. Four combat payloads retain different consequences; actual outcome adapter maps stalemate to defeat and avoided to escape intentionally. Top-level combat rewards are rejected in favor of outcome-specific owners. Human result/deed/label describes action but does not implement effects.", "Choice distinctness intentionally compares requirements/checks/effects/transition, ignoring prose and personality-only variation for material-choice quota. This is the stated quotient, not a requirement to merge distinct output facts. Ignore intentionally permits bounded TravelDelay; do not derive complete absence of consequences from its ID or erase delay. Shared/narrative/blocked declarations describe authority audit boundary; live reducers retain checks."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F016"], "qualification": "No installed duplicate marker disagreement or normal bad action claimed; migration candidate justified by exact iff invariant and immutable validation. P16production1-1039 only, originaltests1041+ excluded. Live permission/effect reducer roles remain separate.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Derive only equivalent mechanical action summaries from one typed mechanics owner; retain explicit nonderivable interaction intent, source diagnostic paths, error ordering and immutable acceptance. Preserve separate human/provenance/outcome/trigger roles and deterministic lexical selection; no new fallback.", "status": "exact source07 inventories complete with migration finding"}
