source_proof": "Fresh all P16population667 incl originaltests in three completed chunks, Age64/demographics36/security61/property226; complete actual PR counterpart body diffs empty and current07roles compared. Fresh P16economy1-181/233-250 plus PR196-232/251-330; personally consumed actual Nativecamera-support/contracts-017 settlement-storefront-current-membership-predicates completePR552 production/tests facts and prioractual CAMERA-ADM03-105/103/109/112. Prior admissibility verdict not used as current07credit.", "contracts": ["Economy tabs are freshly derived from actual service/profile flags, keep availability and installed organization chapters, then exact same list membership is used by visible_npc_tab and npc_location_is_navigable. No retained second navigable list or separate cached existence boolean is created. Service logical IDs, physical locations (merchants vs market, weapons vs forge) and human labels intentionally differ. Organization chapter and actual standalone building availability are different relations. Shared action-service location/predicate owns Inn/Temple, rest selection derives Temple preference then Inn else None.", "PR storefront_stocks derives sale policy from current profile service+stock and catalogue tag/capability, with explicit travel_provision exception before stock membership. Passed CatalogKind is a coarse caller-supplied classification; it is not admitted merely by this predicate. Book capability/category and ingredient/medication are related different classifications; tag precedence is explicit. No new duplicated live stock-authority bug established. Exact caller membership/kind gates remain separate original source roles.", "AgeBand current chronology classification has one for_years map with deliberate12/13/18/60 boundaries and distinct wire/case-sensitive stablevariant protocols. Population input SomeAge is the owning plan final selection and deliberately bypasses the random age relation before all age-dependent facts; None invokes weighted choice. This is explicit planning precedence, not two simultaneously competing age pickers. Provider status/location/profession override are generation inputs describing different causal roles, not a blanket proof of current actor age/occupation authority.", "Population produces one profile and seven contemporaneous RelationDecision observations in the same function. ServiceProvider enum is coarse profession while the chosen authored override string is deliberately detailed provenance; do not rewrite decision string to enum serviceprovider and lose service role. Weights/plausibility/curation/optional bridge describe how a decision was generated, not current continuously recalculated profile authority. requires_bridge differs from optional flavor evidence: only required bridges control eligibility; a recorded optional bridge can remain explanatory. Profile public mutation/Serde remains raw snapshot admission qualification, no actual live consumer inferred to trust stale decisions.", "Population independent relation streams derive from same seed but separate relation IDs; stable_hash/building seed serve separate source-coordinate purposes. Copying a Seed and a settlement ID in a generated catalogue is input provenance checked against actual deterministic generator, not proof of two mutable RNG authorities. Current candidate sorting/weights/returned decision derive from one filtered vector; duplicate stable decisions rejected and no second roster survives.", "Property identity is a settlement-scoped physical building composite, distinct from tenancy/player/household identity. Catalogue validate recomputes identity from actual scope/building, compares generation seed/population, and checks one first-in-order reserve per tier via private shrinking supply; allocate validates again before producing assignments. Thus raw copied identity/market flags may disagree but that mismatch is rejected at current accepted allocation path, not established normal stale accepted property authority. A canonical structured composite can avoid repeated raw identity coordinates while preserving native serialization and required building access.", "Housing population is requested settlement target; home capacity is supply; allocated residents are actual grouped assignments. They are intentionally unequal during reservation and greedy fit, and final allocation rejects remaining population rather than maintaining a second silent current population. Reserve flag distinguishes explicit bounded market supply from occupied/nonreserve capacity; preserve one reserve per tier and first-home ordering rather than infer all homes of a tier reserved. Legal ownership, household grouping and physical property are orthogonal facts.", "Simulation bootstrap compiled capability and presented request are distinct principals of comparison, not duplicate current secret authorities. None compiled state always rejects; expected format validation then byte comparison determines authorization, no retained authorized boolean or database fallback exists here. MAX_SIMULATION_SKILL_HOURS is one policy constant; actual per-field fixture/reducer gates remain their own scopes, no proof that every scalar ingress uses it."], "findings": [], "qualification": "P16 economy current role1-181/233-250 only; original recorded183-200 following CatalogKind/item_stock_category prefix was explicitly context in prioractual105 and receives no whole-helper credit. PR full552 actual supplier includes those roles independently. Property226 only declares external test module, no childtestbody credit. Full original tests in other listed leaves/population read source only; no execution.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep canonical chronology and actual service predicates through consumers; derive current classifications from owners and retain immutable decision/provenance snapshots separately. Composite property identity can expose structured coordinates through one owner instead of duplicated raw strings, preserving validated scope/seed/reserves/capacity/group semantics. Do not merge actual occupation/age/location/authorization with explanatory labels or generation history.", "status": "exact listed source07 inventories complete with explicit scope and authority qualifications"}
