0"}, {"scope032_index": 146, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/social/claim_resolution.rs", "sha256": "adfd512aab47db7827260717ebbb91d41706b4668372a0137510c9d3df796dcc", "actual_EOF": 69, "material_ranges": [[1, 69]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-032.json#/files/146"}, {"scope032_index": 1001, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/social/claim_resolution.rs", "sha256": "adfd512aab47db7827260717ebbb91d41706b4668372a0137510c9d3df796dcc", "actual_EOF": 69, "material_ranges": [[1, 69]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-032.json#/files/1001"}, {"scope032_index": 147, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/social/witness.rs", "sha256": "14db851b00491a104efa4d272f24ef1285b357a92dbd0f875a109a27033fd735", "actual_EOF": 233, "material_ranges": [[1, 233]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-032.json#/files/147"}, {"scope032_index": 1002, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/social/witness.rs", "sha256": "14db851b00491a104efa4d272f24ef1285b357a92dbd0f875a109a27033fd735", "actual_EOF": 233, "material_ranges": [[1, 233]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-032.json#/files/1002"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual Nativecamera-support/contracts-012 ALL four source-specific groups proving fullPR1909/264/60/69/233 bodies/tests and prior actual Camera130/114. Complete current P16/PR body differences empty; each current07role reanalyzed. Fresh P16social1-181/182-340/600-823/900-1041; original truncated940-1041 recovered in full before credit. Fresh action1-168/witness1-195/claim69/affinity60, actual personality1-168 canonical enum declarations from already inventoried067. Other full source/test facts are explicitly source-backed Native narratives, not fresh literal full-display claims.", "contracts": ["Directional affinity and symmetric familiarity encode independent relationship facts: canonical_pair orders IDs for shared time but never orders directional affinity. Decay uses anchor/time then derives current affinity, and realized delta is actual post-clamp change distinct from requested modifier. Family/party divisor is a current query input, not a persisted second familiarity balance in this scope. Do not collapse two directions or history to one current scalar.", "ClaimAssessment direction and strength are a coordinated noisy perception from demeanor/Insight/roll, explicitly not factual truth/confidence. Challenge factual accuracy is a separate actual truth input; success is conditioned on false claim while true claim and weak failed challenge use same nondisclosing output. Attempt success and captured UsefulAnswer are request-time observation vs retained semantic result; from_challenge translates once. Captured realized affinity delta is historical effect after clamping and must not follow later relationship decay.", "Actual WitnessClaimResolution presence is documented sole resolved-state owner; no extra resolved boolean/time/sentinel appears in these pure source records. Public mutation/decoder routes remain earlier03 provenance qualification; current07 does not infer DB immutability from a struct name. Actual committed DB receipt/retry ownership is separately scoped, not cleared from this pure record.", "Social topic eligibility, actor personality availability, permission professional/authority fit and actual roll success are independent checks with different inputs. Description uses closed action/topic, no free morale prose reclassification. Prayer devotion/intention is human presentation, while religion/topic and actual conviction derive numerical profile; mechanics never parse those labels. Risk in ordinary profile is copied from action but caller may intentionally supply resolved prayer/bedside risk, so profile.risk and base action.risk are different stage-specific facts, not unconditional duplicate current authority.", "Automatic candidate chooses current action from supplied context-specific skill/fit/resolved risk; no cached best action or second membership list persists. Ordinary/with_resolved_risk constructors clarify fixed default versus resolved context. SocialOutcome succeeded/morale/affinity/revealed_belief are coordinated one-call result projections, and revealed flag derives Listen/Reflect behavior; no independently mutable retained status machine or normal stale cache established here. Truth, belief, performance and realized outcome must remain separate.", "F010 support: SocialActionKind reducer_value and ClaimChallengeApproach stable_id manually mirror the same actual Serde keys; FromStr already delegates to Serde, so do not claim a separate hand-written parser. Rally command/Reframe deception are intentional wire words, not aliases to delete. One canonical key definition can emit actual request keys, while labels/skill names remain separate.", "F011 support: PersonalityAxis legal_values/value_label/neutral-code tables repeat canonical personality enum member/code association, and parse embeds a complete15axis roster. Current declarations align: Conscience/Inclination four, others three, Presentation ambiguous neutral-code1 while Inclination has no neutral. These policies must derive from or be explicitly associated with canonical typed axis values, preserving per-axis meaning. diagnoser actually consumes legal_values and actual rawtruevalue, so association matters; earlier03 NativeF005 debug-only invalid-input gap retained as separate cause, not a new07 current wrong diagnosis claim."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010 support: canonical social request keys", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011 support: personality axis/member/code mapping"], "qualification": "No actual wrong cached belief/current DB mutation/illegal runtime code claimed. Earlier03 source-backed raw127 precondition gap distinct from current correctly matching duplicated policy tables. Full source evidence grouped only