{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-087", "at": "2026-10-22T21:19:35.521496+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope032_index": 148, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_action.rs", "sha256": "4f2173f2f102e0e788b91604fc81d48d23f9af85ccb8f0102681c59fae9812a9", "actual_EOF": 1209, "material_ranges": [[1, 714]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-032.json#/files/148"}, {"scope032_index": 1006, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_action.rs", "sha256": "4f2173f2f102e0e788b91604fc81d48d23f9af85ccb8f0102681c59fae9812a9", "actual_EOF": 1209, "material_ranges": [[1, 1209]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-032.json#/files/1006"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed current actual Nativecontract-groups-070 pure-strategic-action group fullPR1209/tests; freshly read all current P16production1-714 in complementary completed ranges, complete actual PR counterpart production diff empty and current roles compared independently. Additional P16 ranges previously prospectively scoped via NativeREG055/CameraREG050; no freshbody outside allowed ranges.", "contracts": ["The module explicitly treats plan as evidence, never state authority. Domain reducers gather actual state and transactionally apply after fresh replan. Current/private AuthoritativeActionPlan stores immutable coordinates/snapshot/requirements/time/calculation together; no mutable getter or decoder supplies a second update path. PublicPlan request/elapsed/completed/preview are freshly derived from that one plan in public_plan, not independently retained completion authority.", "validate_commit checks attempt request/action/binding, prior full provenance for idempotent replay, provenance digest vs plan snapshot, exact current snapshot, and ready fresh replan snapshot. It then compares full coordinates/provenance/requirements/time/calculation. This explicit generation binding/recalculation justifies snapshot/calculation cache for this pure API. A fresh current source revision with stale effect calculation cannot pass simply because one Boolean stayed true. Actual reducer source-authenticity and all dependency coverage in domain snapshot remain caller-specific source inventories, not certified here.", "RequirementCheck.satisfied is a captured reducer evaluation of structured requirement, not universally derived from that enum alone. Capability value/revision are source observation coordinates; authority binding and input digest identify different authority/provenance roles, not an authorization proof from raw32bytes. build_plan rejects failed checks but does not independently authenticate them, exactly as documented. No duplicate universal permission engine should be inferred.", "Target place/fixture place and context place must agree when they describe the same physical coordinate; private ActionCoordinates constructor checks these relations and tools unique IDs once, then no mutation route. Optional context fixture and actual target may express different roles at the same place, so do not collapse them solely because current examples agree. Custody transfer expected-from vs destination are pre/post coordinates, not competing current custody; each actualObjectCustody check uses same canonical owner.", "TimeResolution requested/start/end/elapsed/outcome are coordinated output facts from resolve_time, not independent current clocks. elapsed is derived from selected endpoint; requested duration remains positive while realized0 is valid after terminal/interruption clipping. Exact terminal/interruption/MAX precedence explains why completed cannot always be inferred solely from elapsed==requested. Public-plan completed projects TimeOutcome::Completed; raw public result construction remains earlier admission qualification, no normal stale result generation.", "Contextual refusal/allowed/unavailable and reason retain different permissions; emergency fills only absent nonself permission, explicit refusal wins. Hostile accepts-demand vs offers-surrender test different predicates, so those Booleans are independent outcomes, not interchangeable score thresholds. Negotiated withdrawal refusal changes no authority and recomputes from current inputs; no persistent refusal cache is created."], "findings": [], "qualification": "P16 production1-714 only;715blank andtests716+ excluded for current direct role. PRfull1209 incloriginaltests only actualNative fullbody narrative source facts. No domain snapshot completeness or external binding authentication theorem; those sources remain separately inventoried.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve one immutable plan generation with full fresh-replan binding and domain-owned live state, derive public preview/status at actual port. Keep requested/realized/terminal clock meanings, explicit refusal/emergency and pre/post custody distinct. Never turn plan/prose/hash into current state authority or preserve a redundant mutable completion field.", "status": "exact current source07 inventories complete with explicit actual-domain receiver limits"}
