est does not keep both Boolean and enum. Raw public requests remain requests, not current inventory/custody snapshots or stock authority.", "MerchantStorefrontRoute private enum+location pair is constructed in one parse match and has no mutation/decoder. It is a coordinated immutable projection, but its six logical service-key/physical-location associations repeat Storefront.service_id and economy visibility descriptor facts. F010 maintenance support: use one canonical typed Storefront descriptor/inverse with an explicit commerce-enabled subset rather than separate strings lists. Herbalist rejection is intentional actual original test436 and must remain; logical merchants differs physical market, so do not collapse their protocols.", "Unique provider picks exactly one candidate then nonzero checked identity; no retained provider-count cache. It does not authenticate current NPC membership/availability, which actual caller must gather. TradeQuantity wraps canonical ItemQuantity and exposes only count; it does not additionally retain zero/valid flags. Actual ownership/item association is not inferred from numeric identifier spelling."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010 support: six merchant key/location associations with explicit Herbalist exclusion"], "qualification": "Current duplicate maps agree and private route cannot independently mutate. Migration support only; no wrong current sale/provider/route or global funds-order defect. Original tests source only, not executed.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Canonical typed service descriptor supplies logical keys, physical locations and deliberate commerce subset; preserve Herbalist rejection and distinct namespaces. Retain line records and payment variant presence as sole representation, exact authorization-first order per real funding contract, current authority gathering and complete input vector rejection.", "status": "exact current source07 inventories complete with migration support"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-093", "at": "2026-10-22T21:23:38.502046+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope033_index": 152, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_presence.rs", "sha256": "2eeea5c9831e10b7c5d51d0d3f61b0093ce8c682bd0994d2c94de50aa3354a52", "actual_EOF": 662, "material_ranges": [[1, 365]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/152"}, {"scope033_index": 1011, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_presence.rs", "sha256": "2eeea5c9831e10b7c5d51d0d3f61b0093ce8c682bd0994d2c94de50aa3354a52", "actual_EOF": 662, "material_ranges": [[1, 662]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/1011"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh exact currentP16strategic_presence1-365; personally consumed actual prior Camera116 and Rootcontracts.jsonl#ROOT-ADM-G033 actual fullPR662 incloriginaltestsource facts. Actual complete scopedP16/PR1-365 bodydifference empty, current07 authority/basis/frontier/snapshot/suppression roles independently compared; no P16test367+ orchildcontext body credit.", "contracts": ["StrategicPresence carries canonical place plus explicit observer frontier and provenance basis, not a competing target personal clock. are_co_present requires same frontier+exactplace; it never upgrades coarse settlement to venue or forces targetclock synchronization. Basis explains distinct source proof paths and cannot in general be derived only from place kind, since same exact venue may be selected or scheduled. Private immutable fields/no codec/setters bind captured place/frontier/basis once.", "ScheduledStrategicPresence caches remaining minutes at that captured frontier from the same actual DailyPresenceWindow query. Its nested presence cannot mutate and remaining getter does not accept a new frontier, so this is an immutable observation, not a cached current schedule duration needing every live time update. Later query/retention by domain adapters must honor its captured frontier; no normal contrary use established here.", "Case context expectedID/revision and actualID/revision are request snapshot vs authoritative current evidence; equality is the acceptance condition, not two independent mutable currentcontextowners. Residence owner/household role derives from subject vs owner once, but physical effective occupancy is independently required. Ownership alone intentionally has no presence constructor. Each factory consumes independently gathered currentlive/active/occupied flags as documented; actual authority of those flags remains DB source responsibility.", "Outbreak context suppression and health suppression are independent facts: remediation ends contextual constraint before recovery while health remains affected, and death yields health=true/context=false. Retained historical contracted/recovery/remediation endpoints are evaluated at observer time; latest recovery/death must not rewrite earlier projection. Do not merge these Booleans into one hidden availability flag because both currently block one schedule query.", "Raw window endpoints represent a repeating local-day interval; methods derive remaining/startwait from canonical calendar rather than independently storing nextstart/remaining. Endpoint1440 and overnight intervals are deliberate; remaining0 is not an admitted active slot. Personal-minute epoch and local-day minute are separate units/frame. Actual private presence is shaped by fallible use, not by the raw schedule type name."], "findings": [], "qualification": "No current captured snapshot reused at a wrong frontier or normal stale remainingminutes proven. Input authority authentication and private canonical place grammar remain their own direct source inventories; Root/Native earlier actual definitions supply no blanket current07 coverage. PRalloriginaltests facts from actualRootfull662 proof, no runtimeexecution.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain immutable captured-frontier semantics and one actual schedule query; keep canonical place/basis provenance, independent context/health historical suppression and request/current revision comparison. Propagate actual domain authority through factories without introducing a parallel target-clock or coarse-venue fallback.", "status": "exact source07 inventories complete with frontier-cache justification"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-094", "at": "2026-10-22T21:27:54.731001+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope033_index": 153, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_schedule.rs", "sha256": "ace0cbb5e974ca6f612bccd06c12f1f75b4e6e17c076d01989c01e2bcf282146", "actual_EOF": 1363, "material_ranges": [[1, 170], [184, 239]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/153"}, {"scope033_index": 1013, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_schedule.rs", "sha256": "ace0cbb5e974ca6f612bccd06c12f1f75b4e6e17c076d01989c01e2bcf282146", "actual_EOF": 1363, "material_ranges": [[1, 1363]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/1013"}, {"scope033_index": 2675, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_schedule/allocation.rs", "sha256": "031ee090102b5cc2ed9889b336ac1144ef7eb705cacc6fee37cbe8e7f6bafd0e", "actual_EOF": 364, "material_ranges": [[1, 364]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/2675"}, {"scope033_index": 1014, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_schedule/allocation.rs", "sha256": "031ee090102b5cc2ed9889b336ac1144ef7eb705cacc6fee37cbe8e7f6bafd0e", "actual_EOF": 364, "material_ranges": [[1, 364]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/1014"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh P16 schedule1-170/184-239 and registered REG015171-183 after registration (material171-182 only); fresh completeP16allocation364 incloriginaltests. Complete actual current scoped PR counterpart diffs empty and new/current07roles independently compared. Personally consumed actual Native023 schedule raw-training group fullPR1363/tests and actualNative049 P16same-contract facts. Fresh PRproduction240-683 completes all remaining current training/curriculum/activity functions; originalPRtests685+ facts source-backed actualNativefull1363. Fresh already-globally-scoped P16DBsettlement_rest285-370/reproduction338-419/stationary195-263 are supporting actual receiving bodies only, no wholeDBsource coverage from this packet.", "contracts": ["Canonical saved daily allocation differs from location-effective projection. ValidatedSchedule is immutable private underlying saved schedule; effective_at derives a fresh contextual allocation from actual availability without consuming caller RNG or mutating saved plan, and preserves reading. When there are no available weighted alternatives, blocked time becomes Leisure rather than a cached replacement default. Preview/execution call same deterministic pure function/seed, so separate preview state is not another retained allocation authority.", "F017 same connected Root03F005 graph: DailySchedulePlan activities10 and two OrganizationAllocation minute owners duplicate organization allocation. validate_daily_allocation118-130 sums only supplied ten-array and independently parses two tuple amounts, without requiring corresponding values equal or summing actual tuple owners. Actual DB stationary204-252 uses caller order labor/prayer/thievery/raiding/combat/carousing/socializing/apprenticeship/practice/reading, so duplicate positions are7/8 (zero-based), NOT4/5. Normal actual caller supplies same downtime fields to both and reconstructs persisted org minutes/IDs from tuple owners, deliberately discarding array7/8; therefore currentnormalwriter coherent, while public helper contract can retain disagreeing validated sources. Public literal bypass is prior03qualification, not sole explanation for constructor mismatch.", "SkillHours fields are one source DTO, values32 derived reporting projection with its own stable report order, not necessarily Skill::ALL order. is_finite checks all scalar values AND all direct family hours rather than trusting totals alone. F011 support: SKILL_COUNT32, explicit values order, nine weapon-position zip and thirteen combat-training roster repeat complete semantic bindings; current actual mappings align. Derive access/order from one typed definition preserving report order, family aggregation and current deterministic targets, rather than silently reuse unrelated enum ordering.", "Learning hours are updated only in their typed target fields by apply_direct_training. Socializing splits one budget charm/insight/deception by sociability/transparency; these are independent personality facts and remaining halves are computed together, no copied budgetbalance retained. Combat weights combine actual equipped leaves with defense demand; shield block and balance-based blocking are different sources under explicit precedence, not a raw mirror of one weapon balance. Fixed curriculum helper repeats canonical Skill wire-to-field mapping while Religion/Bestiary/Written have intentionally separate family storage, supporting F010/F011 strengthening without merging family totals into scalarhours.", "Leisure minutes126-136 and spans151-182 intentionally project different questions. Actual settlement_rest313/328 consumes pro-rata integer recovery budget for injury preview/settlement; reproduction381 consumes exact absolute end-of-day Leisure spans for physical spouse overlap/dedup. Counts can differ within partial day because rate-based recovery and canonical overlap ordering are different contracts, explicitly documented. Do not assert two competing samefact authorities solely from their shared Leisure name. Both derive from supplied schedule+absolute interval, no persistent fraction cache.", "Fatigue delta, morale-earned duration and Leisure hours are coherent output projections of the same settlement_leisure_outcome calculation. Current fatigue is cleared before morale accrues; projected changes are not a second current fatigue pool. Baseline waking/labor fatigue add into the general reservoir, and surplusLeisure affects morale only after clearance. These interval measures/stage-specific rates must not be equated or erase intentional signed recovery/zero behavior.", "ActivityOutcome economic/risk/hours fields are computed once from schedule/input interval, no independent authoritative per-activity gold balance retained. Public outputs/defaults remain raw admission/operation qualifications, not a claim every arbitrary serialized record is an immutable accepted snapshot. Organization current membership/practice policy is explicitly supplied by DB and distinct from quarter-hour/day allocation validity."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F017 (same Root03F005 schedule-owner graph)", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010/F011 source-specific roster/key support"], "qualification": "REG015 original171-183 effective171-182,183blankexcluded. P16schedule other240+ not scoped/credited; PRfull1363 separately scoped/read via actualNativefact+freshproduction. Earlier message wrong4/5 corrected before finding; exact actualindices7/8 recorded. No normalbadpersisted schedule or miscounted spouse/recovery runtime claimed.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Canonical schedule plan must own each organization minutes exactly once with associated ID, derive native ten-array/report projection and sum actual retained allocation, then retain private accepted aggregate. Remove parallel input/retained duplicate minutes rather than add compatibility correction. Preserve original native field order, membership checks, saved/effective distinction, deterministic redistribution/reading, rate recovery vs overlap policy, and complete skill/curriculum mapping from canonical descriptors.", "status": "exact current source07 inventories complete with finding; REG015 tail pendingglobal"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-095", "at": "2026-10-22T21:29:25.435514+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope033_index": 154, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_state.rs", "sha256": "b704a73eded4ae15345f15781c8f117d919e7f97e047e08e31bb068c912072f8", "actual_EOF": 573, "material_ranges": [[1, 573]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/154"}, {"scope033_index": 1015, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_state.rs", "sha256": "b704a73eded4ae15345f15781c8f117d919e7f97e047e08e31bb068c912072f8", "actual_EOF": 573, "material_ranges": [[1, 573]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/1015"}, {"scope033_index": 155, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_state/vocabulary.rs", "sha256": "87baee6fe0607a7000600790507d24701630db771b54e221ce571cd98db34c13", "actual_EOF": 104, "material_ranges": [[1, 104]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/155"}, {"scope033_index": 1016, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_state/vocabulary.rs", "sha256": "87baee6fe0607a7000600790507d24701630db771b54e221ce571cd98db34c13", "actual_EOF": 104, "material_ranges": [[1, 104]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/1016"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh completeP16strategic_state573 and vocabulary104 incl originalinline tests, actual entirePRcounterpartdiffs empty and every current07state/status/payload/provenance role independently compared. Prioractual Camera113 only source facts, not verdict.", "contracts": ["Typed parsed states replace correlated flat status/Option matrices with one payload-owning sum; no separate status is retained inside ContractState/MissionAttemptState/CommitmentState/CourtshipState/MarriageState/PregnancyState. Parsers compare raw discriminant/payload before returning a coordinated state. Thus these transient parsed views are not another independently editable current DB authority. Flat queryable storage adapters must continue using one canonical state and exact projection; downstream DB writes/mutations are separately scoped and not cleared by successful parse.", "Paid requires accepted+paid chronology and payload; Withdrawn preserves prior acceptance history independently of present withdrawal. Commitment Fulfilled/Expired/Ended each infer their fixed terminal reason from variant while Cancelled retains actual nonderivable reason; returned sum intentionally removes redundant fixed reasons. Preplanned effective minute and actual terminal minute need not be ordered for legitimate cancellation before future wedding. No new universal chronology rule inferred.", "Mission current binding identity and resolution/capture subject+custody revision have different roles. Parser checks binding pair shape then exact resolutionpayload; unbound randommissions valid, Failed/Cancelled may discard parsed binding in operational state while rawhistory can retain it. CustodyVersion is an all-u32 source revision, not a positive count or authoritative currentcustody byitself. Actual source association/current worldevent authority must be gathered by mission/custody adapters.", "Courtship Formal/Informal route is distinct from Active/Exposed/Ended lifecycle: route encodes approvedfather+dowry vs secrecy, state encodes current phase+termination. They often correlate but must not collapse. Marriage Widowed vs Ended retain distinct causes even though each has terminal timestamp. Pregnancy Born requires child+resolved together; actual conception/due/expected-child/parent association is outside this parser signature and cannot be inferred from state presence.", "Lifecycle vocabulary enums supply wire discriminants; parsed payload enums supply semantic aggregate state. This representation-stage distinction is intentional at a real flat storage boundary, not a reason to maintain duplicated live raw/payload owners through firstparty logic. If native encoding supports canonical sums, prefer canonical state until actual codec while deriving query views; exact DB adapter/API constraints need actual source evidence, not the comment alone. Existing03 publicvariant bypass qualification remains separate from whether normal parsed data is internally correlated.", "F010 support: CommitmentStatus.stable_id manually mirrors exact current Serde Rust-name words. One canonical key declaration can supply const transport projection; current words agree. Other lifecycle tags do not need invented lowercase aliases or conversion through displayprose. StateParseError carries stable typed failure role, human error text does not define lifecycle identity."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010 support: CommitmentStatus stable wire keys"], "qualification": "No current DB lifecycle mismatch/current illegal payment/birth invented. All originaltests source only, no newcases/tests/execution. Flat-storage/native adapter justification is bounded to its declared role, not a blanket exemption to erase typed state early; actual DB producers/consumers remain separate inventories.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep canonical aggregate state through operation and actual storage codec; derive discriminants/fixed reasons/query projections from it. Preserve prior acceptance/history, captured revisions, unbound missions, route/lifecycle independence and complete terminalpayload association. Remove independent rawstatus/payload update paths where actualDBscope shows them, without merging orthogonal facts or compatibility fallback.", "status": "exact source07 inventories complete with explicit DB receiving obligations"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-096", "at": "2026-10-22T21:30:43.050610+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope033_index": 156, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_time.rs", "sha256": "3af84cd2d335ef14e2ae8034345fcdcb999a93b4adeabd1a2e1f58beb780f57c", "actual_EOF": 860, "material_ranges": [[1, 860]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/156"}, {"scope033_index": 1017, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-core/src/strategic_time.rs", "sha256": "3af84cd2d335ef14e2ae8034345fcdcb999a93b4adeabd1a2e1f58beb780f57c", "actual_EOF": 860, "material_ranges": [[1, 860]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-033.json#/files/1017"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh fullP16production1-475 in completed1-250/251-300/300-475 chunks; personally consumed actualNative023 strategic-clock-day-and-raw-itinerary group full860 incloriginaltests and prioractual Camera043. CompleteactualPR/P16bodydiffempty; allcurrent07 clock/input/capturedsummary/forecast/state update/inverse policy roles independently compared. Originaltests476-860 actualNativefullsource facts, no claim freshliteraldisplay everytest.", "contracts": ["StrategicMinuteOfDay stores one normalized local-day position, derives night/wait from canonical daylight bounds; it is not a second absoluteclock authority. Hour/minute input maps once into same private field, from_absolute derives canonical modulo position. Defaultjourney daytime/nightdeparture and selectedwalking duration are different choices from globaldaylight: default20:00nightdeparture is not the only possiblenightclock. Calendar MINUTES_PER_DAY is canonical; MAX_WALKING_MINUTES_PER_DAY24*60 currently repeats it and can delegate that shared bound without changing policy.", "Forecast clones input members once and retains one evolving local simulation. Segment start/end fatigue summaries are historical observations, member_final is finalstate and member_maximum retains historicalmax; these are intentionally different facts. Per-member final/max cannot be reconstructed from aggregate segment averages alone. Memberorder is kept by same vector and zippedmaxupdates; no independent sorted memberidentity roster can drift during this pure call. All actual generation updates projected histories/totals in one function, no live cache survives external profile/config mutation through this API.", "Segment elapsed vs movement fields distinguish camp/time and travelprogress. Absoluteclock and accumulated movement have different units/roles, finalrequested movement can exceed completed total when truncated. truncated records actualsegmentguardexit, not a freely authored completioncertificate. Output totals derive actualcurrentabsolute/movement afterloop; publicmutableDTOs retain earlier03 correlation/operation qualifications, no normalstale forecast claimed. ExactMAXzero-progress operation concern at311-313 sentRoot04, no duplicate07finding or runtime assertion.", "TravelFatigueInputs/ItineraryMember names do not add another tactical fatigue pool: calories_used is strategicgeneralreservoir projection, capacity ratio is display/decision fraction, camp schedule determines recovery. Required restuntilclear vs planned campduration are different: forecastcan rest longer than minimum by walkingwindow policy. One-minute travelleg minimum lets exhaustedparty establishcamp; it is not a recalculated availabilityflag or forcedzero-durationfailure.", "Officialclock derives from native epoch+now under one rateconstant; inverse epoch helper delegates inverse-duration conversion with sameconstant. Native absolutewalltimestamp, elapsedofficialduration and absolutecalendaroffset differ; no persistent second currentclock is defined here. Developer epoch adjustment intentionally changes explicitdisposableworldsource, no production conversion-rate alternative.", "Natural healed_health and convalescence ask forwardstate versus inverse timetoclear; inverse binarysearch calls exactsameforwardfunction, preventing independently approximated recoverypolicy drift. Lunarphase and illumination differ as orbitalposition vs projectedbrightness; illumination folds periodicphase and is not duplicate phaseauthority. Trainingincrement derives dailyallocation\u00d7elapsed usingcalendarowner, does not retain skillhours independently."], "findings": [], "qualification": "Earlier03 rawNaN/negative inputs and nativef32limits preserved; no privatefinite forecast/sourceauthenticity guarantee from Some. ForecastMAXzero-progress potential is04operationquestion only, no wrongnormalitinerary/runclaim. Differentclocks/snapshotstages not collapsed.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "One canonical calendar/conversion/recoverypolicy with contextual inputs, coherent immutable forecast generation and separately retained historicalper-memberobservations. Derive redundant daybound from actualcalendar where warranted, preserve local/absoluteframes, routeprogressvselapsed/truncation, physicalrestdecision and nativeerror/saturation semantics.", "status": "exact source07 inventories complete with operation cross-reference and history justification"}
