independently mirrors currentkebab Serde keys (F010 support) while nativeSATSvariant spelling is a distinct actualtransport. Knife/Tailoring influence only existing correlations, not a second directoperativecheck. Selftreatment penalty is derived from actualsubjectrelationship input, not a separate retained skill or impairment pool.", "BloodInterval open_cuts are current evolving wounds; cut_days is integrated exposure needed for laterinfection, not duplicate currentcut magnitude. Actualsimulate constructs same-length vectors and updates them by oneindex; terminal marks simulatedboundary event, not a generic currentalive databasefield. PreviewDB425-435 captures elapsed/terminal from this exactfunction. Positive settlement478-565 uses samefunction, applies exposureintegrals/currentwounds, then actualset_blood_fraction and queries canonicalCharacter.alive rather than persisting a second terminalflag aslifeauthority. Zeroelapsedsettlement returns literalalive true withoutquery as no-op; caller living-state/precondition remains separate, no assertion itqueries deadactors correctly or currentbadcaller.", "Durablewounds vs projectedlimbhealth are different modelstages: actualDBsettle350-566 storesinjury then refreshesalllimbprojections, and explicitly leavesCharacterTimecommit to strategic timeowner. That fullfunction does not independently advanceclock. Bandage/stitch flags are distincttreatments and stitchedquality canbe0, so quality does not determinewhetherstitched. Embeddedprojectilepresence changeshealing but extractionDC refersoriginalhit depth/damage, not necessarilyrecomputedfromhealedwound. No inventedconstraint clearinghistoricaltreatmentmetadata whenflagchanges.", "Survival accumulateswetness, signedthermalstrain and remainingfrostbiteexposure as independenthistoricalstate. They shareweatherinput but eachhasdifferentdynamics; currentrain doesnotdeterminewetness and currenttemperature doesnotdetermine accumulatedstrain. thermalincapacitation isderivedfromstrain