ghistoricalform is deliberate snapshotprojection ratherthan independently editing livecloudclass. Rawpublic mutation/Serde remains earlier03 acceptedrecordqualification, not proof currentnormalgenerator publishes contradictions.", "Defaultweather is explicitlysyntheticclearweather withcurrentversion ratherthan recomputationatcell0/time0. Its use as fallback byactualconsumers must be separatelytraced for source-loss; defaultalone is not an alternative liveweatherclock/cache. Precipitationkind and intensity describekind+amount, independentlyusefuljointcoordinates; absence/zero relation belongs acceptedaggregate representation, not a demand to eliminateall numericamounts because a tag exists.", "Field lattice samplesderive samepurpose seed+rulesversion+signedlattice/time coordinates, interpolation is one mathematicalprojection; no mirroredweatherstateorsamplingordercache is retained. EachStreamId names a distinct owned stochasticpurpose; sharingworldseed doesnotmake pressure/moisture/temperature/sheer redundant. Exactnamedpurposes are replayprotocol, not humanlabels to normalize or genericclosedglobalregistry.", "Snowoverlay combines underlyingbiomecheck and snowcover ratherthan replacingallunderlyingterrain. snow_training_exposure splits discountedtime into base/snow parts in onefunction; those pairedminutes are budgetpartition, not two independentlyretained travelclocks. Winddirection usesactualpressuregradientwhile speedusesgradientmagnitudepluslowpressure; the sharedcause doesnotmakedirectionandstrength the samefact."], "findings": [], "qualification": "No actual stale route/rendercache or defaultfallbackmisuse asserted; directconsumer verification remains separate source inventories. Nativeextreme/rawdecoder/boundedaggregate issues remain current03/04/05 graphs. Originaltests sources only, no newtests/cases/assertions/runtime.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one versioned currentweathercalculation and immutablehistoricalsnapshots with explicitdependency bin