{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-102", "at": "2026-10-22T21:48:17.308418+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope035_index": 173, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability.rs", "sha256": "78dedc50a9d6ed96ba7f2bb88a85ff2c1f762296d8c7867acc99ea2e7aed98bd", "actual_EOF": 555, "material_ranges": [[1, 555]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/173"}, {"scope035_index": 174, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability/armor.rs", "sha256": "027f27a4294fe1574bcb9c7f376db05904519094f99936be09bcf66d5459b7e0", "actual_EOF": 103, "material_ranges": [[1, 103]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/174"}, {"scope035_index": 175, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability/combatant.rs", "sha256": "70185e2b1fa6e8e4ca7406ef36aa13c78ac0517e4ff69e7132036a63fcb7d2f2", "actual_EOF": 109, "material_ranges": [[1, 109]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/175"}, {"scope035_index": 176, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability/equipment_projection.rs", "sha256": "4a77425e90eace3b800f13d7f8e81ad2ba781bfda422b9a0decbba0de870eae9", "actual_EOF": 266, "material_ranges": [[1, 266]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/176"}, {"scope035_index": 177, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability/mass.rs", "sha256": "f041c03c0717ed86e0918d7002f19d097d720976ff98ad591ad80a10711add01", "actual_EOF": 31, "material_ranges": [[1, 31]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/177"}, {"scope035_index": 1076, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability.rs", "sha256": "3249a867a88a75dc29d514b94c01a89965aed2c037a05fdbcc9109b0bde179f6", "actual_EOF": 694, "material_ranges": [[1, 694]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/1076"}, {"scope035_index": 1077, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability/combatant.rs", "sha256": "afba3aaeb15ab41fe36d35221b5269a784098863766c03ad61ecd6532204bdbc", "actual_EOF": 111, "material_ranges": [[1, 111]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/1077"}, {"scope035_index": 1078, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/capability/equipment_projection.rs", "sha256": "f8b4732bf544887996ecaf8ffba647c00a6a7f4c4d88728b7b5ac094a689c6af", "actual_EOF": 85, "material_ranges": [[1, 85]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-035.json#/files/1078"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh full P16capability555+armor103+combatant109+equipment_projection266+mass31 read including originaltests sourceonly. Personally consumed actual CAMERA-ADM03-126 and Native camera-support/contracts-053 allthree source-specific substantive groups. Actual complete PR/P16 parent/combatant/projection bodydiff reviewed and every changed selection/physical input/cache/optional error route compared. Core capability270-328 fresh already-scoped receiving body. No samehash/oldverdict basis.", "contracts": ["CharacterCapability row stores derived evaluatedskills/melee/ranged/heavy/armor tiers/precision and derived autoresolve power. Sole local refresh evaluates all required rows, loads combatant and power before publishing, skips unchanged PartialEq row to prevent SSE feedback, updates physiology temporal presence around changed band. This is a real persistent projection cache with attribute/skill/limb/stats/disease/equipment/condition/time dependencies. Lazy-refresh comment alone does not establish every reader refreshes or every mutation invalidates; exact directreader/writer source obligations tracked below, not generic cache clearance.", "StrategicEquipment private load creates all hand selections, inventory IDs/sides, selected/melee/ranged variants and armor summaries within one read operation, no independent public mutation/Serde. PR copies whole selected Item records; P16 admits selected raw rows once then retains compact capability and combat views. Index/ID/side can be derived from owned hand selection, so greenfield representation may retain one selected entry rather than repeated parallel Option fields; actual sole factory currently coordinates them. More than one hand/mode legitimately has independent equipment, do not merge shield/melee/ranged into single mandatory weapon.", "P16 NativeHandSelections chooses weapon/melee/ranged/shield positions from same fixed hands; observe uses actual held occupancy. NativeHands::admit only selected weapon indices require checked reach, then computes actual instance geometry/errors before constructing retained output. Some ordinary hand items still support training profile without being active weapon. No different mutable live resolver discovered from selection copies alone. Current F009 base-selected mode versus actual combat mode receiver remains supported, not duplicated unique finding here.", "P16 armor wearable projection reconstructs one current effective Item from DB+condition, finds actual equipped placement and highest occupancy channel/order. Material and authored coverage come from immutable catalogue plus same inventory/placement; raw aggregate coverage vs spatial interval remain distinct contact questions. Insulation sums all layers, weatherproofing selects outer layer; two different physical properties intentionally query different combinations. No false equality requirement for those outputs. PR lower armor/mass helper bodies not independently read/covered as new variants by this packet; parent actualcall contract only, source frontier may require separate registration if new material.", "Drymass selects actual food lot mass first, else actual fraction or quantity, then instance weapon/holder mass or base fallback; water mass separate from drymass and added once. Unknown water query mapsInfinity conservatively (not measured0). Personal/fireplace custody filters define actual carried scope. Ammunition count is independent from consumed-per-shot history; no generic overlap claim. Raw sum bounds belong04/03; no invention of duplicate fatigue pool or tacticaltick DBpersistence.", "load_combatant combines strategic condition + actual blood volume before transient Combatant, rather than storing tacticalHP/position. Starting incapacity/blood conversion is projection of clinical/current strategic causes, not a second persistent battle authority. Religion maximum-effective generic summary differs explicitly from authoritative tradition-specific morale and total-direct combat summary; do not equate distinct questions.", "Actual fixed body/base weapon mass projections differ from condition/instance mass used elsewhere: F021 qualified policy inventory. Distal_headed stored computation supports existingF008, direct raw item substring arquebus classifier is further prose/ID mechanical selector requiring canonical projectile property at source rather than duplicate spelling authority; actual select currently maps Ball versus Arrowhead, no current wrong authored ID claim.", "Manual BodyPart/EquipmentBodyPart exhaustivematch owns boundary translation, not ordinal numerical equality. Hand sideindex0Left/1Right and NoneRight default occur only absent actual hand in output; no current side inconsistency in solefactory. Arraysarmor/ID/material/coverage are correlated one-factory snapshots; one per-part product can structurally retain correlation without independent parallel indexing."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F021"], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F008", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F009", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011"], "remaining_exact_dependencies": ["CharacterCapability directreaders Character source178/PR1079, clinical/corpse/social/encounters and web lazy reads must be compared to actual refresh triggers under their own queued07 source scopes. This packet makes no complete cache invalidation claim.", "PR armor/mass directlower sources absent current035 are not read/credited via P16 bodies; their already-known call role is explicit, new material body analysis requires prospective registry."], "connected_repair_acceptance": "One coherent body/selected-entry/per-part equipment projection with explicit physical-versus-catalogue policy. Own cache dependency/revision binding and derive onread or coordinate all changes; preserve snapshots, independent armor/clinical facts, failure ordering and transient strategic/tactical split. No source repairs/new assertions/tests/runtime.", "status": "exact8 source07 inventories with dependency obligations retained"}
