upancyproduction1-122; P16originaltest124-191 exactactual129 facts reused after semantic comparison. Complete scoped PR childbodydiffs reviewed; fresh PR AttachmentCapacity29. Direct age family63-114 only supported via originalscope+qualifiedADM03REG043; QUAL103 excludes premature115-128. Actual XP reward mission_bootstrap50-85 alreadywhole-scoped fresh. P16 new tactical494-566 registered BEFORE fresh qualifying reread, QUAL104 uncredits prior display.", "contracts": ["Character.scan_id duplicates ID solely as explicit native private fullscan index seam: sole creation initializes id=scan_id and deletion removes row; rawpublic declaration is broader, but no actual independent scan mutation observed. This is explicit cache/port ownership rather than automatic separate identity fact. Character.party_id traversal pointer versus party membership rows requires actual membership mutation policy in queued strategic sources, no cache completeness claim from comment. ServerIdentity is sole tactical assignment value, zero absence not independent bool; tactical_assignment computes predicate, registered enter checks previous actual server before reclaim, so stale server pointer can be intentionally reclaimed rather than inferred live membership.", "XP is authoritative reward progression; level initial1 and actual reward mission_bootstrap76-78 sets1+xp/100 in same persisted row. Level is derived stored summary, not independent learning hours. Current actual update coordinates both; ideal source may derive level at actual projection without retaining extra editable authority. No drift or level bug invented from raw public representation alone. Preserve reward zero/living-party division/saturation semantics separately.", "Birth coordinate is authoritative chronology, cached Character.age_years refreshed by family settle_character_age103-114 at supplied personal minute; age at later absolute minute is not derived from current realtime. Actual birth is signed and may predateepoch; do