duplicated legacy name compatibility added.", "CharacterEquippedItem records selectedplacement; EquipmentOccupancy materializes root/parent/channel/order/capacity queries from selected placement plus actual attachment choices. Native row anchor_kind+nullablemembers can encode inconsistent raw shapes, but actual single successful equip factory preflights then constructs pairedrows coherently and refreshes dependents. Tighten firstparty accepted sum/product rather than retain independent tag+Options or duplicate geometry rule loops; source native table layout alone not proof the same internal representation must be raw. Container detach before laterfail belongs04/05 partialstate, not proven stale committed occupancy under07 without transaction-retention policy.", "Actual occupancy parent traversal uses visitedset, conflictingroots uses actualselected placement+canonicalconflicts method; generatedcarry chooses actualknown item/holder/placement, admits<=2 then zips actual two hips, preserves alreadyheldweapon. Attachment capacity distinguishes free/self/reserved in PR algebraicenum, P16 MAX sentinel conflation remains actual03 finding, not new redundant authority count. Parentattachment requirements and selected concrete parent choices are independent facts, not all derivable from inventory item alone.", "Origin settlement selection is initial choice from loadedworld and authoredeligiblechapters, not same fact as later currentsettlement; recognition versus physicalchapter separate questions. Explicit smallworld fallback affects initialplacement, no need infer normalorganizationmembership truth from geographicchoice. Temporary versus persistent/newborn CreationMode controls distinct policies; no duplicated bool collapse without preserving separate effects.", "CharacterCapability initial refresh then temporary scale omission is exactF022. backend view is actual directstoredrecipient, completes partial102 dependency for this path; other clinical/equipment/clock writers rem