r derives conviction/religion/cohort/positivebase/partycommand, demand.fervor snapshots strength atcreation to determine eventual cost; livechangingfervor neednotretroactivelyrewrite historicaldemand. Holyday status/resolvedAt/resolution are correlatedstate, actualboth resolutionpaths updateallthree beforeeffects, but rawflatshape remains earlieraggregateadmission; no independentlymutable normalstatusowner asserted.", "Conditionrefresh first refreshes wholeparty conditions, then capabilitiesforrows; actualbase_morale also refreshes currentalliedcapabilities beforepowercomparison. This closes named normal clinical/time/recovery query projection path, not allwritepaths bycomment. Existing F022 temporaryscale aftercompletedinitialrefresh still leaves BOTHcondition/capability earliergeneration untillaterrefresh; source support added, not another unique finding. Direct backend rows may be historical/unrefreshed at read; needexplicitcacheownership/dependency invalidation across actualwriters.", "Morale source keys leisure/mastery identify specifically refreshablestimuli with intentionally different decay contracts; they share one producer/consumer constant each, not independent spelling authorities currently. Generic eventkind is broader classification; do not force everyLeisure event same expirykernel absentactualpolicy. Label/description presentation is not consumedas mechanicaltruth here. Fixed-contractduration intentionallybypasses personality-dependentduration; one-offprayer doesnotalter savedschedule, current dailyritual derives savedminutes independently.", "Religion personalprofessed affiliation and partycohort doctrine/knowledge differ; officialtemple availability checked actualsettlement beforechanging. Needsprovision personal/settlementwater/fullboard encode distinctsupply contracts, not interchangeable defaults. Waterphysicalcapacity query dependsactualcontainers and unknownwater conservative policy, notstored needsreserve. Armor insulates/waterproofs via curr