and belief probabilities are orthogonal epistemicfacts; confidence choosesband/availableevidence, nottrue/false diagnosis. No Englishfinding parsedasdiagnosis. Historicalchartgaps/readings persistknowledgeframes and mustnotrefreshfromcurrentphysiologyasifcache.", "PartyDiseaseIntervalPlan explicitlyfreezes acquisition/protection proposals for co-advancingmembers; privatefields and singleplan sharedpreview/commit preserve simultaneous semantics despitefirstmemberwrites. It intentionallyis not a generalcurrentdiseasecache. Clippedcommit persists onlycanonicalinclusiveprefixthenupdatesfilthcursor andnotices; terminalprivateMeter result mapsclosedfailure toactualdeath, distinctfrompreviewprediction. However consumerapplicabilitydomain implicit: F024. Actual normaltimewrapper plan lifetime stillseparate07source analysis, notclearedbyprivate/immutable comment.", "CommittedCut is narrowdurable physicalprovenance nottransienttacticaltickstate. DiseaseNotice id dedupesdelivery separatelyfrominfection episode; duplicate deliverytracking notsecondinfectiontruth. Notice refreshespublicknowledge using currentepisodeevaluation atnotice, actualCurrentCharacterDeath terminalcaller separatelyowns life. Severity/capacity rawword bounds belong03/04; no newnormalbadcaller claim fromplainf32.", "SettlementExposureSource aggregatespublicoutbreakwindow and actuallocalproblemmitigatedexposure. scoped flag records provenance class, notderivableonlyfromdisease/intensity; source ID alonemayoverlap acrossnamespaces soflag supportsactualsemanticcontext. Actualseparatecollections capture differentphysicalcauses, do notdeduplicate simplysameDiseaseId. Localproblemend clipsresolvedAt and typedmitigation, notsametimeasoriginaloutbreakplannedend.", "ContactWindow computesoverlap frompairpresence+knownparticipantstart/horizon, actorMissing fallsbackpairbounds explicitly; this is currentintervalselection, notcopiedindependentclock. CachedPairPresence history and co-advance projectedhorizons answerdiff