ation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-040.json#/files/1100"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed entire Native camera-support/contracts-041 and042 blood group, actual Camera147/140 facts and own current07Core055. Fresh P16DB1-343/470-690, fullblood157 incloriginal141-157 and exposure_windows27; Core8-79 fresh. Actual complete parent PR/P16 diff only typed seed return/canonical fallible grant, children empty, each current07 role compared. Prior actual full769/seed714-769 facts reused exact roles, no hash/verdict.", "contracts": ["Visible origin is a coarse privacy projection of private source at insertion. Core foreign_blood conservatively treats unknown as not-owned; Unknown versus proven Foreign differs in knowledge detail, not two exact conflicting sources. Normal deposit computes public origin and private provenance from one input. Raw independent table fabrication remains03/05, no actual normal second writer found.", "Pathogen snapshot preserves source disease at deposition; later source healing must not rewrite deposited material. Partial washing reduces current physical amount while preserving composition/provenance; zero removes linked snapshots/provenance. Physical blood need not be foreign or infectious. Current total/dirt_total derive rows, no independent retained aggregate. Travel remainder and evaluated-through exposure checkpoint track integration/replay history, not current dirt or blood age.", "Travel rate repeats across Core floating/exact and DB boundary: F025. Calendar denominator is separately canonical1440. Current invalid raw remainder1441 is prior03/04 admission/operation evidence; no new current rate mismatch or clock cap inferred.", "Private wash plan and public summary derive one fresh operation snapshot. Actual commit recomputes internally and never accepts caller-mutated public summary. Personal-first allocation and risk-ranked shared budget are separate policies. Composite SoapStackId distinguishes native tables. Quantity here means cleansing points from canonical fraction/25, not whole soap. Commit preflights tagged soap, consumes, then checks deposit owner/amount; no blanket rollback theorem from Result. Current party/membership input contract remains outer caller owned.", "Blood replay derives active compatible foreign windows, actual wound protection/healing, physician guard and absolute-minute deterministic seeds with budget before attempts. No fabricated clean handling. Optional plan.check_at trusts supplied acquisition plan applicability, supporting F024 with normal caller closure still queued. Checkpoint writes only persist=true after each disease; preview writes none. MAX/late-error operation concerns retain prior04 source graph, no newly claimed double infection.", "DiseaseSnapshot episode and kind are historical material provenance, not a current living episode lookup cache. Public origin plus private exact disease information preserve privacy. Existing test is original source-only ordering/physical-control assertion. No new tests/assertions/runtime/repairs; no whole native/helper graph clearance."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F025"], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F024"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "One rate owner and actual deposit/source snapshot/current physical amount; derive public classification/aggregates and one fresh private wash plan. Preserve historical pathogen material, composite soap identity/capacity units, bound interval plan domain and deterministic checkpoint sequence.", "status": "Exact6 source07 inventories, policy and plan-applicability qualifications; no overall clearance"}
