OF": 190, "material_ranges": [[1, 190]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-040.json#/files/1111"}, {"scope040_index": 1112, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/tests/lots_and_consumption.rs", "sha256": "6dc480ed2a4a6c22f394a7a310beb51b05331690975d1addcd802f0afb806164", "actual_EOF": 89, "material_ranges": [[1, 89]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-040.json#/files/1112"}, {"scope040_index": 1113, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/tests/preparation.rs", "sha256": "635ff9be462bb2f00748c6776bc4e15f232d69710185d948f770e9aa0af3159f", "actual_EOF": 179, "material_ranges": [[1, 179]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-040.json#/files/1113"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual CameraADM03-141 fullP16 authority207/fireplace190/lots89/preparation179 all original source-test facts. Fresh07 authority1-48/154-207 and full lots89; actual complete PR/P16 bodydiffs reviewed allfour, only authority typedResult/canonicalfalliblegrant changes. Each current07 fixture/source-oracle role compared, not test result/hash verdict.", "contracts": ["Existing food test fragments express conservation, identity/revision, provenance scaling, custody, replay and terminal suppression expectations. They retain no independent current gameplay policy cache. Source-count/string assertions cannot establish production constructor exclusivity or authorize a source not read; production food/custody/preparation bodies remain separate queued07 sources. A check for copied catalogue quality or exact profile count detects expectations, not a second runtime catalogue owner.", "Authority fixture is feature-gated and requires existing development bootstrap token before actor/digest/state changes. It intentionally creates controlled raw actor/condition input, including9percent blood for interruption. These isolated fixture mutations are not evidence ordinary production copies bypass all cache refresh. No seed/runtime/database mutation performed.", "Versioned digest vectors are test oracles for one implementation, not competing hash resolvers; deliberately changing row/custody/revision/tool damage verifies input dependency. Existing preparation raw infinity/-zero damage fixture tests representation hashing, not finite physical admission. Exact generation/replay state assertions preserve completion versus interruption differences; no new fixtures/cases/assertions authored.", "Partial food test scales extensive mass/nutrition/value/flavors while preserving intensive quality, so those fields are not all mutually derivable or interchangeable. Source tests do not prove arbitrary raw FoodLot literals are accepted canonical state; earlier03 actual model/constructor gaps retained. Fireplacedish destination source-owned party-before-transfer snapshot differs actor current party; distinct explicit question, not generic duplicateownership bug from same string."], "findings": [], "qualification": "Review only; original full test sources compared via actual141 source proof plus fresh focused07 roles/diffs. No test execution, new test/case/assertion/helper, whole production feature/source credit or native bootstrap guard theorem from function name.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve existing deterministic vectors, conservation/replay/custody/terminal and quality-versus-extensive-scaling expectations when canonical production APIs are repaired later. Tests remain evidence of intended contracts; remove production duplicate authority at actual owner, not by adding equality assertions.", "status": "Exact8 original test/guarded fixture source07 inventories complete; no production-lens clearance"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-115", "at": "2026-10-23T00:47:07.999146+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope040_index": 203, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/consumption.rs", "sha256": "27d71249019722ede09f0961c7c4880a6acf19f99cdb0ab909eafa7bd1370bfc", "actual_EOF": 369, "material_ranges": [[1, 369]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-040.json#/files/203"}, {"scope040_index": 1102, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/consumption.rs", "sha256": "6774eac9e912e8d500d0d9912545c2051fcc102d969f024be6dd157b22dea910", "actual_EOF": 369, "material_ranges": [[1, 369]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-040.json#/files/1102"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh completeP16consumption369 and actualcompletePRcounterpartdiff onlythreeResultheaders, every current07role compared. Personally consumed CameraADM03-145 actualsource route facts. Fresh supporting already-full Character221-234 and herbalism177-226 (no wholeherbalismcredit), current07 condition107/capability102 consuming definitions reused after exactmeal role comparison. No Source/SHA verdict stamp.", "contracts": ["Food lot extensive physical mass/nutrition/value/flavors and remaining inventory fraction are different units/precision frames. Actual partial path applies same retained ratio to lot and quantized fraction, with deliberate minimum nonzero inventory unit and full-consumption threshold. This packet does not assert exact floating mass equals catalogue mass times stored integer fraction; cooking/mixtures/quantization mean those are not automatically identical current facts. Actual lot/graph constructors remain separate queued source contracts.", "Consumed nutrition adds physiological reserve while removing physical food; reserve versus stock are independent post-consumption facts, not duplicate inventory counters. Medicine potency/provenance scale with consumed portion and are independent from calories. Current pathogen load derives contamination at personal clock; exposure records preserve actualdose/protected-dose/immunity/prior/fraction contributions, distinct mechanical versus provenance roles.", "Party-first oldest-lot supply order is explicit travel policy, then personal sources; fireplace material excluded. It is not same priority as stake-funded purchasing or personal-first washing. Food variety/quality/intensive properties may remain unchanged while extensive amounts scale. Clear_stomach_fullness removes positive reserve only, distinct from discarding inventory or resetting negative need.", "Actual canonical StrategicPlaceId erasure at85 before internal WorldEvent retained string remains NATIVE-CONT-WORLD-F001; not hidden by successful admission or current07 record. Literal dysentery token93 repeats canonical known DiseaseId spelling but is actual narrower same disease fixedpath; propagate typed ID to real codec rather than broadenstring helper. No new unique count or generic diagnosis-from-label claim.", "Condition cache update omitted after positive partial personal meal: QUAL115-MEAL supports F022 same connected projection graph. Actual backend stored recipient/currentNeeds-derivedcondition fields provide direct receiving proof, not only a search for missing function name. Capability refresh alone does not recompute condition; normal public eat has no outer post-call refresh. No execution/UI report asserted.", "Earlier03 invalid stored fraction expect and rejected row .ok loss remain actual production issues, not cleared by partial same-ratio updates. Personal/party row location needs authenticowner/custody; quantity1 stable material object is not automatically full remainingextent. Native DTO persistence is actual boundary; internal physical material owners should remain coherent through consumption."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "NATIVE-CONT-WORLD-F001"], "qualifications": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-QUAL-115-MEAL"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain one actual material portion/provenance state, preserve intensive versus extensive fields and specified quantization, propagate typed place/disease/fraction through firstparty receivers. Coordinate post-meal needs projection with capability before publish; preserve zero/badmealinput policy, oldest party-first selection and fullthreshold.", "status": "Exacttwo source07 inventories, additional normal cache trigger qualified; no global clearance"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-117", "at": "2026-10-23T00:52:16.561222+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope041_index": 204, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/cooking.rs", "sha256": "da8832af71a29edfd807274456fa4ee5890834beec5b80ef726e55b8399eaf7b", "actual_EOF": 868, "material_ranges": [[1, 868]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/204"}, {"scope041_index": 205, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/fireplace_custody.rs", "sha256": "91a13115f15cf32eabd8971f881e1eb15a9177e089cc8e72d8c7ef0495cdb168", "actual_EOF": 656, "material_ranges": [[1, 656]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/205"}, {"scope041_index": 1103, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/cooking.rs", "sha256": "05b74b2a891da80bceb87ea3709269c90fb6933754c7c1387aac4fd622a940b2", "actual_EOF": 868, "material_ranges": [[1, 868]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/1103"}, {"scope041_index": 1104, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/food/fireplace_custody.rs", "sha256": "91a13115f15cf32eabd8971f881e1eb15a9177e089cc8e72d8c7ef0495cdb168", "actual_EOF": 656, "material_ranges": [[1, 656]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/1104"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual ADM03-158/159 complete cooking868/custody656 narratives; fresh07 cooking1-110/191-306/307-491/492-608/611-681/719-868 and custody1-143/196-322/324-374/405-515/530-656. Actual complete PR/P16 diffs personally compared: cooking only retrieve Result alias, custody no textual delta; current roles compared independently. Current07 CoreFood057 actual policy facts joined for immutable catalogue/doneness/material units. Remaining lines supported by personally read whole-body prior source narratives, no verdict-only carry.", "contracts": ["Dish check, target duration, ready quality/nutrition retention, raw microbial concentration and growth are frozen preparation-epoch inputs/results. Retrieval659-667 derives doneness/current quality/nutrition from that retained input and current elapsed time; recomputing from current chef skills or current catalogue would change the intended historical recipe. Raw and cooked growth are distinct alternatives interpolated by heat progress; mass versus concentration versus per-source microbial loads have distinct units. Dish display_name is presentation derived once, never parsed to select gameplay method; typed method drives actual retrieval.", "Station key embeds actor/fixture and optional vessel identity; retained actor/fixture copies are recomputed and checked25-78 before dish/camp/retrieval recipients. Normal placement555-565 and dish assembly563-598 initialize correlated fields together; retrieval uses station identity and canonical fixture validator before native row writes. Existing raw public record bypass/correlation gaps remain admission findings, not evidence normal factory mutates identity alone. Canonical structured station identity should replace duplicated parsable key/components at the actual schema boundary.", "Dish return custody and instrument return custody can describe different things for an independent nonvessel dish lane; current party is not authoritative for the recorded return destination. Vessel assembly243-267 freezes original carried custody and checks selected scope. Retrieval638-655 returns dish to recorded destination and verifies vessel lane. Death cleanup199-239 chooses recorded extant party, otherwise personal estate, otherwise abandons installed tool; explicit estate disposition policy is not a compatibility fallback. Current camp equality is against full journey identity; service/location availability is recomputed from current canonical settlement/organization.", "Normal vessel custody moves the same stable InventoryObject root to fireplace556-565 and back649-653; children keep object edges. Station instrument item identity is crosschecked against actual object54-57, not trusted as a separate mutable catalogue. Camp clear scans stations/dishes via validators; death cleanup validates/plans before removal. Rehome helper and party/camp lifecycle source-specific ownership remain separate queued actual sources; this packet gives no whole-helper invalidation guarantee.", "Ingredient stock reduction and dish extensive mass/flavors/nutrition/provenance are one processing transition, not two interchangeable measures. Intensive quality is not required to scale with quantity; selected amount and material metadata use different precision. Cooking retains exact contribution decomposition and recomputes its digest from same arrays; output medicine and contamination are heat-adjusted provenance, not independent current infection truth. Earlier03 zip/cast/raw-record/partial-mutation issues preserved without inventing transaction rollback guarantees.", "Preview832-866 repeats instrument and timing input evaluation: it uses raw catalogue safety minutes856-858 while commit382-390 includes cut/ground preparation factor; commit also includes actual contained water mass469-470. Preview is a pure public helper, not a retained commit certificate; no actual production caller located in the food/Web source navigation and no claimed observed wrong UI prediction. Exact later callers must be dispositioned before whole07 closure. Prefer one shared evaluated cooking input/plan with explicit preview versus commit context rather than synchronize two policy copies with assertions."], "findings": [], "qualifications": ["Snapshot quality and original custody deliberately differ from current skill/party. Rawdish/station mismatch does not establish an ordinary bad producer. No native database mutation or runtime performed."], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve processing-epoch recipe/skill/provenance and recorded custody; derive structured station components from one canonical identity; compose preview and commit around the same preparation-sensitive timing policy where the same question is intended. Preserve distinct vessel/nonvessel lanes, direct-content behavior, stew water requirement and estate policy.", "status": "Exact four source07 inventories with explicit later helper/caller dependencies; no global clearance"}
