.json#/files/1110"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual ADM03-146/149/150/156 complete source narratives for lot534/projections538/authority635/ingredient652; fresh07 focused source ranges listed below plus fullmodel151/mod84. Complete actual PR/P16 diffs each of six sources reviewed: only ingredient reducer Result alias changes, all current roles compared independently. Truncated first focused output is not credited for hidden middle; authority112-168/337-442 separately reread, other actual portions visible. No hash/verdict coverage.", "fresh_ranges": {"ingredient_preparation.rs": [[1, 108], [277, 373], [375, 652]], "lot_inventory.rs": [[1, 152], [207, 328], [349, 534]], "model.rs": [[1, 151]], "mod.rs": [[1, 84]], "preparation_authority.rs": [[112, 168], [337, 635]], "projections.rs": [[1, 33], [283, 364], [386, 538]]}, "contracts": ["FoodLot model comments2-5 explicitly define captured nonfungible batch provenance; current catalogue cannot reconstruct a cooked batch. Factory60-146 initializes metrics/name/preparation from immutable catalogue once, consumption/cooking/physical-preparation update actual lot thereafter. Catalogue mass-times-remaining-fraction is not the sole authority for recipe mixtures or source quantities. Stable inventory object quantityONE is an envelope, ingredient quantity can represent multiple source units. Raw factory parallel item/actor/row binding gap F029 remains a concrete earlier admission/API issue; normal matching grants not disproved.", "Personal/party Option anchors are one current location alternative and should become one checked location product through firstparty state to real DB codec. Full transfer349-409 clears source alternative and sets destination together; partial transfer clones/retains material and copies hidden concentration anchor/growth. Material_revision tracks changed material, not custody itself; source digest and object/custody fields separately bind relocation. No false demand full custody move increment material revision or recompute inherited historical concentration.", "Every retained extensive field and ingredient quantity scales in retain225-241, quality remains intensive. Split source residual uses original minus child for ingredient quantities207-222, preserving intended rounding relation. Contribution digest is derivable from IDs/loads; each split/consume update459-534 recomputes it with changed loads. Raw mismatched arrays/truncating digest is earlier admission concern; no current normal producer drift demonstrated. Derive digest at construction/codec or encapsulate all updates rather than independent public arrays/hash, retaining exact domain framing/native bit policy.", "Current contamination derives from hidden anchor/growth plus elapsed time on demand262-278, rather than refreshing a current-concentration cache. Copying same concentration into split child is correct intensive-state inheritance; per-source absolute loads scale. Public ingredient provenance and private pathogens serve different information roles, not competing public/private truth copies. Contamination current digest may legitimately change while source digest remains unchanged across preparation wait.", "Preparation private authority112-138 snapshots lot/object/place/custody/tool/skill/duration/material receipt for one operation. Sole load337-440 reconstructs all from actual state and validates revision/object/transition/tool/custody. Captured prefix/next/skill are a coherent action product, not independent mutable runtime authority. Digests duplicate no authentication: actual fresh plan/material comparison before wait and postwait560-577 checks live place, full lot bit truth, custody/source/tool/skill/duration/transition. Natural microbial evolution intentionally differs and builds new current material receipt.", "Durable preparation receipt captures immutable attempt tuple and result; replay313-325 checks submitted tuple before mutable liveness, deliberately survives death/later material changes. Attempt cursor next-generation/completed is current retry liveness, not same historical fact as receipt.interrupted. Interruption records unchanged material and successor generation; completion changes only preparation/name/revision plus training, then cursor. A later successful revision is not a reason to rewrite old receipt. Preserve exact retry/exhaustion semantics.", "Gateway DTO projections are current-query previews and are not accepted plan capabilities. View action/skill/tool/duration logic mirrors load but reducer freshly rebuilds authoritative source and plan, so stale preview does not silently commit stale material. View deliberately offers settlement actors only whereas load place can support broader contexts; do not equate eligibility scope with canonical place validity. View lexical tool selection and actual load selection need shared policy where same question, but fresh tool binding/source comparison rejects changed selection. Name prefixes are display transformation only, not parsed to select preparation mechanics.", "Fireplace DTOs copy one authoritative row on each gateway query and omit private pathogen/return custody; they do not retain a second independently mutated server cache. Underlying frozen dish/station roles separately compared117, current raw table fabrication remains admission concern. Full module84 assembles included owners and source-test concatenation only; include order/reexports do not invent separate configuration/default owners. Original test fragments114 remain source evidence, not authority for unseen production routes."], "findings": [], "prior_findings_preserved": ["CAMERA-ADM03-F029", "CAMERA-ADM03-F027", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022"], "qualification": "Existing actual source facts personally reanalyzed for07; no automatic original03 acceptance, caller ownership or whole foreign helper coverage. Earlier terminalNone/MAX digest encoding ambiguity remains other-lens evidence, not an invented current source cache drift. Dependency source inventories for canonical Material/Action/Herbalism remain explicit whole07 queue roles.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "One canonical inventory location/material product; encapsulated provenance+digest updates; shared preparation transition/tool/timing policy at actual authoritative load with projection adapter. Preserve evolving current contamination versus frozen source truth, historical replay/cursor distinction, batch metadata/intensive units and source-preserving partial quantities. Coordinate same F022 post-training/needs projection graph where relevant; no compatibility dual authority.", "status": "Exact12 source inventories complete with explicit lower queue dependencies; no whole07 clearance"}
