source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/1115"}, {"scope041_index": 1116, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/herbalism.rs", "sha256": "22a0312534bd03b91e900595bd44d7bffe8b159545dfd65c8eccfe207f8cb0b8", "actual_EOF": 600, "material_ranges": [[1, 600]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/1116"}, {"scope041_index": 1117, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/herbalism/ingredient.rs", "sha256": "0da336a33dfe2ce0319629649c1fe2192f15f73e04a7899d12cc9613f2f49156", "actual_EOF": 21, "material_ranges": [[1, 21]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-041.json#/files/1117"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual ADM03-160 exact foraging162/herbal164 roles, all substantive route narratives and complete prior body differences; fresh07 full43timing/full21ingredient, foraging1-193/747-793/798-870/934-1030/1098-1163, herbal1-177/339-452/464-504. Complete current PR/P16 diffs personally reviewed: foraging typedResult/fallible equipment load, herbal two Result aliases, tiny helpers identical. Each current role compared semantically, not hash/verdict.", "contracts": ["ForageAttemptAuthority is explicitly immutable receipt55-100, with frozen request/environment/seed/outputs. It must remain independently replayable after current actor or ecology changes; exact replay765-828 compares submitted snapshot rather than current mutable world. ForageAttemptState is current cursor, not same fact as historical completed_at/generation. HarvestMaterial preserves source identity and initial material revision; later consumption/preparation changing actual lot does not mean harvest provenance must change.", "Attested ecology/coordinates and canonical place resolve different boundaries: gateway supplies normalized ecology for exact package/location while DB checks current authoritative vicinity and current rights; DB does not define a second terrain resampler. Actualpostwait964-975 revalidates place/environment/license/capability inputs before yields. One request environment is intentionally stable, time-induced physiology may evolve, so arbitrary every-field equality would be wrong. Source/privacy projections omit exact hidden location/seed/DC; safe legal wording is derived155-162 from receipt illegal/stealth outcomes, not parsed back into policy.", "Plan local legality747-759 and final receipt1120 currently compute same OR of settlement/cultivated/license_violation; retained receipt is history, not separately updated live law cache. One canonical legality result can be propagated into receipt rather than repeat expression, but source-backed current disagreement not established. Forage effect completion/interrupted is checked949-959 against actual time and planned outcome before native writes. Canonical result predicates remain lower queued Coreforaging source; successful type/boolean alone not proof.", "Foraging trains current skills and updates all normal cache recipients1159-1160, explicit contrasting source fact for F022 dependency inventory; does not prove every other skill writer refreshes. Parallel output vectors store one per harvested item at construction, but are raw correlated persistence fields; one structured output product can retain association through codec. Earlier03 malformed raw arrays remain admission rather than a demonstrated independent normal writer drift.", "Tincture.matured is explicitly materialization checkpoint36-38, NOT simply now>=ready_at. Process141-174 installs pinned component when threshold reached and flips checkpoint; current shared-world clock and private installed component are distinct facts. Custody transfer must not restart maturation against new character local time. Pinned potency/profile are preparation-epoch recipe snapshot; remaining medicinal component potency decreases through consumption and is not required to equal original pinned potency afterward.", "BackendTinctureStatus copies only ready_at/checkpoint through gateway projection; does not carry private potency nor invent second readiness authority. container_is_processing117-123 blocks until checkpoint, deliberate physical process state. Actual clear deletes both process and matching component125-139; ingredient helper removes exact material/amount/edge/object/row after caller selected it. No function-name theorem of whole graph deletion or transactionality.", "Poppy recipe independently records consumed ingredient identity/mass and generated effect profile/version; these are provenance versus actual remaining material, not duplicate ownership. Existing NaN mass tolerance bypass is same RigNative20F001 actual predicate421, not additional07 count. Current authored tag tincture_vessel is canonical catalogue eligibility, not a hardcoded second bottle list. Source profile constants and material components should propagate checked canonical profile identity to actual dose receiver; no blanket claim raw String grammar is current truth."], "findings": [], "prior_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "RIG-NATIVE20-ADM03-F001"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep immutable retry/harvest/process provenance separate from current cursor, materialization checkpoint and remaining dose. Propagate one canonical legality and structured harvested-output records where duplicated; preserve actual trusted attestation/current-source revalidation and shared clock transfer semantics. Encapsulate process+component lifecycle with explicit checkpoint, not derived wall-clock boolean.", "qualification": "Source-test facts reused only as prior actual source facts; no new tests/runtime or full lower Coreforaging/herbalism/clock/custody coverage. Other effects/API invariants remain separate lens findings.", "status": "Exact8 source07 inventories complete with explicit canonical lower-source queue dependencies; no global clearance"}
