entity envelope; inclusive0..1m remaining fraction is content, not a contradictory count requiringquantity decrement. Actual consume90-160 min/subtract updates one fraction and deletes exhausted envelope; transfer163-205 deletes source and inserts destination amount with same raw word. No second mutable fraction cache exists in these records. Earlier F027 rawword reader panic persists; canonical retained fraction should flow through actual codec, not a second equivalent fractional owner.", "Measured classification33-47 combines knownfood/alcohol/soap/fourstock policy. SMITHING_MATERIAL_IDS10-11 duplicates canonical ForgeStock item mapping known Root063; currently four exact IDs agree. Shared canonical stock iterator/typed membership should drive this client of stock policy; source tests repeated steel literal only assert expectation and do not remove redundant authority. No normal unknown-stock disagreement claimed.", "Container graph988-1023 is rebuilt from current object/edge rows and canonical item definition each use; one local graph is disposable evaluated model, not independently retained second graph requiring background invalidation. Object item/location versus backing row item/location are correlated native persistence identities; actual unique-backing/custody resolver gates current helpers. Existing public raw mismatches remain admission/API migration inventory, no actual current ordinary mixed graph fabricated.", "P16 exact role1030-1140 reads liquid volume perobject, sums carriedwater for matching custody, computes remaining capacity from current graph used_volume plus liquid volume once, then deterministic waterskin fill. Current capacity is authored geometric container capacity, used volume is current content, remaining is derived temporary answer; these do not need one identicalscalarowner. Checkedadd/sub detects overflow/overfill, no separate cached capacity field. Prefix1030-1032 is prior partial liquid_used tail only; no invented preceding P16 header/helperbody credit.", "PR full container source uses measured fraction times authored exterior/serving volume953-985, not current food mass; specific volume and material mass are different model frames. Water/liquid volume is not counted again as a childobject. Current consume1141-1195 decrements liquid and actual outbreak contributions in one call, sortedstableobjectorder; contributions represent attribution/pathogens and are not assumed total public cleanwater. Exact outbreak receiving policy remains later source queue.", "PR physical containment versus stable custody are orthogonal: parent edge is geometric contents, carried row location preserves holder/backing identity across nested movement. Rehome/merge/delete all current paths from actual160 narrative compared: source and destination raw aliases require canonical aggregate admission, but separate persistent fields are actual boundary storage rather than inherently two independent truth resolvers. Capacityput local graph evaluation before store is recomputation, not second maintainedauthority. Result/comment atomic wording does not prove host rollback; preserve earlier04/03 qualification."], "findings": [], "qualification": "P16container source220 coverage is ONLY1030-1140 incl existing013/022; unregistered remainder not analyzed or credited in07 from old03 wholevariant narrative. PR1119 full1451 actually scoped; its source-level facts cannot blanket close P16 called rehome/mutable/graph bodies. Those exact connected dependencies remain unfinished if necessary before whole07 acceptance.", "connected_repair_acceptance": "Propagate canonical fraction and stock identity, keep one encapsulated object/backing/custody product across native persistence, derive current graph/capacity instead of retain independent cache. Preserve zero fraction/zero request, missing-vs-invalid errors, stable IDs, liquid-volume countedonce, attributed contaminated subset versus publictotal and actual deterministic transfer order.", "s