, "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-043.json#/files/1193"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed Root camera-support/contracts-003 full610/86/105 actual source roles203-205. Fresh07 P16simulation1-136/284-321/387-505, full disease86 andquest105; complete PR/P16three-filediffs reviewed Result/typederror changes only, current roles compared. Remaining fullparent guard/view/test source facts from personally consumed Root003, no earlier verdict/count transfer.", "contracts": ["SimulationRun owner/nonce/runID/policySeed are distinct identity, capability and entropy facts. A disposable run singleton is not a second production world; actual owned_run/bootstrap gates from Root003 source facts qualify every scenario adapter. SimulationCharacter run/agent association is control provenance, not duplicate Character identity or current party membership. Claim/fixture metadata must not become authority to arbitrary production data.", "Worldclock epoch and cached officialminute are updated coherently by explicit isolated advance289-315: refresh actual clock, invert authoritative transform, checked epoch shift and saturating official update. Production clock policy remains separate; scenario override is an explicit capability-owned operation, not compatibility dual clock or hidden gameplay timer. Exact time transform/kernel is a separate07 source obligation, no arithmetic correctness from names.", "Configuration copies supplied canonical CharacterAttributes/Skills/Schedule and resets personality for one owned evaluation actor, then explicitly refreshes strategic condition491 and capability492. These copied request fields become current source components, not separately retained shadow statistics. Actual omitted ten scalar skill gates and schedule total-only gate remain earlier admission findings; update plus success type does not seal the broad raw request.", "Changing Character.current_settlement and solo Party current settlement453-458 is coordinated for this fresh solo-party setup. They represent actual member versus party location authorities at different aggregation levels, so later general travel cannot be proven by this scenario path. Case-site selection is explicitly cleared before refresh. Preserve actual current party-source relationship rather than assume equality for all parties.", "Quest private fixture retains generated canonical case identity while gateway projection uses owner-visible journal identity only after actual validated referral/authority joins. These IDs are different visibility/semantic namespaces, not redundant interchangeable case strings. Frozen direct/generated leader/party metadata describes installed fixture provenance; no expectation it tracks later party changes. Actual parent view remains a guarded fresh projection, not second mutable gameplay source.", "Disease fixture seeds only hidden infection identity then advances ordinary injury/disease/clock/lifecycle hooks before projecting symptoms. It does not fabricate a parallel observed-symptom state. Typed DiseaseId parses source input; stored String erasure belongs existing producer/error migration graph. Normal surviving path refreshes both caches83-84; terminal path delegates canonical death, not an invented live actor with refreshed health. No scenario executed.", "Root003 source facts cover all existing inline tests and token/owner guards; they remain isolated source oracles, not evidence of actual fixture success or a substitute accepted Character/Skills/Personality type. Existing source freeze and production/tactical authority boundary remain unchanged."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022 normal refresh dependency qualification", "Root03 omitted10 skills and total-only schedule findings preserved"], "remaining_source_questions": ["Personality reset projection lifecycle234 remains incomplete", "Actual canonical time inverse/clock refresh operation and normal quest/death recipients separate07 sources"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep explicit owned disposable scenario capability and one authoritative component set, preserve ordinary lifecycle/projection hooks and canonical/private versus public journal identities. Propagate admitted skills/schedule/personality products and typed errors; do not introduce production dual clocks or parallel observed symptoms.", "status": "Exact6 simulation source07 inventories with scoped lower dependencies; no scenario execution/global clearance"}
