ICROS_PER_WHOLE; preserve genuine units, no 1000x arithmetic bug inferred from stale wording.", "Known chassis catalog_id is the broad authored template while final physical object holds exact forged recipe; actual add_inventory then replace_design is deliberate specialization. Subsequent tactical/equipment consumers must prefer actual instance geometry, existing F008/F009 selected-weapon graph remains receiving dependency. No label or catalogue base recipe alone may override installed physical design. Actual weapon_instance source remains queued07 inventory before final propagation closure.", "Weaponsmith, general blacksmith or actual organization service chapter are explicit alternative forge availability policies, not compatibility raw success. Gate distinctions derive current institution/economy, not a stored duplicate forge flag. Actual source does not author a separate materials-to-stock mapping; canonical Core083 supplies itemIDs/unit masses."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-ADM03-F027", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F008", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F009"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one canonical quote/design and actual instance identity through stock consumption and final geometry installation. Preserve per-component rounding-before-stock-merge, fixed units, stable row order and service alternatives. Correct diagnostic wording later within connected repair; do not alter arithmetic to match the typo.", "status": "Exact2 source07 inventories with actual083 lower-policy join; instance receiving graph remains explicit"}
