ve-source-scope-parallel-043.json#/files/1201"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh complete P16 admission31/discovery47/draws54; complete actual PR counterpart bodies compared. Personally reanalyzed Root camera-support/contracts-004 source_roles12/15/16 actual admission facts for current07. Fresh actual parent receiving bodies P16social550\u2013575/923\u2013945/1214\u20131235/1865\u20131892/2521\u20132540/2571\u20132605/2670\u20132705/2710\u20132728/2840\u20132882 plus complete current PR/P16 parent diff; support only, no whole-parent coverage.", "contracts": ["The request action parses once to canonical SocialActionKind; admission13\u201315 establishes Reflect iff actor==target. Parent2579 consumes that action, recomputes equality from the identical immutable IDs2580, and passes those unchanged action/topic/equality to discovery2862. Therefore discovery45 unreachable branch cannot be reached by an admitted nonself Reflect through this actual route. The temporary self boolean is a locally derived projection, not independently mutable retained authority. Parent pair validator checks living/party/contextual presence, which are distinct current admission facts rather than repeated action ownership.", "Discovery is an action/topic-to-revealed-axis policy table, not another personality truth. Parent2863 retrieves actual current target truth per selected axis; diagnosed_axis2872 computes observer value/confidence then put_belief2879 retains an observation. Truth and observer belief intentionally may disagree; they must not be collapsed. SelfKnowledge+topic for self and nonself per-action axis sets have actual different disclosure meanings, no second current personality store in this child.", "ActionDraws stores one immutable seed and ordered actor/target identities; resolution and axis discovery use different named streams. The actual parent creates it once2684 then resolves2719 and obtains per-axis discovery2866; testimony assessment939 is proposition-keyed, claim challenge1224 participant-keyed, casual chat559 yields one sequential batch stream and presentation1874 observer/subject-keyed. These are purpose-separated random observations, not competing caches of one random result. No mutable cached roll field or independent seed update path exists in these helpers. Preserve identity order and stream names as behavior, inclusive endpoints remain canonical RNG policy."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep canonical typed action through actual admission/discovery, derive self from the immutable participant pair, and retain epistemic belief separately from target truth. Existing shared closed-vocabulary/roster consolidation may remove repeated mappings, but do not merge distinct random purposes or force beliefs to current truth.", "status": "Exact6 child source inventories complete; whole social parent and canonical personality operations remain separate queued inventories"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-137", "at": "2026-10-23T01:28:01.738546+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope043_index": 260, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/social.rs", "sha256": "93e446648725e961aaac7377e920dd07a8fcef4b7c0ff243ad9b054801f2ca41", "actual_EOF": 3805, "material_ranges": [[1, 3805]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-043.json#/files/260"}, {"scope043_index": 1195, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/social.rs", "sha256": "a09342196732b00b8520e9a446aa9fdef60e8fd44a439032ebdadc21e6e8e4c5", "actual_EOF": 3800, "material_ranges": [[1, 3800]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-043.json#/files/1195"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed complete substantive RIG-CAMERA-ADM03-578 source narrative (not verdict), Root004 source_role10 actual P16 comparison and complete PR/P16 diff. Fresh focused P16 tables62\u2013267/1292\u20131320/1370\u20131489, recipients303\u2013440, witness864\u20131121, preference1494\u20131571, affinity/familiarity1572\u20131824, presence1896\u20131998, automatic policy1999\u20132284, personality projection2332\u20132418, belief2486\u20132520, and actual action/discovery2571\u20133081 bodies as separately displayed. Shared child136 actual source facts used only for corresponding receiving roles. Existing inline tests are source-only prior actual proof, no run.", "contracts": ["Affinity anchor+minute own a directed decaying relationship; current_affinity1572 derives from them on demand, while backend relationship360 derives the band on demand from the same owner. Familiarity accumulated shared_minutes and its joint-clock anchor are independent history and integration cursor: settle1696 uses the minimum personal clock, reset1750 resets only the cursor after reunion, preserving time genuinely spent together. Async socializing1620 explicitly caller-idempotent and can omit familiarity deliberately. No cached relationship band is retained in these rows. Actual external party/time lifecycle invocation remains a dependency before whole-graph cache clearance.", "SocialBelief is observer-specific epistemic evidence with confidence/time, not duplicate personality truth; put_belief2486 coordinates its composite key/value replacement. Personality_truth2332 translates current labels into Core axis codes every read; this is repeated closed enum mapping supporting existing F011, not independently stored second truth in this source. Personality label-versus-score projection operations remain genuinely unread outside P16 personality1\u2013160 current scope, so this consumer cannot clear that authoritative projection contract.", "SocialChatReceipt/outcome, SocialInteraction effects, heard DialogueWitnessClaim text/truth/assessment and physiology observer bands are immutable historical captures at different events. They must not be recomputed from later morale, personality, abilities or dialogue text. Capability.has_bound_concern is captured at session binding864\u2013901, while bound_released is session-local completion; durable learned testimony is not interchangeable with either. Claim.resolution owns whether a heard claim can be challenged; session revision/resulting_revision coordinate current and historical retry, respectively. Backend claims require current active session/event and expose captured feedback. Canonical shared claim/action vocabularies should replace strings at the true codec boundary under existing F010, without erasing event-local identities.", "AutomaticSocialChat row existence is the single current opt-in owner: enable inserts, disable deletes; prune and backend view both enforce living/same-party and current planner revalidates actual pair/source. Automatic action preference scores1999 are a separate selection objective from actual success/risk kernels, not duplicate outcome authority. The explicit eight-action roster2198 excludes self Reflect intentionally; preserve that subset when consolidating repeated closed mappings under F011.", "SocialAddress is explicitly a compact current-success projection from successful attempts; producer2812 updates it alongside retained interaction2801, prune2969 deletes it when its current morale source disappears, backend1402 independently filters absent/mismatched source. Cooldown.available_at is a scheduled admission deadline, not another current outcome flag. Historical interaction survives current address pruning by design. All external morale-source replacement paths must call the pruning/refresh lifecycle or remain filtered before address use; existing condition/source inventory remains an explicit dependency, no stale-address defect is inferred from existence alone.", "PhysiologyPresenceSpan records actual contact interval and observer skill at contact, not all contextual co-location or current skill. Start1924 refuses an already-open pair, close1896/1970 uses min personal clock bounded below by start; reset1750 also guards existing open contact. Independent historical spans and familiarity total have different recipients and cannot replace each other. Actual clinical chart consumes these as historic visibility evidence, not current patient-state authority; F022 capability/condition lifecycle graph remains separate."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain explicit historical receipts/observations and one current derived projection owner. Consolidate repeated canonical vocabularies/axis mappings at existing owners, preserve directed affinity versus symmetric familiarity and epistemic confidence. Close external party/time/source lifecycle dependencies before final07 acceptance; no arbitrary removal of history/cooldown/capability flags.", "status": "Exact2 source inventories with explicit outside-source projection/lifecycle dependencies; not whol