ofs.", "Party.is_solo is living membership projection; actual governance485 derives living.len()==1. External death/removal/merge updates and consumers remain queued lifecycle dependency, no cached-flag waiver. Party preferences and captured journey settings differ in time; journey freezes departure choices. Reached camps versus forecast camps and current party location versus original journey endpoints have different meanings. Actual redirects/updates/receivers still queued.", "OutcomeFact payload owns semantic content and indexed identity columns are adapters. Custody holder/version, continuous-history through/broken_at and completed ingestion checkpoint are distinct temporal/commit facts. Deadline alone cannot derive completion. Finale/hostile execution receipts and battle diagnostics are historical versus current eligibility; actual custody/continuity/finale lifecycle sources remain explicit dependencies, not cleared from declarations.", "Party reserve ledger, stakes, physical currency and quantity targets are different accounting/request facts. Battle records lack tactical tick state and remain strategic final outcomes/history. Saved recruitment template versus active opening are distinct. Join meets_requirements, however, is a derived mutable current assessment reaching current UI unchanged after role edit, F029. Independent stored PartyActionRequest category/payload1547\u20131549 supports F028. Gateway buckets and source-error sums are query/native adapters, not gameplay policy owners."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F029"], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F028", "RIG-CAMERA-ADM03-F002"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Canonical typed current state/derived assessments through true storage/native adapters; preserve replay/history/snapshots/financial ledgers/forecasts. Close explicit queued operation/receiver dependencies before whole-lens acceptance.", "status": "Exact2 model inventories; three new web roles substantively compared awaiting gl