t/vote_counts derive on demand from retained authoritative records, not separately cached counts. Group resolution487 uses actual policy and deterministic vote ordering. Effects execute before state and resolved winning set are updated together599\u2013603. Open can legitimately have nonempty answers without a group winner; therefore state cannot derive merely from any answer existence or empty/nonempty selection and must retain actual resolution semantics.", "Resolved winning choices are accepted group outcome history distinct from individual ballots; they should not be recomputed from changed participants after resolution. Session revision advances for each accepted action, DialogueAction resulting_revision captures historical commit. Existing replay receipt matches only action category/associated prompt, not full new topic/ballot payload; this is actual minimal idempotency identity, not a duplicate current action authority. Prior03 exact-retry qualification retained, no new07 defect imposed without desired request contract.", "Each producer commits events/source refs, effects, answer/group resolution and action receipt in one current reducer route, then refreshes topic options366/614. Topic-option label and availability are current derived presentation; source refresh implementation940 onward in binding file remains actual dependency before cache invalidation closure. Protocol strings mode/resolution/state should use existing canonical owners through first-party state and true codec, supporting F010 without another parallel enum."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F019", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F020"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve immutable issued choices, per-actor ballot history, actual group resolution and historical replay revisions. Coordinate prompt state/winning payload at actual effect commit, derive counts and current topic availability from their owners. Close binding/effect/refresh recipients before whole07 final; no source/tests/execution.", "status": "Exact2 prompt source inventories; actual effect and topic refresh dependencies remain queued"}
