cting NPC authority is derived through exact chapter/fixture and current representative, not a separately persisted can-accept or can-report flag. Membership currentrole, presentedorganization choice and historical dues checkpoint remain distinct from live NPC role. Existing organization source and exact fixture projection recipients retain broader dependency limits.", "Investigation binding is a pre-issued scoped action coordinate, not immutable assurance of future permission: actual action297 checks current living leader/party, binding sourceScope/revision/unconsumed, session recipient, open case/current objective, then recomputes ordinary and generated producer recipient375\u2013397. Custody-specific path rechecks exact current holder/version before committing transition; marks consumed_by only after success. Other actions ingest typed fact before consume. Historical consumed receipt is not derivable from current objective satisfaction because another actor may have produced the fact.", "LearnTopic records a learned history entry once, while present topic availability is refreshed separately. Faith effect maps explicit authored intent to current settlement religion via canonical condition mutation rather than storing an extra local-faith bool. Testimony effect uses actual emitted claim event sequence and persists heard evidence; later passiveassessment is observer history, not synchronized to future truth. F010 string codecs/typed identities still apply through existing canonical owners; no new duplicate religion, privilege or investigation-state owner should be created."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F019", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F020"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve issued options/history but validate actual current authority at effect commit. Canonical typed effect/recipient/state should flow to existing owners; remove duplicate codecs within connected graph, retain consumed action checkpoints a