erver assessment. Captured heard text, later learned evidence and private truth have different recipients and must not be collapsed. Runtime fragment resolution is a projection into emitted records, not authority to reclassify arbitrary prose. No second mutable claim truth is authored in this bridge.", "Investigation binding issuance590 stages exact actor/session/sourceScope/revision/case/objective/recipient/custody-version after unambiguous current match; existing binding must match and remain unconsumed820\u2013829. Effect148 freshly rechecks those dependencies and marks consumption after actual success. Issued binding is immutable scoped intent and stale check coordinate, not a cached timeless permission; no blanket removal of expected custody version or consumed checkpoint. Exact pending list means ambiguity is rejected before binding insertion, not universal transaction proof.", "Current topic options are derived from current actor knowledge/facts and exact bound response/choice availability, not historical transcript. refresh940 deletes old session options and rebuilds them, called on start146, topic/answer147 and joinREG023. However cache key omits observer while schema146 broadcasts to all viewers: F030 preserves permitted-multiplayer/API qualification, no installed normal-session or unauthorized-effect assertion. Later world changes outside these dialogue actions remain explicit invalidation dependency; source existence alone is not current capability authority.", "Public case option ID derives zero-or-one exact case from bound effects, rather than selecting arbitrary known case; label The fevers is derived display wording from actual outbreak witness and never supplies an English control flag. Corpus-based F013 prose control graph is separate. Corpse permission options are projections of actual current permission owner, whose missing eligible kinship binding remains existing F023 dependency; refresh must not fabricate contacts from household labels."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F030"], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F023"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Make current topic availability observer-scoped: derive per observer from canonical facts at true query/request boundary or retain an explicitly keyed observer/session/revision cache with all actual invalidation dependencies. Do not broadcast one actor computation as every participant fact. Keep session-shared transcript/prompts distinct from observer knowledge and actor-scoped investigation bindings; preserve actual current effect revalidation and authored role limits.", "status": "Exact2 binding source inventories plus registered bounded join support; F030 conditional cache scope graph and external invalidation dependencies retained"}
