ody credit. Prior original2435\u20132815 tests source facts only, no execution.", "contracts": ["Canonical state directly derives puzzle openness from solved_at_minute and road openness from resolved_choice (new definitions70\u201380). Actual puzzle producer2303\u20132304 starts revision0/unsolved; wrong answer stores immutable attempt+advancesrevision, correct marks solved time1428\u20131444 and emits canonical fact. Backend open/solved/last-attempt fields derive from these owners395\u2013446. Open and active are distinct: active additionally requires current accepted contract and exact bound camp. Wrong-attempt history must not be collapsed into solved status, and no stored independent open flag is needed.", "Road choice resolution writes choice/deed/recognized virtue/result transcript together1739\u20131747 plus immutable exact receipt1749. Later combat followup extends transcript and may replace recognized virtue, while initial resolution receipt remains historical opening. These need not remain text-equal after combat: backend uses current composite transcript; followup receipt captures exact applied combat payload and complete resulting transcript. Actual followup checks immutable origin/actor/party/outcome retry before applying effects, no second current victor policy inferred from captured outcome string.", "Narrative occurrence binds actual journey/camp/clock/position at creation775\u2013884, retaining private origin/optional errantry overlay separately from public presentation. Subsequent current party location changes must not rewrite past occurrence coordinates. Issued preliminary trials are unbound initially; actual bind1141\u20131243 selects current accepted finale journey and updates exact frame camp IDs and indexed challenge camp coordinates together. Submission1400\u20131419 checks that relation and deterministic puzzle replay, so copied frame and columns have an actual coordinated adapter. External travel/camp invocation remains queued before compl