3a2f37d1bbb6350d2ba", "actual_EOF": 417, "material_ranges": [[1, 417]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1223"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive full-current source facts RIG-CAMERA-ADM03-601/602/603, then current07 fresh P16negotiation1-551/552-632, surrender1-377 and spokesman1-27. Actual complete PR/P16 body diffs: negotiation one return alias, surrender three return aliases; spokesman same body explicitly compared for same current role. First combined output truncated negotiation467-551: fresh407-551 separately reviewed; unseen output not credited.", "contracts": ["Negotiation/surrender backend availability is recomputed from current active group, current case/site, current party leader/location, actual context membership/living state/revision, pending contextual capability and language. The public DTO carries spokesman/revision as a claim, not independent durable authority: reducers re-resolve exact claims and again re-resolve immediately before accepted shared transition. World-actor temporal validity and canonical language/mental kernels remain separate lower contracts, not cleared by type names.", "Unique spokesman is derived from current filtered memberships using unique minimum ordinal79-99; ties yieldNone and strictly lower later ordinal clears prior ambiguity. View helper and reducer repeat the exact predicate across native View/Reducer ports; one canonical predicate/projection policy should own this logic where dependency fit permits. No stored independent spokesman cache or normal stale selected-spokesman commit is established by these bodies.", "Backend latest_response deliberately selects historical receipt by occurred_at minute; old Refused response may remain after changed circumstances while current decision availability is recomputed. Receipt outcome and response describe the same past event, not current hostile disposition to rewrite after later action. Exact replay precedes mutable authority check so already-completed request remains idempotent; it must not redo assessment against current morale/affinity or resurrect group.", "Surrender mode is derived from current Core assessment at projection and again at resolver. Demand requires no optional offer answer; Offer requiresSome(bool), and Declined differs from Refused. Current live assessment rejects stale or forged mode; accepted transition updates whole group via shared commit, declined offer leaves it unchanged, refused demand changes directed affinity only. These are orthogonal request/decision/result facts, not values to force equal.", "View surrender_offer_elected passes zero social ability/affinity while reducer computes actual values; this explicit Core lower dependency must confirm offers_surrender depends on language/morale/awareness rather than assume all assessment inputs identical. No disagreement claimed from differing call arguments alone. Actual Core strategic_action source remains queued for current07 and must close this exact dependency.", "Authored threat sapience/negotiability/morale and local public awareness are read through profile/case owner rather than copied into receipt as current facts. Context discriminator exact_case_context is stable wire grammar shared in producer/consumer, supports canonical codec graphF010. Case/group/party identifiers retained in historical receipts are event bindings, not extra current location or membership values. Shared resolution updates/objective invalidation remain externally queued before whole graph clearance."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain explicit current authority re-resolution and immutable replay/history; consolidate repeated semantic predicates through canonical owners without merging native context adapters or activating history as current state. Close actual Core offers_surrender input dependence and shared commit/world membership lifecycles before final graph acceptance.", "status": "Exact6 source inventories with explicit actual lower-operation dependencies; no normal stale decision defect established"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-160", "at": "2026-10-23T02:16:38.781693+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope049_index": 286, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/strategic/incidents.rs", "sha256": "51e52195d492033c61465104cf8ec4a29e9b3f64fa7cd6cd13a141b8028a5a16", "actual_EOF": 703, "material_ranges": [[1, 703]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/286"}, {"scope049_index": 1224, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/strategic/incidents.rs", "sha256": "9358dd5b0a17f5f01f321c614d3c3309139134a24febfb634a9e6fa19eb0d622", "actual_EOF": 703, "material_ranges": [[1, 703]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1224"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally reanalyzed substantive RIG-CAMERA-ADM03-604 full703 source narrative; fresh current P16incident1-261/340-703 construction/update/view/finish/source identity and complete PR/P16diff two error aliases only. Lower religious trigger262-339 full facts consumed from actual supplier, no unseen truncated combined output credit.", "contracts": ["Fine/affordable backend fields are ephemeral current projection of exact unsettled arrest charges and current personal currency, not saved payment authority. surrender_to_authority rebinds private token+instigator+current party/member/site and recomputes actual unpaid offenses/fine before checked payment and settlement. A previous affordable flag cannot authorize payment after funds change. ArrestCharge fixes which historical offenses caused this arrest, while each offense settled flag is live; do not replace captured charge membership with every new offense later discovered.", "Incident source_id and id/id_key/case_site/group identifiers encode correlated identity; normal constructor builds them together from one source and copies actual site/group IDs. Stable action_token is a separate private capability, not redundant public identity or a source fingerprint to reconstruct. Native id_key equality remains current canonical ID propagation graph, not justification to keep two unconstrained identity fields permanently. Actual later typed representation should retain one ID until real SDK index port.", "Incident location/scene/geographic flag/distance captures the originating place into a new fixed scene, not a current projection of settlement coordinates to invalidate on every geographic edit. Constructor moves living members/current party to this site through actual setters; separate historical origin_settlement stays fixed. Runtime current party/member location consistency still needs external travel/departure/investigation lifecycle cells before universal cache clearance.", "Incident kind/status and hostile-group disposition describe different lifecycle objects but can be correlated by operations. Shared hostile completion matches only exact Pending incident/group then closes it and records arrest resistance; payment closes incident after settling charges without directly changing hostile disposition here. Actual later journey/travel/group consumers must establish whether that remaining active group has a role after paid arrest; no wrong current disposition or redundant-flag defect inferred solely from different fields.", "Entropy retained per party/settlement/character/minute is a durable random decision seed; per-kind SHA stream is deterministic derivation, not a competing randomness authority. Existing source ID retries reuse historical incident; future current party size or risk need not rewrite its original enemy_count/difficulty. Source-key kind strings and closed IncidentKind match arms support existingF010/F011 canonical codec/policy graph, preserving purpose-separated RNG strings and priority raiding then thievery then disorder then arrest.", "Arrest source fingerprint commits ordered offense IDs as provenance, not current fine amount or settled state; new current offense sets can intentionally produce a new arrest identity. Exact offense canonical ordering and snapshot helper remain external reputation lower contracts. No uniqueness proof from truncated hash alone and no observed collision/run claim. Existing receipts/event history must survive changes to current money/reputation."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep current fine/affordability derived and rechecked, preserve historical charges/entropy/location and one canonical ID through native ports. Close actual paid-arrest group/travel recipient and current party/member movement updates before deciding any correlated lifecycle repair; no blanket status equality or resetting historical scene data.", "status": "Exact2 source inventories, explicit paid-arrest group/recipient and reputation lower dependencies; no new unique07 defect claimed"}
