successfulResult or native DTO creates universal coherence proof.", "PartyStake is an earned/contributed value claim, not current live mark-to-market inventory value. Deposit credits at then-current exact contribution value; later withdrawal spends stake and may require top-up; pooled currency/reserve are physically held assets and undistributed remainder. Loot1531 moves goods then credits shares and remainder. Do not continuously derive member stake from currently owned item quantities or rewrite past contribution on catalogue price change. Disband deliberately requires no outstanding stakes and residual inventory allcurrency exactlyreserve before distribution.", "MissionOutcomeCandidate copies capability coordinates/weight/captureversion to bind an issued mission, but completion619 compares every relevant field with active current capability and reevaluates actual current objective facts/custody. Stale candidate is rejected, not independently authoritative. Mission draw is deterministic from bound identity/seed and current eligible candidate set; committed outcome and immutable receipt are history. Actual complete_bound_mission rechecks parsed state, applies current selected result then stores correlated terminal metadata. Representation strengthening later can remove independently mutable state combinations without replacing exact replay by a new draw.", "Shared hostile transition953 validates exact request/binding, updates group disposition1096, deactivates roster1104, emits canonical case fact/custody transition, invalidates allmatching capability.active1178, closes matching incident1181, then records historical receipt. This actual coordinated path closes prior159 shared-commit and160 hostile-completion dependency for these callers; world_actor and case ingestion internals remain exact lower dependencies. Paid-arrest path in160 bypasses this shared transition and its subsequent group recipient question stays open, not silently covered.", "Removal/disband clears actual PartyMember and Character.party_id, settles historic shared time/presence, prunes votes/automatic chats and creates new solo membership via canonical helper. This closes prior157 external remove/disband update question; external death and merge helpers remain distinct current contracts. Full inspected transfer/deposit/withdraw/discard/leave require no unresolved encounter; storefront/liquidation require current settlement. These routes do not establish a permitted inventory mutation at a hostile encounter site invalidating cached Run speed156. Other item/condition reducers remain unresolved before final temporal-policy verdict.", "Catalogue kind/food detection and stable-object policy repeat local classifiers in helper branches; authoritative canonical item definition and measured/food owners should supply classification once, existingF011/F010 graph. Durable/food/medication are distinct policies, not synonymous flags. Unknown generic grants and public raw records retain prior03 admission qualification, no new07 duplicate-identity defect merely from broad DTOs.", "CurrentPR has real migration differences fromP16: certain personal add wrappers discard errors and source test delimiter differs; storefront uses renamed checked helper. Party add wrapper472 discards checked grant error inboth. Later loot/stake/source subtraction may proceed despite failed destination creation. This is actual failure-ordering evidence requiring exact lower failing precondition/caller-retention contract before a new07 conserved-quantity drift claim; no reproduced failed grant, atomic rollback assumption or normal data loss claim. Connected repair should propagate typed fallible custody/grant result instead of treating source deletion or accounting receipt as successful destination proof.", "Storefront amount/provider/service DTO is parsed into canonical request, current provider/profile/presence and catalogue/money gate then derives actual cost/proceeds. Quoted maximum authorization versus final actual price and stock are different admission facts, not redundant caches to force equal. Current changes refresh capability at2996; existingF022 clinical/condition projection dependency remains separate. Currency heterogeneous rows are actual sameunit quantity sums, no tactical tick state persisted by this strategic transfer graph."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "RIG-CAMERA-ADM03-F001"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve physical identity/custody and history versus live projections; carry canonical typed candidate/current transition through retained state to real codec. Reuse actual coordinated invalidation, keep stake/value ledgers independent, propagate checked grant failure before source removal/credit where failure-retention contract warrants. No compatibility wrappers, blanket raw-port exemption, or source changes in audit.", "status": "Exact2 full requested source inventories; shared current transition and removal dependencies explicitly reconciled, precise lower/failure questions remain"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-162", "at": "2026-10-23T02:20:01.876504+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope049_index": 288, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/strategic/journey_camp.rs", "sha256": "ab3af7b5a55d4b5ecd5974feef7679c29546ab298f39086ee9b92bc1977a7f0d", "actual_EOF": 908, "material_ranges": [[328, 370], [612, 628], [860, 890]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/288"}, {"scope049_index": 1226, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/strategic/journey_camp.rs", "sha256": "ab3af7b5a55d4b5ecd5974feef7679c29546ab298f39086ee9b92bc1977a7f0d", "actual_EOF": 908, "material_ranges": [[1, 908]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1226"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed Native current03 actual full908 contract-groups071#actual-journey-camp-and-conserved-time-consumers, reanalyzed current07 actual roles; fresh PR113-154/255-375/544-771/821-908. Fresh exact P16bounded328-370/612-628/860-890; complete actual counterpart diff empty, explicit temporal/camp/guard roles compared. Conservatively retain P16 expanded material qualifier rather than infer whole908 solely from historical source_reads; PR actual original full role retained. No native prior verdict carry.", "contracts": ["A reached camp is not any off-settlement location or every forecast checkpoint. Currentcamp predicate derives exact activeparty/destination/incompleteleg and membership of actual reached movement minute; between-camps is explicit complement withinactive journey. Resolved interruption promotion332 first checks exact party/current leg/current movement boundary and deduplicates before adding reachedstop and binding trial. Thus actualreached stop collection is durable event evidence, not cache of forecast schedule to regenerate when forecast changes.", "Forecast_camp_intervals/total_elapsed estimate future remaining movement using current party/member inputs; actual_camp_intervals retain observed historical rest and fatigue endpoints. Refresh665 computes remaining activeleg only, offsets projected checkpoints after actualcompleted movement/elapsed, and updates walking/night settings. Actualrest722 advanceselapsed and merges contiguous same-place intervals. Actualtime and forecast must not be forced equal; source declaration alone doesnot prove all upstream schedule/fatigue mutation paths call refresh. Exact external schedule/travel updates remain queued.", "Journeycompleted_movement versus completed_elapsed versus partywilderness_elapsed are different measures: onlymovement makes routeprogress; rest addselapsed notmovement, while wildernessclock spans travel+camps at current offsettlement episode. journey_local_minute and environment projection intentionally wrap timeofday undercanonical anchor; they are environment-clock projections, not replacement canonical personalchronology. Actualmovement544 plans allmembers, commits common safe prefix before training andwildernesselapsed. Canonical diseaseplan actor binding/nativeclock preconditions remain existing lower contracts; no overall conservation from equal names.", "Party location/destination and journey destination/progress are correlated live state with actual coherent predicates and selective setter635. Setter deliberately changes onlyjourney fields, preserving any leadership changed by terminalmovement event. Finish removes activeleg records, whereas historic incident/encounter receipts can remain. Current party/character location across departures/arrivals still needs externaltravel body, no universal coherence from this helper.", "Encounterguard865 derives unresolved presence from AwaitingChoice andactual bound open narrative state. This closes161 guards for current unresolvability: archived resolved encounter row alone doesnot block inventory, while open bound narrative does. Prior151 ChallengeState predicates supply actual is_open owner, not a second openflag. Actual encounter resolution156 +promotion332 make camp onlyaftercomplete resolution; raw-public table fabrication remains separate admission question.", "Persisted route is departure snapshot, explicitly owns exposure/check/duration/skillmixture for chunkedcontinuation; changing live terrain/catalogue mustnot silently reinterpret past movement ortraining. route_position821 derives ephemeral coordinate by clampedprogress interpolation, not stored duplicate liveposition. EmptyrouteNone/zerolength orminutes firstpoint are intentional native math policies. Exact lowerforecast/training/route producers remain separately scoped; no raw vector finite promise invented."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F024"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one explicit current journey update owner and derived camp predicate; preserve departure-route snapshot, historicalrests and futureforecast distinction. Canonicaltyped movement/elapsed/environment ports mustretain units/frame without narrowing chronology towrappeddayphase. Close actual schedule-input invalidation and departure/arrival callers; no wholeP16 file credit from bounded role.", "status": "Exact2 variants with unequal exactroles; no samehash/fullfile expansion, all temporal dependencies explicit"}
