e_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1239"}, {"scope049_index": 1240, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/surgery/entropy.rs", "sha256": "f685dee9225286b7d1e39515f8c426ab2e04cb37b064c170298794a470e1e7c7", "actual_EOF": 28, "material_ranges": [[1, 28]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1240"}, {"scope049_index": 1241, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/surgery/projectile_authority_tests.rs", "sha256": "c8ea9d3119f03244e607275388d82626801d0a346e2ebd829162822e13313ed4", "actual_EOF": 59, "material_ranges": [[1, 59]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1241"}], "focused_support_sources": [{"scope049_index": 317, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/world_actor.rs", "sha256": "232be94a5acf0de9c374f0c16d546051e2d007c1005510b0adb7f3c0d41b28f6", "material_ranges": [[498, 590]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/317", "credit": "Focused support only; no whole source inventory"}, {"scope049_index": 1260, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/world_actor.rs", "sha256": "a3c66672809464f5c6f872093d500dc115aba74a7de342d4bd3f6f374cc07c95", "material_ranges": [[498, 590]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1260", "credit": "Focused support only; no whole source inventory"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive actual full source narratives Rig617-620 and Root008 source49-52, then fresh P16surgery1-145/187-355/358-395/442-568/612-684/897-1169 and full existing authority fixtures117/projectile59/entropy28. Actual complete counterparts compared: main typed load/error changes; fixture checked grant rename/carriers; other two same bodies and current purpose. Fresh existing-scoped supporting character123-165/2051-2075/2457-2476, world_actor520-590, challenges851-884/2321-2362; bounded world_actor PR/P16 diff one return alias. No whole supporting source credit.", "contracts": ["Durable injury categories own the actual wound; CharacterLimbs health is derived from cut+max(bruise,fracture)+frostbite and is not an independent injury fact. Hit/frostbite/treatment/positive settlement coordinate refresh, but field seed stores injury without refresh, exact F031. Fracture is not additional damage on top of bruise. Embedded projectile extraction_dc/source_damage retain original hit/depth history while wounds heal; those must not be recomputed simply from current cut damage.", "Bandaged/stitched and stitch quality are distinct applied-treatment facts: stitched can have quality0, so quality does not determine whether stitches exist. New cut/extraction resets relevant treatment fields together. Infection exposure/check count/origin are integrated deterministic history and replay cursor rather than duplicate current wound magnitude; source origin minute remains fixed after later current time changes.", "Applied splint inventory identity and original return owner are different custody facts. Actual equip moves exact inventory row to patient or splits one quantity, remembers actor owner and selected row; return validates exact splint row then restores original owner. Raw parallel Option fields remain aggregate representation issue, not reason to substitute patient owner for return recipient. Actual generic inventory/remove/sell callers need to honor splint-is-applied policy before universal custody clearance.", "Treatment receipt is immutable exact applied request, including patient/limb/procedure/projectile/soap/context/revision, and exact replay returns before advancing or changing supplies. Interrupted waits insert no receipt. Current co-presence and consent are rechecked after waiting; actual injury reacquired and soap/alcohol selection current before application. Initial skill/DC are operation-time assessment, not claimed universally current projection at later commit. No stale skill bug from snapshot alone without actual procedural temporal contract.", "Surgery settlement updates injury and projected limbs, then blood/current life through canonical condition owner; it deliberately leaves personal clock advancement to time owner. Preview terminal and settlement alive are interval result versus current life state, not independent durable alive flags. Current07 CONTRACT097 actual Core integration already establishes same simulation kernel and explicit recovery cap; this main body closes the exact surgery-side receiving dependency, but external time integration remains queued.", "Entropy leaf owns sampled dimensionless extraction contribution lattice0..1.5, not physical penetration length. Fixed RNG stream and denominator specify one producer, getter is actual numeric kernel handoff. Existing treatment/projectile fixtures express independent replay/identity/zero-hit oracles, including deliberate raw wound setup; that setup does not clear F031 production path or create a general fixture waiver. No new tests or execution.", "PR procedure equipment load is nonfallible while P16 propagates typed load error; actual caller migration preserved. Procedure/region wire mappings and manual clinical field roster support existing F010/F011 canonical owner graph. Public raw wound/skill fields retain earlier admission qualifications, not a new07 invalid-number finding or hidden parallel impairment."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F031"], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Give durable injury mutations one coordinated publication path that updates canonical limb-health projection, including field seeding and any reset path after actual caller comparison. Prefer deriving at real projection where coherent dependency ownership permits; do not keep independent editable health truth or duplicate damage formulas. Preserve fracture as max-with-bruise, frostbite distinct, partial cut and zero semantics, historical treatment receipts and unchanged tactical/strategic boundary. Existing fixture expectations remain independent; audit adds no test/case/assertion/helper.", "status": "Exact8 source inventories and exact focused normal seed/reader proof; one new projection finding, no whole support-source credit"}
