ase-clipped elapsed, then scale immediate allocation over canonicalday for training/outcomes while personal clock advances only elapsed. Requestedwholehours, raw schedulefieldminutes, scalednumerator elapsed*allocation and actualelapsed have different units/stages. Storedskills, personalmoney, moraleevents and organizationaccrual record different consequences, not competing copies of a single activitytotal. Preserve actual partial0/7 minute interval semantics and no second elapsed clockwrite in surgery.", "Activity outcome gold/infamy/risk is derived from canonical Core policy and current attributes/limbs/skills/equipment plus settlement population; ActivityRisks is ephemeral output consumed by incident160, not independentlystored current probability. Carousing personality temperance changesonlydisorderpolicy. Reputation event id/time is a historical source binding, not current risk or current money; do not re-evaluate old event after skill/personality changes.", "Organization practice/accrual stores accumulated weighted participation numerator; duecadence derives rewarddelta by quotientdifference. This is historical remainder accounting across arbitrarychunks, not cache of current savedschedule or role. Native IDs bind actual selectedorganization; eligibility checkedbefore interval and actualrole consultedatoutcomes. Later rolecadencechange effects need explicit ownerpolicy, not an assumption accruedhistory should be reset or alwaysrecomputedfromcurrentpractice.", "Advance methods settle actual injury/disease boundary, write exactlysettledelapsed to personalclock, then lifecycle167. Preview is transient prediction, not another durablecurrentclock orlifeauthority. Terminalfinish and actualCharacter.alive remaincanonicalrecipient, no additional disease/injuryterminalflag persisted as current life. Shared plan reuses immutable acquisition/distribution snapshot; actual ordinarytravel caller162 constructs once then applies samecommonprefix to allparticipants. F024 broad internal API unboundactor/time contract remains distinct from observed ordinarycorrect caller, not silently cleared by privatehelper labels.", "Travel filth advancement computes actual clockdelta before/after eachchunk and records it once; movementelapsed differs from waitingelapsed and investigationwork, which intentionally lacks movementfilth/terrain. No hidden extra fatiguepool: investigation applies existing generalcondition policy. Public helperword bounds/missingclockfallbacks retain earlier source-loss qualification; actual zero boundary means terminalsettlement without free movement/training.", "Party activity synchronization302 ensures each clock then returns actualleaderclock; it deliberately doesnot ageparticipants tofurthestabsoluteclock. Currentco-location and livingmembership are authority facts, not equalpersonalchronology. Failedrefresh ignored in public synchronize406-409 can leaveprojection source failure unresolved, but no actual failingcase/committeddrift is inferred merelyfromdiscardedResult. Connected migration should propagate actual sourcederrors and refreshdependencies rather than inventzero authority.", "Current travel paths refresh condition then capability70-71/143-144; immediate activity364-365 reverses that order after skill/stat/morale changes. Waiting applies condition helpers then capability497/580 without standalone refresh call here. This is exact F022 dependency-order inventory: compare actual conditionhelper and capabilitysource ownership before treating similar publicmethodnames as equivalentcoherent refresh. Ordinary known helperpaths may alreadyrefresh internally; no newunique stale-Ready/power defect asserted from callorderalone.", "Woundseed F031 isnot fixed by everylater timeadvance: zero elapsedsettlement returns withoutrefresh and current reader can observe initialstatebeforeanyadvance. Positive injurysettlement166 explicitlyrecomputesprojection; that closes eventualrefresh butdoesnot make seed publicationcoherent. No newfindingcount beyondexactF031. Family propagation and post-write lifecycle calls close167 actualcaller map here, while stationary/restpaths remainqueued."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F024", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F031"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Propagate canonical requested/realized/weighted interval owners and one sourced personal clock through actual mutation pipeline. Keep event/accrual history independent of current plans, preserve shared acquisition snapshot and exact post-write lifecycle. Resolve real condition/capability dependency ordering with current owner bodies and propagate errors; do not collapse stage units or introduce another impairment pool.", "status": "Exact4 source inventories and explicit source-specific refresh/order dependencies; no new unique07 finding or runtime credit"}
