rm existingF011 canonical roster/mapping graph; actual current pairs include cooking/herbalism/surgery/smithing and sixterrain fields. Hours are cumulative history, rank/aptitude are derived current views, so neither should be copied into a separatelyeditable persistent rank. CharacterSociability versus Core SocializingSociability conversion repeats same three-concept mapping, existingF011 canonicalowner candidate preservinglabels andneutralfallback purpose.", "Book selection computes current personalownership or bookstore access, current language skill/targetrank/aptitude, then recomputes after accepted gains until time consumed or no eligible title. It doesnot retain a currenteligiblebook flag across training. Selectedbook typedtarget and native read-hours have independent meaning; source literals diagnostics are not another skillidentity owner. Actual lower book/kernel policies remain separatelyscoped, no generic all-float admission guarantee.", "Camprest snapshots pre-gain oral coefficients for allparticipants and plans disease/acquisition once before loop, then derives commonmin safeelapsed and settles each member. This is explicit shared interval ownership protecting chunking/order; later changing skill doesnot retroactivelyrewrite alreadyselected coefficient. Actual normal actor list fromlivingparty/matching plan andsamehealingtrue closes the ordinarycamp caller part ofF024, while publicinternal unboundplan representation remains distinctqualified migration.", "Camp authority restelapsed is separate from movementprogress; record actual rest interval and historicalfatigue before/after, then refresh remainingfutureforecast339. This closes162 actual rest-fatigue invalidation for the normal camp path and preserves actualreachedcamps. Narrative restcursor owns deterministic exposure interval; it cannot be replaced by wallclock or completedmovement. Post-all-member-clock chat resolution is actualcoordinated ordering, not proof every external socialelapsedcaller usescommon absolutechronology.", "Settlementrest expectedcost is quote confirmation checked against currentcanonicalprice, requestedcost is maximum funds preflight, and actualelapsedcost charges clippedstay after terminal limits. Sponsorshipgap versus patientcontribution are independent accountingstages; payerrow isnot patientmoney owner. Savedactivity rest/recovery/convalescence/training minutes are disjoint stageamounts; do not substitute whole requested stay for actualrecovery or credit imaginary activity afterterminal.", "Arrival synchronization aligns only timeofday by advancing positive remaining phase to officialphase, not assigning officialabsoluteage. Sanctuary Temple provision is deliberate universal arrivalpolicy wheninn unavailable/unaffordable, not failedserviceauthorization disguised as successful ordinary inn. Wildernessdeparture freezes canonicaldayanchor+leaderselectedphase without forcingparticipants equalage, preserving167 distinction. Actual unbounded orzero recoveryamounts remain dimensionful operations, no new strictpositive/dailybudget assumption.", "Stationary catch-up stops deadactors atdeathfrontier and splits actual lifecycleboundary, allowingNPC-control transfer tostopfurtheradvance. Socializing uses realizedreceipt delta toavoidtraining nonexistentinteraction; raw chosenplan and actualsocialhistory deliberatelydiffer. Condition/capability refresh ordering188-190 and camp helper refresh295 are exactF022 dependencies, not blanketcacheclearance; canonical helperinternals mustdeterminecorrect publicationorder. Injurypositive settlement canrepair priorstalehealth butdoesnotremoveF031 earlierseed publicationgap.", "Residence/organization/capability/need predicates called here are actual lowerowners; these full source inventories do not infer all callees from same filefamily. Different explicit/internal rest paths preserve duration/venue policies; no hidden extra fatigue/oxygen or movementpenalty introduced. Original assertions and helper naming are source evidence, no runtime/validation result."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F017", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F024", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F031"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain admitted daily intent separately from derived location/eligibility and realized intervals; propagate canonical skill/organization/clock owners rather than repeatedraw reconstruction. Preserve historicalaccrual/snapshots and actual post-restforecastrefresh, shared plan inputbinding andtemporalpolicy. Finish exact source-specific cachedependency owner checks; no repairs before audit handover.", "status": "Exact8 source inventories; normal restforecast and sharedplan dependencies closed only for explicit currentroutes, no overallcache/lens clearance"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-170", "at": "2026-10-23T02:38:22.418670+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope049_index": 314, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/weapon_instance.rs", "sha256": "e07ad1f88c536b1cd68f6384d729b7ca9d77bb74613af181283a9954346f9c27", "actual_EOF": 439, "material_ranges": [[1, 439]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/314"}, {"scope049_index": 315, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/weapon_instance/appearance.rs", "sha256": "f6b8605a22c9db0d93d4152347ac800118d90203a6f9d6976e716755dd1b7094", "actual_EOF": 78, "material_ranges": [[1, 78]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/315"}, {"scope049_index": 316, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/weapon_instance/evaluation.rs", "sha256": "6307923392138203a738fb32c47fe530f7f57ff0c417f2091e5440345d1a752b", "actual_EOF": 152, "material_ranges": [[1, 152]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/316"}, {"scope049_index": 1257, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/weapon_instance.rs", "sha256": "0366036a85f92aec26b1e205aa69edeb41afe565c118d2d5335e5cbb2ee4e983", "actual_EOF": 445, "material_ranges": [[1, 445]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1257"}, {"scope049_index": 1258, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/weapon_instance/appearance.rs", "sha256": "f6b8605a22c9db0d93d4152347ac800118d90203a6f9d6976e716755dd1b7094", "actual_EOF": 78, "material_ranges": [[1, 78]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1258"}, {"scope049_index": 1259, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/weapon_instance/evaluation.rs", "sha256": "6307923392138203a738fb32c47fe530f7f57ff0c417f2091e5440345d1a752b", "actual_EOF": 152, "material_ranges": [[1, 152]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1259"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed full actual Rig623/624/625 and Root008 source53-55 facts. Fresh P16 main1-180/180-299/300-439 and complete appearance78/evaluation152 incl original source tests. Entire PR/P16 diff personally compared: main combat_geometry native failure/typed-length differences only, other bodies same exact role. Fresh existing-scoped P16 capability/mass1-31 and equipment_projection147-173 actual recipients; no PR newhelper body credit before Root registration/publication.", "contracts": ["Recipe is per-physical-object construction authority, not current catalogue default. Actual initialize calls are only fresh item grant and fresh party grant (actual item388 and trade530); replacement evaluates design then overwrites one full row, with chassis identity checked. Retained hash/version/mass/length/grip projections are produced together from canonical evaluation. Re-evaluate consumer reconstructs entire row and compares equality, so drift in any retained projection rejects rather than becoming an independently trusted current physical fact. Raw public table construction remains broader admission surface, not normal independent writer evidence.", "Storage grams/mm quantization and native connected appearance metres/kg are intentional representation ports; they need not equal original unrounded evaluated geometry bit-for-bit. Evaluation authenticates projections with exact same quantization rule, while combat uses reevaluated original geometry. Source typed units must propagate until actual quantization/math boundary; existing scalar-bound/rounding issues belong earlier03/04 evidence, not duplicate-authority defect from unit conversion itself.", "Fitted holder contains a fitted weapon snapshot owned by independently versioned holder construction. Actual replace_holder_design comment249-251 and body evaluate/store whole holder; later weapon edits deliberately do not silently reshape existing physical holder. Therefore holder snapshot versus current weapon recipe is not a stale current cache to auto-invalidate. Actual fit_personal_holder validates current weapon then constructs new explicit fitting operation; preserve physical compatibility policy at real selection/fitting recipient rather than rewriting history.", "Backend privileged view returns raw retained instance rows for icon transport; connected appearance queries exact unique physical object, evaluates recipe/projections then emits actual selected identity. No direct native view record is a generic accepted geometry seal. Later icon/browser/native consumers must authenticate or consume canonical accepted product; those actual receivers remain queued. Stable physical identity is separate from equal catalogue chassis or hash: two identical recipe objects remain distinct owned things.", "P16combat_geometry propagates object lookup error but returnsNone for missing instance or failed instance reevaluation. Fresh actual P16mass20-23 and equipment_projection147-163 convert None to MissingWeaponRecipe for catalogue-parametric chassis, closing hypothetical silent-catalogue-fallback here. PRcombat_geometry .ok()? additionally erases lookup failure intoNone; its exact lower current capability helpers are newly Root-registered material, remain pending own07 comparison. No universal fallback verdict from cross-snapshot sameness or from this method signature.", "fitted_holder_mass deliberately distinguishes no fitted instance\u2192catalogue construction from present corrupt fitted instance\u2192error. This is model state difference, not a legacy compatibility fallback: unfitted holder has an authored catalogue construction, fitted holder owns explicit independent recipe. Preserve valid missing/unfitted versus failed/present and do not turn native failure into legitimateabsence during error propagation.", "Original tests compare tampering rejection and distinct per-object recipes despite same chassis/template. These are independent intent oracles; equality itself is actual canonical producer/consumer policy, tests do not make it true. No new tests or runtime proof. Actual P16EOF439 qualifies inherited1-445; nonexistent440-445 uncredited, PR445 separately current body, exact existing Root008#53 qualification consumed."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F008", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain one evaluated construction owner and one immutable correlated stored projection, actual error-vs-absence distinction through all recipients. Preserve physicalidentity, independently fitted-holder snapshot, native quantization and no implicit catalogue rewrite of existing object. Complete exact PR current helper comparison after registered scope joins; no duplicate owner or compatibility path.", "status": "Exact6 source inventories with EOF and cross-snapshot consumer limits, no newunique07 defect"}
