: "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1263"}, {"scope049_index": 1261, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/world_actor/authority_tests.rs", "sha256": "347470fad13ff5772d20c8221b4f1157d851eab67776ae32614339069ba56d33", "actual_EOF": 49, "material_ranges": [[1, 49]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1261"}, {"scope049_index": 1262, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/world_actor/contact_authority_tests.rs", "sha256": "67f3636f0569656541c6b0c20e49646ff86e0cd51031ae2f6e7ba810f7d8d1a5", "actual_EOF": 130, "material_ranges": [[1, 130]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1262"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual full Rig626 and Native044 per-source facts, then fresh P16world_actor1-423/424-590/816-938/940-1154 plus view122-290; remaining actual consent/presence production and source tests from exact full626. Fresh complete PRpresence196/roster28 and PRexisting fixtures49/130; actual complete counterpart bodies/deltas explicitly compared (world_actor3carriers, presence/roster unchanged current roles). P16fixtures absent from current scope not read or credited. Focused F031 source proof166 integrated, no repeated fresh body claim.", "contracts": ["Membership interval is the authority for open/closed state; is_open derives left_at absence rather than storing a second status. Interval validity uses entered<=time<left, equal-time interval intentionally empty, and closure writes max(requested,entered) once then preserves history. Current context_members open-roster query differs from observer-time case/hostile presence: historicalclosed membership can still be visible at earlier observerfrontier. Neither storedCharacter.alive nor currentopen flag alone replaces historical birth/death/presence predicates.", "Context.kind, role, contact answer and treatment answer are independent context-specific facts; hostility is not intrinsic Character type. Actual context/Character materialization creates ordinary persistent components then binds identity in roster, road-to-combat rebind preserves actual Character rather than cloning a surrogate. Roster ordinal and context-ID coordinate derive materialization identity but are not enough to authorize current presence or unique speaker after life/closure changes. Exact unique membership and actual current/historicallife gates in159 and164 now have current lower bodies.", "Backend alive is derived differently by purpose: case/hostile uses observerpersonalfrontier birth/death history, road/strategic encounter uses currentCharacter.alive while actualencounteropen. Thus publicalive may intentionally differ from a later-current lifeprojection, not a second mutablelifeauthority. Context visibility also rechecks canonicalplace/observerlead/exactcoordinates/currentcorrection time; no rawrecord grammar or full replay-proof inferred from matching IDs.", "Contact row existence records completed party-context interaction and revisable contact frontier, while encounter party_aware/enemy_aware can also arise independently from initial detection. Actual contact updates bothawareness flags, removesSneak, updates explanation/revision, upsertscontact and appends immutable exact retryreceipt; original fixture explicitly compares this coordinated route. Do not derive everyawareness flag solelyfrom contact existence or delete perception-derived initialawareness. Mission captured contacted_before_combat164 is immutable bind-time evidence, not another currentflag to synchronize afterlaunch.", "Public revision and membership_revision are intentionally different contextual protocols. Case/hostile claims bind membership.revision; road/strategic contact uses contact/encounterrevision as currentinteractionfrontier. Backend204-228 and contact1092-1102 select corresponding source, not an assertion all revisionsalways equal. Resulting_revision inreceipt describes pastevent. Canonical typed claim/cursor products can make distinctions explicit; blindly merging same u32 fields would breakauthorization semantics.", "Emergency treatment is derived live from actualincapacitated status plus exactlimbcut/bandage/procedure and refusal; normal storedtreatmentanswer stays authored consent, not overwrittenby temporaryemergency eligibility. Selftreatment, sameparty preference and exactauthoredcontextclaim have deliberateprecedence. Surgery166 currentpost-waitdecision nowjoins actualreceiver; no privacy/consent equivalence inferred solelyfromco-location. F022 cachedcondition correctness remains lowerdependency, F031actualwoundhealthpublication remains distinct.", "Patient materializer stores seeded cut without limb-healthrefresh, exactF031 confirmed inwholeworld_actor source role; actualview treatment_limb229 reads authoritativeinjury while backendCharacterLimbs readsretainedhealth, so the representations genuinely can diverge onsuccessful Patient creation. No extraunique count. Raw fixture mutations independently setuporacles; they do not erase this ordinaryconstructor path or establish installedchosenencounter/runtime proof.", "Roster deactivation wrapper26 discards clockfailure tovalidZERO beforeclosed-end clamp; authoritative instant cantherefore be lost atactualerrorboundary though intervalremainswellformed. This is existing producer/error migration graph, not proof source lookupactuallyfails (refreshinitializesmissing). Preserve explicitzero fixtures separately and propagate actual sourceerrors torealnativeDisplayport ratherthanfabricatingauthority. Context textdiscriminators support canonicalcodecF010, no newfreeform ID grammar."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F022", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F031"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep canonical interval/identity and context-specific claim/cursor owners through actual views/reducers, preserve temporalobserver/life and consent distinctions. Coordinate awareness+contact updates and retain immutable receipts. Fix exact F031 seed publication through injury owner; propagate sourced closure errors, no alias/compatibility layer. All physical/tactical ticks stay transient.", "status": "Exact8 source inventories; prior negotiation/roster/surgery lower contexts explicitly joined, no source/runtime/other-lens clearance"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-172", "at": "2026-10-23T02:43:21.358376+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope049_index": 319, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/world_event.rs", "sha256": "9403e2e3d8bc995c0483da0502427442f1c526ee1b513db2a9b5beac3078a5b0", "actual_EOF": 1188, "material_ranges": [[1, 299], [301, 810], [941, 999], [1001, 1009]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/319", "role_qualification": "P16 original bounded operations plus mandatoryoverlay200 union only, blankcontext300/811/1000 excluded; adapters812-940 andtests1010+ uncredited forP16. PR actual originalfull1188 independently compared."}, {"scope049_index": 1265, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/world_event.rs", "sha256": "9403e2e3d8bc995c0483da0502427442f1c526ee1b513db2a9b5beac3078a5b0", "actual_EOF": 1188, "material_ranges": [[1, 1188]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-049.json#/files/1265", "role_qualification": "P16 original bounded operations plus mandatoryoverlay200 union only, blankcontext300/811/1000 excluded; adapters812-940 andtests1010+ uncredited forP16. PR actual originalfull1188 independently compared."}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive Rig627 actual fullPR1188 source facts, then fresh actual P16record96-155/fingerprints268-351/persist169-267/apply352-480/semanticbinding481-605/preflight606-738/order739-810/Food941-1009 within original+overlay200. Fresh PR additional812-940, exact complete counterpart body diff empty and current unequal scopedroles explicitly compared. Native006/QUAL006 material qualifications consumed as scope limits only; no05verdict credit or fullP16tests.", "contracts": ["Immutable WorldEventReceipt records completed application, request/envelope/consequence digests and countedeffects. Requestdigest is computed before mutableparticipant lookup, so exact replay refers same originalrequest and intentionally doesnot build a new current consequence set. Envelope digest and consequence digest have separate domainframed meanings; they are not conflicting hashes ofonefact tocollapse. Receiptcount describes actualclosedplan size, notcurrent count ofsurviving domainrows.", "Canonical request owns stable actor/source/place/payload/time; build may append actualresolutionparticipants observed once atcommit. Semanticbinding strips onlyaddedCharacter subjects forstablecasecomparison, then uses actualcanonicalCore planner and requires entire consequencevector equality. Exactorder/unique consequenceidentity bounds and preflight ensure same subordinateidentity doesnot getdifferent authoredpayload. This is one canonical plan reused toverify, not an independentlymaintained duplicatedpolicytable from a different owner.", "Reputationevents, participant snapshots, infectionepisodes and problemoutcome receipts are different consequence facts ofonepastevent; afterapplication currentoffense.settled and currentproblem state canchange. Preflight deliberately excludes mutable offense.settled while preserving authoredseverity/time/source and nativeversions. Thus later currentlawsettlement doesnot invalidate originaleventreceipt. Keep history versusmutableaftermath separation through accepted types and codecs.", "PersistedWorldEventEnvelope manually maps all canonical fields to nativeSATS-friendly variants and is storedonlyfrompersist(actualvalidatedEnvelope) onnormalcommit. Mirroredclosedvariants and payloadfields are owner/codec-maintenance graph requiring canonicalfeature adapter rather than independentfirstpartysemantic recordifnative permits; no actualdifferent live rule/result is established from mechanicalcopy itself. Do not blanketexempt internal semanticStrings asSDK: Food adapter945 receives rawStrategicPlace string and retainedCore WorldEventPlace::Strategic remainsString beforeactualpersist, existing NATIVE-CONT-WORLD-F001 propagationloss ispreserved. Generic eventID grammar mustnot silentlyreplacebroadercanonical placegrammar.", "Core envelope.validate is actualsource owner forschema/identity/payload invariants, while DBsemantic/preflight gates own actualrequest-to-effects/collisionbinding. Neither stagealoneprovesallotherdomainfacts. Core current07definition/operations remain separatelyqueued, exact canonicalplanner/quantizer lowerdependencies explicit, no successfulResult/privatehelper exemption. PublicrawSATS/Serde constructors cannotcertifyeventhistory, existing03admission findings retainedwithoutnew07count.", "Native request wrappers capture source-specific quantities atboundary: currentfood immunity/dose/fraction/episode are eventinputobservations, not currentdisease state toresynchronize afterlaterhealing. Foraging infamy andcasefame authorconsequencepolicy once; publiccaseidentifier indexes participant history whilecanonicalcaseidentifier owns actualcaseevent, differentaliasmeanings. Actual semanticstring translation illegal_foraging/case_resolution repeated acrossapply/preflight supportsF010 codec consolidation, preservingwiretokens anddistinct closedmeaning enum.", "P16 exact1001-1009 contains only existingtestmoduleprefix/firstfixturestart; no childtestbody acceptance. PRwhole originaltests sourcefacts fromactual627 remainindependentoracles, not runtimevalidation or newassertions. Source equality didnotexpandP16adapters812-940 ortests1010+. No tacticalstatepersistence or externalpublication introduced."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F010", "NATIVE-CONT-WORLD-F001"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain canonicaltyped request/envelope/closedplan untiltruecodec anduseone domainplanner withactual source-specific binding/preflight. Keep immutable receipt/digests distinct from mutable aftermath; propagate realStrategicPlaceId rather thanrawString beforestorage. Preserve exactreplay/collision/order/emptycaseparticipant semantics, no duplicate validator/owner or blanketcodec waiver.", "status": "Exact2 variants with unequal bounded/fullroles; canonical lowerdefinition/operations and downstream domainrows remain explicit dependencies, no new unique07finding"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-173", "at": "2026-10-23T02:49:44.020742+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope050_index": 321, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-strategic-sim/src/live_core/bootstrap.rs", "sha256": "e58eadc935d9bd93c40262b170bc85c9e2d26c0b42ee490e882e0dd96f65be55", "actual_EOF": 1325, "material_ranges": [[1, 1325]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/321"}, {"scope050_index": 322, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-strategic-sim/src/live_core/policy.rs", "sha256": "d056fbef7a8fa3486dd75f7f51b2cb3cc942a71163499480d0c52023c76930ba", "actual_EOF": 598, "material_ranges": [[1, 598]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/322"}, {"scope050_index": 323, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-strategic-sim/src/profile.rs", "sha256": "39cc68d45b7a28f306c60bc0b3aefefba48bed2e47388040f46ce636d83da67c", "actual_EOF": 790, "material_ranges": [[1, 790]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/323"}, {"scope050_index": 1268, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-strategic-sim/src/live_core/bootstrap.rs", "sha256": "e58eadc935d9bd93c40262b170bc85c9e2d26c0b42ee490e882e0dd96f65be55", "actual_EOF": 1325, "material_ranges": [[1, 1325]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/1268"}, {"scope050_index": 1285, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-strategic-sim/src/live_core/policy.rs", "sha256": "d056fbef7a8fa3486dd75f7f51b2cb3cc942a71163499480d0c52023c76930ba", "actual_EOF": 598, "material_ranges": [[1, 598]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/1285"}, {"scope050_index": 1299, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-strategic-sim/src/profile.rs", "sha256": "765a5b37cbc4ffd63fff90bddf75a154a779a77bc8dbfd6d26d1bbf929c8fd9e", "actual_EOF": 789, "material_ranges": [[1, 789]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/1299"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive Rig629/644/658 full current source narratives and Root019 referenced profile facts, independently reanalyzed authority roles. Fresh actual P16 profile1-270/412-494, bootstrap147-173/251-278/412-463/640-674/780-801/1190-1234/1285-1325, policy1-447 focused definitions/retention/projections/decisions. Complete actual PR/P16 bootstrap/policy diff empty; profile production identical, sole physical fixture typed-axis versus raw-array test delta explicitly compared. Prior truncated report tail freshly redisplayed before analysis; no execution or prior-lens verdict credit.", "contracts": ["AgentProfile is initial simulation policy, not a continuously synchronized mirror of current authoritative DB character state. generate_profile derives AgentBuild role/activity_only from initial attributes/personality once; equipment style, skill specialties and quest propensity are coordinated initial decisions. bootstrap copies those initial attributes/skills/personality through actual configure reducer and retains original profile in final report. Later live personality, skills, condition and finances are read from public DB projections independently. A later deed or training does not require retroactively changing historical initial profile or static experiment policy. Public Serde/mutation can fabricate inconsistent profile but that is accepted-representation/admission scope; no ordinary stale live-build defect established.", "Preferred activity is an intention chosen from personality plus RNG, deliberately not identical to build role. matched_activity_pair clones one generated profile then redistributes existing activity time and changes preferred activity, retaining the other initial facts. live_schedule quantizes to quarter-hours, removes inaccessible study/social/organization activities and transfers disabled crime into subsistence labor. This is realized reducer input derived from experiment intention; do not overwrite original preferred intent or require equal raw/quantized schedules. Medical rest uses zero planned activity; conditional provisioning policy can choose labor independently of static preferred activity.", "LiveRunner maps are observer progress, previous values, event membership, decision attempts and experiment identity. Public diagnostic differential is an observer estimate, not private disease truth: confidence/newness and actual chart age choose an observation; medication scoring normalizes known likelihoods and estimates loss against canonical intervention effects. Condition readiness, observed symptoms, affordability and service availability are separate decision facts and are recomputed in current context. No second private disease state introduced by scoring or categorical confidence display.", "Final reports fetch actual current character, clock, survival, money, condition and public diagnostic rows. Captured simulation-start baseline converts absolute clock to elapsed experiment time; max elapsed across agents is explicit report aggregate, not another strategic clock. Initial profiles and retained trace describe history, final_agents describe current observations. Event sequence may exceed bounded stored trace, so trace_truncated and total_event_count need not equal trace length; actual code computes that relationship rather than keeping competing counters with unrelated updates.", "Config validation precedes connection and setup; reducer callbacks and public observation gates remain distinct stages. Callback success alone does not certify state convergence. Deployment host/database/nonce and optional world manifest identify requested deployment/artifact, while explicit note disclaims unavailable deployed module binary digest. Policy Seed controls profile/policy choices and server autoresolve seeds remain actual server values recorded from observations; these are distinct RNG authorities, not two seeds for the same operation.", "Manual generated binding projections repeat canonical attribute/skill/personality rosters (15 attributes, 30 scalar skills plus religion/bestiary/language fields); these support existing F011 owner/codec consolidation, not a newly independent gameplay policy. Actual policy includes cooking/herbalism/surgery/smithing and terrain fields, preserving contrast with DB configure omission findings. Confidence thresholds and reserve choices are simulator decision policy, not duplicate clinical disease definitions to collapse. All original test fixtures remain independent observations/source-only, no new or executed assertions."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep initial experiment profile, realized schedule, current public observations and immutable event trace distinct. Centralize canonical closed roster projections at actual SDK codec without copying policy meanings; preserve current age/budget/rejection semantics and explicit deployment/RNG limits. Any future dynamic profile policy must state which inputs invalidate it rather than silently treating historical initial profile as current DB truth.", "status": "Six exact source variants inventoried with role distinctions; connected simulator modules and canonical lower policies separately queued, no overall clearance"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-174", "at": "2026-10-23T02:51:33.311432+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope050_index": 329, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/equipment/grab_world.rs", "sha256": "6ae3e67b76458eb1c0db89a23b2a357b20c00fc7b962f50988c3f837ca68f2d2", "actual_EOF": 141, "material_ranges": [[1, 141]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/329"}, {"scope050_index": 330, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/equipment/placeholder_visual.rs", "sha256": "b875d058a3a33ee1456cd38a321f9ff3823f9794b7a398a3b901160e82a3ff55", "actual_EOF": 64, "material_ranges": [[1, 64]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/330"}, {"scope050_index": 331, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/equipment/runtime_equipment/generation_tests.rs", "sha256": "b9ebdeb456f436026036cd6eeb640ee942b80fb5b4bd885d6c9cd78af795defe", "actual_EOF": 395, "material_ranges": [[1, 395]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/331"}, {"scope050_index": 1475, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/equipment/grab_world.rs", "sha256": "458e3d73d56242705d9f851842b96b9e5b302ecfffac569a0da3a43a5b3bd392", "actual_EOF": 141, "material_ranges": [[1, 141]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/1475"}, {"scope050_index": 1485, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/equipment/runtime_equipment/generation_tests.rs", "sha256": "8acbe54a829e4f8c3f5e3d2fc5b4efe91415a6ebf0ea601ed3d98c46f410d6e6", "actual_EOF": 394, "material_ranges": [[1, 394]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/1485"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive Rig058/059/060/423 complete current source narratives, then freshly read full P16 and PR grab_world141 and P16 placeholder_visual64. Fresh PR generation fixture1-95/185-252/301-394, actual full counterpart diff compared all P16 fixture deltas; existing own07CONTRACT003 authoritative parent/spawn/update/cache bodies personally reconsumed for actual receiver dependency. No old verdict or byte-only carry.", "contracts": ["WorldGrabTargets computes candidates directly from current scene entity/transform/physical and current door/window pose plus current ray obstruction. Selected entity is temporary user focus, not a second authoritative inventory or accepted server action. Current camera/actor positions are independent view/actor frames; actor origin offset0.6 and target anchor transform serve distinct visibility/selection ports. P16 typed TargetingRange/TargetingCandidate versus PR raw range/tuple is actual propagation distinction, same selection priority meaning preserved.", "Outline visibility derives every update from actual GrabSession.selection equality and target entity. Outline starts false in generated/fallback spawn, then actual update_pickup_outlines overwrites it; it is a deliberately coordinated presentation cache, not independent selection owner. world_grab_selection retains existing nonworld/occupied-hand selection, otherwise replaces with freshly pointed target. A target selection does not certify server permission/current item ownership; parent request generation rereads current action state, as actual003 demonstrates.", "Generated render parts all share cached grip translation and per-item outline identity. Fallback copies current physical dimensions and anchor offset to native mesh/child Transform once; parent003 actual trigger lifecycle can leave this retained child stale after physical-only mutation or appearance removal. This is exact support of F001, not a new unique cache finding. Native render mesh and conservative interaction physical proxy have different intended accuracy; do not force generated visual dimensions to equal proxy.", "Existing generation_tests are independent source-only oracles, not competing runtime authorities. Readiness test deliberately assembles markers and hidden/resolved/failed states. Initial model/binding fixtures populate private caches with empty body/rig, then assert drop/hold/rewear key reuse and refit for new wearer. Explicit mutation invalid-placement->valid tests show intended failure/recovery behavior; they do not prove all source dependencies invalidate.", "Fixture mesh includes unused distant vertex, actual assertion checks referenced geometry center after held conversion; that is deliberate measurement definition, not a second geometric truth. LRU fixtures update last_used/models/bodies and assert oldkey eviction, preserving cache ownership relation. PR admitted LayerSelection replaces P16 independent item/placement strings; typed joint buffers and raw/typed physical fixture projections differ, while existing source expectations and production intentions are compared explicitly. No new tests, execution or acceptance claim."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F001", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F002"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Derive focus/outline from one selection owner; preserve current world visibility and actual server request revalidation. Repair presentation dependency invalidation in connected parent/child pipeline, including physical-only replacement/removal and failed replacement, keeping exact visual geometry distinct from conservative collision proxy. Existing fixture assertions are evidence of intended initial behavior, not coverage for untested invalidations.", "status": "Five exact source variants inventoried with parent cache dependency from actual003; no new unique finding or runtime proof"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-175", "at": "2026-10-23T02:53:06.972792+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope050_index": 324, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/animation_viewer/harness.rs", "sha256": "301ac4dfe279a9dde47a582987736d16158cea960a0398b2a59f57a63859511d", "actual_EOF": 511, "material_ranges": [[1, 511]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/324", "role_qualification": "Full original source; original tests source-only"}, {"scope050_index": 325, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/animation_viewer/scenarios/quickstep.rs", "sha256": "760ecbcf0a6723b9624547541159758a8e9e117606b3c827969cbd9733645aab", "actual_EOF": 190, "material_ranges": [[1, 190]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/325", "role_qualification": "Full original source; original tests source-only"}, {"scope050_index": 326, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/camera/smoothing.rs", "sha256": "7a8b095a7fa6c14074686fd57c5fbfb86cafbc3e5fad5e78a0db2531b6c2d3f8", "actual_EOF": 247, "material_ranges": [[1, 100]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/326", "role_qualification": "P16 smoothing scoped1-100 only; camera_view_metrics98-100 prefix is context,101-247 excluded, no actualFOV body proof"}, {"scope050_index": 327, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/debug.rs", "sha256": "f86ccdaa306872d20b45f9b648814e7402ce790ec333f451406062e7ca0af0d7", "actual_EOF": 341, "material_ranges": [[1, 341]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-050.json#/files/327", "role_qualification": "Full original source; original tests source-only"}, {"scope050_index": 1422, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/animation_viewer/harness.rs", "sha256": "ed20b1e997850b7b95cc52c88c55fad7855c2cf9c7a8e08e