tion/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/1889"}, {"scope052_index": 1890, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/player.rs", "sha256": "7950d432247add4cf942e8eaf9a0dfeed6199326e4518094a1d616d1cd89a645", "actual_EOF": 640, "material_ranges": [[1, 640]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/1890"}], "new_material_members": [{"source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/physics/controller_config.rs", "sha256": "56773ae80325116c0e2383940bec1f3f8a05d95d97a2c76596982c717b5dbc62", "actual_EOF": 18, "material_ranges": [[1, 18]], "registration": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-REG033", "global_scope_status": "pending Root metadata reconciliation; actual07body compared after registration"}, {"source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/physics/plugin.rs", "sha256": "c165c0efe7988bed6982ef9f1fe32fd78cd0fe603c3e5e4581435bad0bde0353", "actual_EOF": 88, "material_ranges": [[1, 88]], "registration": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-REG034", "global_scope_status": "pending Root metadata reconciliation; actual07body compared after registration"}, {"source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/physics/plugin.rs", "sha256": "c165c0efe7988bed6982ef9f1fe32fd78cd0fe603c3e5e4581435bad0bde0353", "actual_EOF": 88, "material_ranges": [[1, 88]], "registration": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-REG035", "global_scope_status": "pending Root metadata reconciliation; actual07body compared after registration"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual NativeRootSupport002 fullP16physics1762, NativeRootSupport001 quickstep81 and Native063 complete PRplayer640/P16delta narratives. Fresh P16physics1-183/353-435/480-548/630-735, fullquickstep81, player150-249/385-453/496-562. Complete actual PR/P16 physics/quickstep/player fullbodydiffs read, all changed production/result/error/test roles explicitly compared. Prospectively registered033-035 then fresh full18/88 direct config/scheduler and actualPR counterpart bodies read. Fresh P16serverprojection1675-1692 motion-snapshot producer is focused support only. First bookkeeping attempt failed before writes at legacy registry key; this successful append is sole181. No prior-lens verdict credit.", "contracts": ["CharacterMotionSnapshot freezes actual controller Transform/Velocity/grounded/actuator/lunge plus observed input word in one replacement at actual serverprojection1679-1691. Replicated presentation Transform is latest render observation, snapshot is post-controller boundary paired with acknowledgement: temporal/authority roles, not competing editable position owners. Replay purpose is documented but this packet doesnot assert actual client replay/restore implementation from comments. None vs Some0 preserved.", "QuickstepPush origin/direction/orientation/start are captured accepted movement intent; Transform/Velocity evolve current physical state, SkeletonAction is animation intent. cancel leaves start/origin/direction as history and changes active only, so active is not simply nonzero retained direction. MeleeLungeMovement.quickstep records committed mode while lower body closes range during Attack; no need reclassify original chosen mode from remaining current distance each frame.", "Actual motor filters/removes lunge after Attack, cancels its push after attack end/arrival, observes current completed displacement before remaining travel. sample_clock uses actual Skeleton tick minus retained start; absent Skeleton yields elapsed0, positive duration minimum1sample. target_phase is next integration step, not second clock. bounded_recovery12-15 deliberately permits active push after Dodge ends for <=action+2samples while forward velocity>.02; motor511 actually consumes this phase then cancels.", "Qualification to176 diagnostic: LocalQuickstepTrace89 labels (Dodge||attack_quickstep)!=push.active a discrepancy. Motor-permitted bounded recovery can validly differ, so diagnostic must use actual phase/recovery meaning before interpreting warning as invalid state. Conditional source-backed diagnostic-policy mismatch only, no observed warning/run/gameplay defect count. Do not force actuator/animation flags equal just to quiet log.", "New exact plugin bodies choose prioritized simulation modes: full Avian+Ahoy with our motor before Ahoy MoveCharacters, else presentation-only native solver with ordinary RigidBodyDisabled, else read-only collider-tree fixture. Actual controller_config zeroes acceleration/air/water/friction/stop-speed before own motor and applies runtime gravity/step/slope each step. Startup constructor constants versus actual runtime settings are distinct stages. This expresses one requested horizontal integration owner plus collision solver; foreign native zero-parameter behavior not independently analyzed or blanket-waived. Crouch scale1 avoids applying downed/posture speed reduction twice.", "Limbs region health and biological mass are independent inputs, total damage derived here. Stats calories and focus separate essentials; physical_skill_condition returns1 because fatigue/burden are already live incapacitation elsewhere, preserving no hidden double penalty. Tactical Skills/manual bestiary/default selectors support existing F011 roster owner; deliberate tactical subset0 for cooking/herbalism/terrain is not proof all strategic skills zero. Source-to-projection writer remains separate. PlayerInfo assembles current attributes/body/stats/inventory/skills, configure_attack_curve shares same current inertia/handling policy for player and NPC.", "PR raw origins/rotation/distance/dimensions versus P16 checked frame/length leaves and completed-result errors explicitly compared. P16 diagnostic optional tick versus PR missing->0 evidence distinction retained. CharacterDimensions rig reference lengths differ from biological mass meaning; neither is universally derived from other. Public raw transport/reflection/mutation still has prior admission/aggregate qualifications, not new07finding by itself. Existing large physics/player test expectations are independent source-only oracles, never executed/added."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F005", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one canonical motor/configuration and coherent fixed-step snapshot; distinguish captured intent, current physical state, animation/recovery and history. Diagnostic classification must include allowed recovery phase. Propagate typed geometry/mass/clock across real motor/snapshot consumers and actual native ports; preserve tactical transience and native collision solver. Exact foreign solver and actual replay ownership remain explicit dependencies, not inferred from names/comments.", "status": "Seven current global variants plus three prospectively registered direct roles actually inventoried; new global membership pendingRoot, no repairs/other-lens/runtime credit"}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-182", "at": "2026-10-23T03:14:50.607029+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope052_index": 365, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/scene_input/buildings.rs", "sha256": "2ab63d7b16ae590554651b5dfcd574e8ee3ea6028e227a6ef96bf13b40936403", "actual_EOF": 438, "material_ranges": [[1, 21], [27, 94], [151, 220]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/365", "role_qualification": "Union original bounded role plus mandatory overlays003/019/029/071/100; unrelated22-26/95-150/221blank/222+ excluded"}, {"scope052_index": 366, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/scene_input/buildings/window.rs", "sha256": "f1d40643528b12fce9e1062c6a2e23e0192c6216cb5a5f645bbc624ef90b5c26", "actual_EOF": 129, "material_ranges": [[1, 75]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/366", "role_qualification": "Production1-75 only, blank76 and original tests77+ excluded; P16 original historical1-76 preserved as conservative scope"}, {"scope052_index": 2819, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/scene_input/buildings/window.rs", "sha256": "f1d40643528b12fce9e1062c6a2e23e0192c6216cb5a5f645bbc624ef90b5c26", "actual_EOF": 129, "material_ranges": [[1, 75]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/2819", "role_qualification": "Production1-75 only, blank76 and original tests77+ excluded; P16 original historical1-76 preserved as conservative scope"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed actual Rig065/066 source-specific body/decoder/visibility narratives; fresh complete exact P16 scoped1-21/27-94/151-221 and window1-75 read. Actual complete material PR/P16window1-75 bodydiff inspected empty; current PRnewNative033 receivingrole explicitly compared to P16 fixedgeometry/nativecodec, no hash/verdict carry. Existing own07 grab174/doors178 actual consuming geometry role reanalyzed. No unrelated BuildingPlacement/generated-building/test body credit.", "contracts": ["BuildingOrientation stores one canonical wrapped yaw; tangent constructor calculates yaw once, local_to_world/world_to_local derive inverse planar transforms from it on demand. No parallel stored tangent or matrix survives independent yaw mutation. This owner has wrapped[-pi,pi) policy, unlike generic signed unwrapped Radians; do not duplicate equivalent wrapped owner or replace with unwrapped leaf without retaining canonicalization. Codec validation and constructor normalization are separate ingress policies sharing is_valid range, not two independently maintained current orientation truths.", "SceneBuilding retains building identity/program/orientation as immutableECS geometry provenance, no additional derived classification state in exact151-158. Child module/reexport bindings merely locate canonical SceneBuildingId/Window/Geometry owners, not coverage of missing identity/program or generator bodies. Actual registered world_to_local87-94 inverse is direct numerical kernel using same yaw, not a cached independently authored transform.", "SceneDoor and SceneWindow carry compact admitted scene-frame opening geometry. Size is leaf-local width/height/thickness, centre is fixed opening/doorway datum, tangent/outward are distinct directions, and building/opening identity indexes source geometry. Current swinging leaf Transform and mutable controller state need not equal fixed opening centre; these records deliberately omit current angle/open-state authority. Do not synchronize fixed doorway centre to leaf rotation or treat window leaf kind/bars as derived open-state flags.", "Native Serde DTO decodes geometry once into checked leaf/point/directions while preserving actual IDs for first failing error. Error record repeats IDs as immutable failure context, not current authoritative duplicate geometry. Outward and tangent are individually unit but not mechanically derived from one stored basis here; accepted aggregate/perpendicular correlation remains explicit original03/05 qualification. No current malformed producer proved solely by public record literals; real scene datum/pose projection owners separately scoped.", "Window PR/P16 exact production bodies share current leaf/bar/native error contracts after actual source comparison; no original tests77+ credited by P16full129 EOF or byte similarity. Source consumers174/178 compute grab halfwidth/inside test from current same compact fields; world membership/authorization is actual server lifecycle, not granted by geometric record or error wrapper. No extra cached current result/recomputed text classification or parallel policy table appears in these exact bounded bodies."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": [], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Preserve fixed opening geometry versus mutable operable-leaf state, one wrapped orientation owner, actual scene/architectural/gate datum conversions and checked canonical leaves through native codec. Any basis correlation repair must operate at accepted pose owner without equating distinct frame/datum/current-angle facts or duplicating validation; retain IDs/source errors until true presentation boundary.", "status": "Three exact bounded variants inventoried; excluded surrounding generated placement/building bodies and tests remain uncredited"}
