causal1-179/218-320, autoresolvefull182, module1-185/235-261. Complete actual PR/P16 diff for all8 counterpartfiles read and role changes compared: typed gameplay length->finitef64 report versus PRrawfrom_native, structured error variants and formatting. No CLI/report generation/project execution or earlier-lens verdict carry.", "contracts": ["Causal summaries accumulate immutable event observations. First contact, attack start, resolved attack, wound occurrence, defense decision and terminal outcome are separate event predicates; do not derive them all from one contact count. Per-run terminal value and across-run sum represent different populations; field final_fatigue/blood_loss values here are accumulated terminal observations across actors/runs, not one current character fraction. They may exceed1 without implying invalid bounded gameplay leaf. Report units/finite f64 owner must preserve extensive reductions and native f32 promotion once.", "Actual duplicate tactical summary/nested counts use identical filters and are manually written twice: F033 records the precise same-fact storage and actual JSON receiver. Normal callback updates remain coherent today; raw sibling mutation/maintenance can disagree, and deriving serialized summary removes redundant authority. Aggregate values whose population differs (e.g all combatants versus one actor; peak versus current; first versus total) remain independent. No blanket allreportfields duplicate verdict.", "AcceptanceAudit booleans are derived once from actual completed summaries plus independent acceptance-evidence fixtures; raw private Serialize-only record is output evidence, not pass certificate by type or private flag. Actual module validates positive seed counts, runs each batch, computes rates/summary then writes audit. Successful command can emit booleansfalse; output does not itself authorize implementation/acceptance. Existing explicit count6/len2/sample0 and expected contact/material/energy predicates are independent acceptance oracles, not duplicated gameplay policy to replace with implementation expressions.", "Ordered mutable report accumulators finish means once after batch loop: runner75 and114-115. Mean fields are working ordered sums before finish then reported means; retaining sum and total simulated time versus mean in summary is derived output, not independent current truth. Repeated direct finish calls could alter workstate but no normal repeated call exists here. Exact mean0 keeps current zero; contact extrema use Option and first actual observation, deliberately preserving missing measurement separately.", "Measurement<Role> has one private finite f64, no parallel rawpayload/validflag; macro jointly defines role marker and diagnostic ReportQuantity. Wall runtime, tactical simulated seconds and autoresolve simulated seconds have distinct clocks; ratios/speedups are defined derived outputs. Current from_counts denominator uses already-positive requestedseedcount; no arbitrary UnitInterval restriction on finite differences/aggregate quantities. P16 typed SignedLength promotes losslessly at actual report boundary, PR raw inputs undergo finite gate; preserve complete pipeline rather than getter/rewrap cosmetically.", "Error types retain source simulation/timing/geometry/performance/measurement/IO causes and actual write path. Error IDs/raw invalid seed counts are failure context, not duplicates of current success state. Actual record_final/causal mutation may precede later fallible arithmetic but current runner propagates errors; no completed-summary transaction bug inferred from partial workstate. Output may retain earlier diagnostic files on laterfailure, which must not be mislabeled full pass by a downstream tool; quality/evidence lens separately owns final proof semantics.", "Autoreport movement requires actual before/after velocity, speedlimit and elapsed but displacement None->0 and missing engagement-distance pair->0 are real evidence-loss policies. Missing is not measured0; preserve existing propagation/report findings without inventing07unique duplicate count. Actual audit then observes zero counters/limits; cannot infer missing telemetry impossible or success from private helper name. Canonical report should retain optional unavailable evidence or explicit failure as real source policy decides.", "Actual scheduled_contact_ticks BTreeMap in runner284-304 is a derived index over timeline attack IDs, not new attack identity owner. Existing Root04F027 fullactor->lossyattackID finding can make distinct attacks share key and overwrite scheduled contact association; retain its canonical fullidentity repair through reports, no separate hash wrapper or32bitactorcap. This packet consumes actual RootF027 source fact and traces receiver, not automatic independent07source credit for Core scheduler.", "Reviewer/source metadata, optional terminal causes, raw class/material Debug strings and original trace values are native output evidence. Report callbacks derive counters from closed typed enums; no text->gameplay reclassification occurs in these exact sources. Build/raw CLI/duel engine/roster actual lower producers retain their separately scoped roles. All original source tests/fixtures are independent evidence only, no execution or new assertions."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F033"], "existing_finding_support": ["root/initial04-invariant-operations/findings.jsonl#ROOT-INITIAL04-F027", "Existing native report absence-to-zero propagation findings"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one per-combatant accumulator owner and derive matching summary/serialized views from it at finish/output. Preserve exact existing wire schema only if still desired, through serializer projection rather than stored editable copies; no compatibility aliases/dual runtime paths. Preserve independent attack starts versus resolved contacts/cancellations, ordered f64 measurement reductions, zero/unobserved extrema, exact error order, and independent expected-value evidence. Existing fixtures remain source-only, no tests/cases/assertions/helpers added.", "status": "Fifteen current global variants plus prospectively registered P16report269 actual inventory; no overall CLI/engine/later-lens clearance"}
