ication": "Original full production/source-test role"}, {"scope052_index": 2021, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-server/src/bot/offense/facts.rs", "sha256": "ab5ef062d89204566f6f01b3c95ed45aecb640aae364883b7becefc6e9e4c854", "actual_EOF": 198, "material_ranges": [[1, 198]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/2021", "role_qualification": "Original full production/source-test role"}, {"scope052_index": 2022, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-server/src/bot/offense/phase.rs", "sha256": "3319be254a488cfacf2abfcea4c143c419090ebcd9b778b4dabdec7c95b85bb5", "actual_EOF": 370, "material_ranges": [[1, 370]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/2022", "role_qualification": "Original full production/source-test role"}, {"scope052_index": 2023, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-server/src/bot/offense/ranged.rs", "sha256": "60b6f6c4256b2ef4d61e7c1c1cc052ef163e78deb6cb260504820e365ec76c5b", "actual_EOF": 43, "material_ranges": [[1, 43]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/2023", "role_qualification": "Original full production/source-test role"}, {"scope052_index": 2024, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-server/src/bot/offense/tactics.rs", "sha256": "7cf8c5d94969b2b6fbdcdf953d7dc70d3923ff6b2990e0a207d87dc67b9e0615", "actual_EOF": 48, "material_ranges": [[1, 48]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/2024", "role_qualification": "Tactics actualEOF48; inherited68 overrun is nonexistent/no credit"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive Native054/065/067 full current PR and explicit P16 variant narratives. Fresh P16bot1-280/310-349; offense1-245; factsfull199; phasefull370; rangedfull43/tacticsfull48; defense1-37/213-287. Complete actual PR/P16 bodydiffs for all7 files read; only bot existingfixture length/call deltas, no defense delta, real offense checked geometry/error changes compared. Existing tests Native complete source proof used as independent intent only. No source/hash/verdict-only equivalence or runtime execution.", "contracts": ["CombatantBehaviorPackages composes initial capability recipe and materializer202-235 runs Added once, installing separate actual ECS AI capabilities and chance values. Live DefenseChances docs18-23 explicitly allow BRP to change installed chance for deterministic reaction control, while initial recipe remains. Therefore initial vector and live chance neednot stay equal under intentional overrides; do not claim normal stale-authority bug solely from Added versus Changed. Comment future tactics add packages doesnot prove runtime vector-edit contract. If vector is ever meant as live authority, every change/removal needs explicit reconciliation; cleaner consumed initial builder versus retained live recipe is a granularity/design candidate with these distinct roles, not an extra current07defect count.", "RaisedGuardAi maintains actual Skeleton guard from current incapacitation, independent AimAtNearestOpponent and RecoverToUpright capabilities. No implication guard means facing/targetselection; this separation is deliberate. Actual BotPlugin chains materialization->guard->aim->recover->offense->reaction after Condition, one coordinated normal update route. MissionEnemy and yielded markers are control/membership roles; yielded neednot equal incapacitated. No hidden strategic authority or persistence introduced.", "OffensiveCombatAi retains chosen target and control phase, but target candidate is freshly selected among current opposing nonincapacitated/non-yielded players each pass. Target change first prepares checked initiative delay/native Timer then assigns both target+Assessing phase; no stage committed on that local error. Current geometry/dimensions/viewer/weapon/ammo/recovery/lunge facts rebuild every pass, so use_ranged and reachability are current ephemeral decisions rather than independently invalidated retained flags. Ranged capability and currently usable ranged+ammo are distinct; a hybrid weapon legitimately retains melee too.", "Actual windup abort checks current melee availability/positive arm/reachable lunge/After recovery, or current ranged+range, before driving retained phase. Withdrawal ends early if melee capability returns; unavailable recovery differs zero-duration recovery. Phase reflects bot decision intent/cadence, actual authoritative attack operation is sent by MeleeAttackStartedIntent/Ranged*Intent and independently accepted by combat owner. Do not treat native phase Timer as accepted attack certificate or force exact equality with current SkeletonAction. Actual server ingress remains separately inventoried.", "MeleeWindup captures committed recovery at start; current movement facts adjust windup backing/abort independently. Cooldown completed from captured recovery+jitter, while ranged uses configured cooldown+jitter. They have temporal/operation meanings, not interchangeable current-state caches to resynchronize each frame. complete_windup clones/ticks local timer and computes fallible next cooldown before committing advanced phase/trigger; errors retain original Timer. Native timers unwrap actual typed elapsed at port; rawpublic configuration is not automatically validated by field type.", "Reactive pending decision captures chosen dodge/direction and elapsed delay for one observed incoming intent. At trigger it rechecks incapacitation, consumes pending component then sends real DefendIntent. It doesnot reroll historical choice from current probabilities on each tick. Default chance.2 versus standard_combat(config) copying actual config are fallback constructor versus initial ordinary composition; explicit alwaysdodge1 is authored anticipatory fixture, not global random policy. No blind activation of ignored YAML/default mirrors or arbitrary clamp merely from probability name.", "CombatRandom owns canonical DeterministicRng streamcombat.tactical; seeded constructor preserves actualSeed/allword and draworder, default fresh native entropy has different reproducibility role. Recognition probability/distance heuristic derives on demand from current phase+instinct and canonical reach/center policy; no retained current classification. Standoff recomputed from current weapon reach and configured min/max/slop, distinct from contact reach and preferred melee measure. Typed P16SignedLength versus PRrawfloat/error changes preserve exact numerical port, not new duplicate equivalent owner.", "Whole original bot tests independently describe composable capabilities, player/AI shared accepted intent, seed1 reproducibility, ammo exhaustion fallback, target tie and lunge recovery. Existing expected values are not runtime policy to replace with same implementation expression. ReportedPrecision::new expect is existing rawconfig/admission/error concern; finiteopenrange allows negative/>1, no UnitInterval substitution. Lower actual core movement/precision/recovery/config and server receiving bodies retain their own qualified scopes. No actual malformed live config, edited recipe or gameplay run claimed."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F005"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Make explicit whether behavior recipe is consumed initial composition or live authority; preserve deliberate installed live overrides and independent guard/aim/recovery capabilities. Retain current target/facts recomputation and one coherent phase-transition publication, with actual attack authority at server ingress. Canonical configuration/geometry/clock/error types must propagate through entire caller/receiver graph; no compatibility aliases or inferred all-probability bounds.", "status": "Fourteen exact variants inventoried with initial recipe/live override distinction and actual source lifecycle; downstream attack authority remains separately queued"}
