rences for allsix personally compared; PRgeometry module absent, its actual moved functions/current callingbody read in full diff against checkedP16. PR active_defense/outcome same bodies compared for actual caller role, not samehash verdict. No child/math/native-framework transitive waiver.", "contracts": ["MeleeCompletion read-only prepare validates cheapcurrentfacts, exactcurrentlineofsight, cooldown conversion and active.started_at. Active defense prepares current conditional performance/response before authority is consumed. Only then completion.authorize produces actualAuthorizedMeleeAttack and consumespermission once. Original raw event and validated snapshot are same observation crossing admission, not two editable success paths. Completed source-specific errors log/reject before authorityconsume where shown; later numeric/kernel or deferred publication properties are separate, no transaction promise.", "Historical scheduled_measure from authority and actualmeasure at contact intentionally can disagree when actor/target moved; idealmeasure is weapon/style preference, notrealmeasurement. P16 MeleeCompletionGeometry derives current distance/reach/facts together from current nativequeries, retaining typed Scene Position/lengths. PR equivalent inline code computes same role, actual P16 error/owner changes compared. Classification/material/leverarm/energyfraction are one current Core resolve_melee_contact_at_time output using that historical/current/ideal bundle, not competingauthorities to overwriteoneanother. Recomputed distalheaded from actualgeometry/material is source backing for existing F008 storedflag concern; rootcause staysonegraph.", "Actual initial bodypart selected at start constrains authority.permits, but contact_after_defense passes forcedpartNone and recomputes finalcontact from SAMEsample with currentviews/impairedprecision. Actualpreview in prepare_active_defense uses samecurrent attacker/defender/currentperformance for shieldalignment. Final contact maydiffer from historical startselection because facts changed; this is explicitly NOT frozen selectedpart guarantee established by source. QUAL161 corrects prior186 broadwording. A future representation should name requested/selected-at-start/finalcontact distinctly and propagate actual finalcontact, not silently force one to another.", "Attempted defender response, weapon-alignment effective response, chance/sample/engagement are independent causal evidence. melee318-341 uses effective response foractualcontact and keeps attempted response plus alignment in emitted diagnostics. commit_defense_during_attack intentionally commits attemptedParry ownstrikecancellation while effective shieldblock transforms retainedpower; no claim every attempteddefense succeeds. Authoritative finalresult is scaled by currentincapacitation and retainedstrikepower; localcontact history metadata mayremain originalenergy descriptors. Do not force these to match solely from names; anyenergy-partition change requires actualCorepolicy graph, no new wrong-state finding here.", "Whole outcome129 constructs one ApplyMeleeAttackResult and one SuccessfulAttackResponse from samecomputed contact/result/impact. MeleeAttackResolved is separately emitted only after transientconsequence application186. Nativefeedback hitlist is event result, not a second persistent gameplay authority. Nativebroadcast/commands deferred delivery not executed orinspected internally; no allframework guarantees inferred. Cached shieldbonus/holding-side actualdistinct consumers remain F032 support, no duplicateunique count.", "RangedFacts parallel optionaltarget/pointer facts arise from ONE target_characterOption. If targetmissing then separationNone and cheapgate rejects beforeposeexpect; ifpresent, checkedposition returnsOk and samequery suppliesyaw. Root016 source-gap qualification personally reconfirmed with actual151-210, so no normalmissingposepanic. PrivateFacts stillcouldbeforged via parent internal literal, an aggregate/admission design gap ratherthanproven ordinary staleauthority. Allowed shot target is current completion target; RangedAuthority binds timing permission butnotoriginalaimtarget by currentdesign.", "Actual ranged order validates cheapgeometry/lineofsight/cooldown, locatesammo andprepareshitdefense BEFOREauthorize. Dryfire consumespermission/cooldown only, Miss consumesammo withoutdefense, Hit consumesammo and pendingdefense then computesresult. RangedAmmunition captures actualchosenentity+remainingquantity foroneoperation, notlonglivedinventorycache. Strategic receipt ammunition count and nativeinventory remainingquantity differhistory/currentsemantics and usecanonicalbounded/nonzeroquantity routes. No current duplicateauthoritybug from capture alone.", "RangedContact target/bodypart duplicate Authorizedshotimpact but actual335parent destructures the SAMEshot anddirectly buildsContact, then usesONE SuccessfulAttackResponse toproject gameplayApply event andclientfeedback. Raw pubsuper fields notsealedcorrelation, so connected owner/granularitystrengthening canremove independentstructuralforgeability withoutinventing badnormalcaller. Ranged output surfacecoordinate.5 and intendedmeleecontactZERO are explicitdiagnostic placeholders, not measuredcontacttruth; preserve distinction inreport consumers. Worldstrategic sideeffects/receiptfinalization remain independently queued, no tacticalDBpersistence."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F008", "CAMERA-INITIAL07-F032"], "mandatory_qualifications": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-QUAL161"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Keep one prepared/authorized attack occurrence, one completed contact and one publication projection; strengthen correlated input/output records across entire graph without merging attempted/effective defense or historical/current/ideal measure. Preserve current target validation, one ammo/permission consume, no replay from diagnostics, and explicit native snapshot boundaries. C