mulative-source-scope-parallel-052.json#/files/2053"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally consumed substantive RIG-CAMERA-ADM03-722 fullPR1126 actual admission routes and original test-source proof, RootCamera017/018/020 complete qualified P16 actualsource comparisons. Fresh P16 equipment1-627, attachmentfull248, fitproduction1-118, full environment11/lifecycle29/transfer95. Complete actual six PR/P16 bodydifferences read, not hashcarry: currentPR typed sequence Option absence and canonical revision versus P16rawsequence/zero fallback/customhalf-range, actualphysicalgetterchanges andexistingfixtureadaptation. Actual original fulltests628+/119+ source proof used as independent contract intent, not dynamic validation.", "contracts": ["Equipment request carries expected revision/currenthand/currentdestination, but these are optimistic observations deliberately compared to currentserverstate BEFORE action. They are not competing authoritative inventorycopies. Queue authenticates actualcontrolledentity, bounds peractorpending4, pops one totalaction perframe; currentowner/player/state rechecked, onlyaccepted advances lastsequence/revision. Revision is server changegeneration while sequence is client replayorder, independent facts. Preserve PR Option-first sequence policy; P16 unwrapmissinglast0 and local arithmetic are older representation/migrationgap, not another final successpath to keep.", "Actual equipped item has ItemOf owner, EquipmentTopology relation and optional EquipSlot handlegacyprojection. Normal handtransfer writes topology+slot in one deferred batch; slotstow writes proposedtopology and removesEquipSlot; occupiedswap writes swappedheldtopology+slot. Actual caches hook owner/slot changes. These duplicated current facts need one coordinated placement owner ratherthan passive independent components. Concrete normaldrop ordering leaves holding_shield cache stale underqualifiednativehookorder, already F032; fullsource188 reconfirms drop553before554, no duplicatefinding. Do not claim topology/slot alwayswrong merelybecauseconstructible.", "ordered_at_location derives actualroot-order from current topology+staticitemdefinition and DFS currentattachmentedges, sorts authoredkey, usesvisitedset tostopcycles. ReachableTarget::EmptyAttachment carries selectedparent identity whereas Occupied carrieschild identity; expected_entity mapping is selectionoptimism, not equality of parent/childfacts. Emptycapacity range comes actualstaticpoint.capacity; availablemembership fromallcurrentoccupancies, selectedfirst deterministicorder, complete allparentrequirements before one outputTopology. Currentselectedrawtopology canbeforged, but no normalforeignparent route proved; complete connected-player admission has separate obligations.", "Attachment topology copies canonical placementID plus requirement_index/channel/order/attachmentpoint/capacity into selected runtime graph. Actual select_placement derives allfields together once fromselectedmatchingrequirements and ALL explicitselectedanchors; fit helper looks up corresponding staticrequirement onlyif placement/index/location/channelmatch then compares actual conflict predicate. Staticauthored policy versus current selected graph differroles, but mutablecopied fields canlosebinding; canonical accepted graph/typed IDs mustspanproducer/update/receiver, not new independent parsedDTOowner. No runtimecataloghotreload promise established by static getter; no automaticinvalidationspeculation.", "EquipmentEnvironment borrows live SpatialQuery/DoorGrabber/WindowGrabber; it has no independent openingstate. Opening actionrequires empty actualhand and delegates actualdoor/window capability. Dooropenness/controller pose or passagetime are different child authorities notimplied byaccepted equipmentrequest. Fullopeninglifecycles remain separatelyscoped. Pickup groundstatus versus ItemOf/slot topology are coordinated oppositeplacement modes; shape/offset computation is actualnativeport, notpermission toretain semanticvectorsraw acrosshelpers.", "Freshdrop validates physical geometry first then chooses onecollisionfree grip point; item_box_center subtracts actualanchoroffset consistently in dropcandidate andpickupdistance. GroundTransform isgripdatum while nativecuboidcenter isoffsetdatum, different positions. Actualpicker derives aimDir3 andray fromcurrentlocation, checks actual sceneitem, emptyhand, distance/LoS before assigning owner+handtopology+slot andclearingnativegroundcomponents. Rawactorpose/nativecalculationlimits retain actualprioradmission/numericqualifications, no fabricated NaNpickup route or wholefiniteworldseal.", "reconnect_equipment_lifecycle removesqueuedold/new requests, deletespotentialnew sequence and MOVES oldacceptedsequence to newentity. purge removesactorpending/sequence together. Source29 defines actualcleanup ratherthan nominalhelper inference. This is perconnection/entityidentity update, while currentplayerstate/revision transplant lives connected projection source; sourcehelperalone notproofeverycallerinvokesit. Original lifecycle/capacity/anchoroffset/layer/HandOnly sourcefixtures independently document intendedvalidplacement, not new tests or dynamic acceptance. Fullprojection source remainsqueued.", "Input traversal priority and actualphysical garment layering neednot have identicalenumeration order. Current root_order/attachment traversal explicitly selects reachablethings, while armorcontact separatelyusesphysical channelorder. No prioritybug inferred justfrom OUTSIDE_TO_INSIDE name; exactcanonicaltraversal currentdefinitions retain ownsourceproof. Tacticalownedinventoryvs sceneitem currentmembership and selectedplacement acceptedgraph shouldown redundantstate, preserving hand/attachment/capacity/multilocation/neighborfitsemantics."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F032"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Use one coherent accepted tactical placement/ownership transition with cache invalidation before oldowner loss; derive slots/selection and nativeprojection from canonical accepted graph. Preserve optimistic expected-state/replay distinction and currentPR sequence/revision semantics, exact multi-parent/currentownership/fit rules and nativegrounddatum. Reconnect/purge must compose actual full projection lifecycle; no compatibility shims or independent duplicategraph models.", "status": "Twelve exact currentvariants inventoried; concrete F032 retained, projection/openings/nativehookorder dependencies explicit and no source repair"}
