{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-197", "at": "2026-10-23T03:58:18.512451+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope054_index": 434, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/mod.rs", "sha256": "6df2420e23ec21a7d706b89d8af5a999f4798fbff05d5fb6d7a3b5e647b2ff4e", "actual_EOF": 265, "material_ranges": [[1, 265]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/434"}, {"scope054_index": 435, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/quantities.rs", "sha256": "5e3c814a60c0d09d75c9eccfbd371f9412b76b95fefbce3c66c86ff03266bed5", "actual_EOF": 98, "material_ranges": [[1, 98]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/435"}, {"scope054_index": 436, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/stock.rs", "sha256": "848e1187843f8082d93fa8a1adc5e8b2bc60f90336e2d496176aa32969ee596e", "actual_EOF": 38, "material_ranges": [[1, 38]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/436"}, {"scope054_index": 437, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/validation.rs", "sha256": "e40db02777c0f7401b0e90bc493f420be7630091f469a9baa7f0ef1a6f7c965a", "actual_EOF": 207, "material_ranges": [[1, 207]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/437"}, {"scope054_index": 438, "source_id": "physical-p16:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/validation.rs", "sha256": "fd79af94c541daf7519b52218301f4cc66dbd7614d444583271a2e955ed02aff", "actual_EOF": 72, "material_ranges": [[1, 72]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/438"}, {"scope054_index": 2126, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/mod.rs", "sha256": "6df2420e23ec21a7d706b89d8af5a999f4798fbff05d5fb6d7a3b5e647b2ff4e", "actual_EOF": 265, "material_ranges": [[1, 265]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/2126"}, {"scope054_index": 2127, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/quantities.rs", "sha256": "5e3c814a60c0d09d75c9eccfbd371f9412b76b95fefbce3c66c86ff03266bed5", "actual_EOF": 98, "material_ranges": [[1, 98]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/2127"}, {"scope054_index": 2130, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/stock.rs", "sha256": "848e1187843f8082d93fa8a1adc5e8b2bc60f90336e2d496176aa32969ee596e", "actual_EOF": 38, "material_ranges": [[1, 38]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/2130"}, {"scope054_index": 2132, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/recipe/validation.rs", "sha256": "e40db02777c0f7401b0e90bc493f420be7630091f469a9baa7f0ef1a6f7c965a", "actual_EOF": 207, "material_ranges": [[1, 207]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/2132"}, {"scope054_index": 2151, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-weapon-model/src/validation.rs", "sha256": "fd79af94c541daf7519b52218301f4cc66dbd7614d444583271a2e955ed02aff", "actual_EOF": 72, "material_ranges": [[1, 72]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-054.json#/files/2151"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh full P16 recipe265/quantities98/stock38/recipevalidation207/rootvalidation72 including original recipe fixtures225-265. Complete actual five PR/P16 diffs empty; actual constructor/default/identity roles separately compared. Caller facts195/196/193 reused for same current contracts only. Symbol searches exported grip constants show declarations only in P16 snapshot, not body credit. Prior writer syntax failure occurred before any write; sole197 below.", "contracts": ["Authored Recipe owns optional ID/label/role/mount/attach/stretch/shape. Canonical resolved_id is explicit ID then label then ordinal, while label remains display metadata and does not select construction algorithm. Recipe.validate150-166 uses resolvedID for syntax/reserved/unique checks, so original-id None has no hidden Some gate rescuing F037. Component validates exactly one parent declaration before construction; authored absence must remain supported through actual resolved owner.", "Serde establishes field types/finite leaves, not manufacturability. Explicit validation adds bounded budget/dimensions/graph/profile/facing before construction. Repeated checks at public raw decode/derive/construction entry points are not independently editable interpretation shown here; a clean accepted owned construction can validate once coherently. deserialize_present distinguishes absent from present null; no compatibility fallback.", "Quantity macro accepts all finite f64, canonicalizes both zero signs to positive zero and hashes private payload bits, making Eq/Hash coherent. Metres permits signed/default zero; Ratio permits negative and greater than one; Degrees/Radians are distinct unwrapped angle units. Local positive manufacture constraints must not be pushed into broader geometric leaves. Count is full u16 including zero; sample budget3..256 is local, not globally positive Count. Direction maps its two closed variants to native i8/f64 signs consistently.", "Manufacturing positive minimum1micrometre, nonnegative zero and signed world20m bounds have different purposes. Shaft taper defaults1/.92 are validation context; exact called profile/shape default bodies remain separately scoped, no inferred whole helper credit. Public lib grip constants22/38/28mm duplicate validator.022/.038/.028m and currently agree, but source navigation found no consumer of exported mm constants in P16. Remove unused mirror or derive it from one policy before future use; no second live validator disagreement proved.", "ForgeStock closed four variants owns actual item IDs and whole-piece masses5/2/2/4kg. Steel/DarkSteel and Leather/DarkLeather share traded stock intentionally; other valid authoring materials return None. Material density and stock piece mass are different facts; no automatic density-derived stock price/mass. Canonical methods are actual shared owner, not copied record or stale milliunit diagnostic policy.", "holder_identity binds actual recommended holder and closed kind/catalog pair, plus Grip role and sheath LoftedBlade shape. Role/shape checks differ from resolved identity; numeric wall/clearance/hanger/loop endpoints constrain fitting. F037 original optional ID still diverges later. No new stricter explicit-ID prerequisite, changed holder taxonomy or generic positive angle bound. Imported child validation modules and separate tests module are not audited through declarations/calls.", "Original authored JSON roundtrip compares semantic f64 numeric values and omitted fields, not raw JSON byte identity. Canonical design hash195 uses serialized original design, a different purpose. RecipeError stable classifications map diagnostic descriptions; human text must not become another gameplay classifier. Fixtures/includes do not grant catalogue/child body credit; no execution or new tests/assertions."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F037"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "One canonical authored-to-accepted resolved construction owns runtime IDs and physical products. Preserve finite unit/frame policies, contextual manufacture limits, authored absence and structured errors through all receivers; remove unused policy mirrors without compatibility APIs. Keep stock identity/mass and valid other-material distinction.", "status": "Ten exact recipe/validation variants inventoried; child shape/default/helper roles remain independent"}
