forecasts are previews from captured stats/member/schedule rows, not committed time/food usage. Selected terrain preview may use default profile on query failure; actual execution203 recomputes authoritative current profile/weather. Different durations/estimates do not establish duplicated current state. Geographic versus abstract site coordinates intentionally choose Earth versus local-distance model, not one conflicting metric.", "Negotiation/surrender/contact/treatment current permissions and membership revisions are independent from selected name/appearance/history; actual join on site+spokesman ties correct semantic records before presentation. Corpse selection index is produced from same filtered list and immediately dereferenced, not durable identity. Raw forms stay request evidence; native enum/reducer adapters distinct.", "StoreLootForm independently filter_maps itemIDs/quantities, breaking original pair alignment; exact RootNative2F001/Rig813QUAL013 already source-proven admission graph retained. Clean accepted list of item-quantity entries should own pairing, no07 new unique defect. Empty/zero semantics belong actual server owner.", "Actual Root supplied rest/member lower predicates are source-specific separately scoped roles, not coverage by caller. Full route production now re-read: session, exactlocation checks, validated duration/shelter before call; no source changes or new helper/test. Inline source tests establish intent only, no passing claim."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F039"], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F013", "ROOT-CAMERA-NATIVE2-F001"], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Use authoritative committed receipts and derive view flags from typed current or explicit historical facts. Keep backend authority, correct pairing and revision identity through HTTP requests/response; avoid interpreting prose as policy. Preserve generated/manual/noncombat and observer-time distinctions.", "status": "Two full quest route variants invento