ull manifest and binary current PNG previously read; exact current hashes verified. Deleted501 metadata/absence qualifies attempted FileNotFoundError; no credit to absent bytes.", "contracts": ["PNG500 is actual current128x128 8-bit RGBA image, fullbytes read with PNG chunk/IHDR metadata, no rendered pixel/visual-quality claim. Variant501 is explicitly DELETED, currentSHA null/bytes0/baseSHA equals renamed500; absent current file independently confirmed after failed attempted read. No nonexistent source lines/pixels credited. Manifest has belt/worn filebelt--worn.glb and no leather_belt. This removes old path rather than preserving two live compatibility aliases.", "Full manifest694 JSON source read, every asset record inspected. Item/placement keys, generator/designhash/MHR/schema/LOD and triangle/morph stats are generated artifact provenance/native geometry metadata; these are not automatically canonical armor collision/coverage policy. Breastplate/cuirass shared designhash but different authored coverage does not prove contradictory same fact. Actual EquipmentAssets::from_json decodes records but retains ONLY catalogue-checked CatalogPlacement+file after rejecting unknown item/placement/duplicate selection and sorting lexical item/placement. It intentionally discards coverage/material/design/morph stats for this runtime lookup. No live competing runtime coverage authority established from manifest alone.", "Actual equipment.rs135-144 loads embedded manifest once through from_json;245-253 resolves actual canonical item and placement or explicit lexical default. Native asset_path255-265 selects workspace URL vs web path. icons.rs59-74 derives PNG path from selected GLB stem and caches by that path, so manifest and icon path are one coordinated current selection. Scene default and carried exact placement collect same entity key with carried later-wins policy, no independent icon owner. Canonical CatalogItem/Placement definition/full generation provenance remain their separately scoped roles; no blanket build gate/asset existence claim.", "Weapon/holder icon caches first bound size and generator version, decode recipe and recompute design hash before lookup; keys include source kind, generator and renderer revision, designhash, size and supersampling. Same cache is safe against changed recipe identity within those exact predicates; generator implementation/version coherency and recipe-validation deeper bodies are separately scoped. Armor cache path->native AssetServer handle is static embedded manifest lifetime, no actual hot manifest replacement shown. Egui texture/image is native output; fallback atlas slug selection is visual and unknown->first icon, not gameplay item admission."], "findings": [], "status": "Exact current roles inventoried with qualified dependencies; no source edits/other-lens credit", "qualified_supporting_source_roles": [{"source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-client/src/equipment.rs", "ranges": [[135, 144], [245, 265], [1080, 1110]], "whole_source_credit": false}], "connected_repair_acceptance": "One catalogue selection feeds mesh/icon paths; keep generated provenance distinct from gameplay coverage, exact placement/default semantics and native output versions. Do not restore old leather_belt compatibility path or infer unobserved stale asset replacement."}
