rsistent calendar/moontruth in shader. Missing celestial hides/zeroes materials, actualscene-mismatch earlyreturn lifecycle remains fullsky owningrole not waived.", "Pebble hero/near mesh cheap Lambert+ambient versus distant billboard broad normal/light are deliberately different approximations of one albedo, not competing gameplay material. Actual CPU surfaces convertedlinear and fields matchedshader bindings. Billboard position encodescentre in unusednormalchannel and quad offsets inposition; those channels are distinct native representation roles, not bogusduplicate normals. ModelLOD lightupdate/geometry producer remains ownCPUsource, no equality requirement between approximate shading levels.", "Tree aggregate bark intentionally omits close relief/root contact and uses canonical pigment+roughness; tree impostor stores LOD/seed/windstrength/speed with texture source. Shaderlevel4 constructs camera-facing cards while inheriting parenthorizontal/verticalscale, selects eight sourceanglesin3x3atlas and computesvisualsway fromtime. Baked normal/occlusion and broad runtime illumination differ, not two currentforest simulationauthorities. Actual factory parameters fitshaderlanes; exact atlas cache identity/build invalidation in owningimpostor source remains future fullcomparison. No image quality/asset/native runtime assertion."], "findings": [], "connected_repair_acceptance": "Retain one canonical scene/celestial/frame/material owner through explicit native GPU adapters; caches bind actual field/transform/light/image lifecycle. Generate shared ABI metadata where useful rather than force shader numeric kernels to own Rust bespoke types. Preserve room boundaries, distinct LOD approximations and historical outputs.", "status": "Nine exact source variants inventoried with explicit supporting CPU lifecycle limits; no new defect asserted"}
