{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-225", "at": "2026-10-23T05:08:47.529470+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope061_index": 537, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/axle.rs", "sha256": "a52c5fbd5d1c089183621dc0e4129831ea4182d070a79b627be7cdf00dc9c4bc", "actual_EOF": 123, "material_ranges": [[1, 123]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/537"}, {"scope061_index": 538, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/bell.rs", "sha256": "5ec0558f29b7b43440811dbf37b2648d9096a07f66e7ab0eff5a00e78eee6ea5", "actual_EOF": 205, "material_ranges": [[1, 205]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/538"}, {"scope061_index": 539, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/collision.rs", "sha256": "59ae010bf4fbedc4f9daf16fc207e3f5ca674ff20a2c5d5b6b9699d291478f97", "actual_EOF": 448, "material_ranges": [[1, 448]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/539"}, {"scope061_index": 540, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/collision/admission.rs", "sha256": "870d262a151d801eafe72f60e2711c2df146abdc84319c87a59580d131ab25b0", "actual_EOF": 98, "material_ranges": [[1, 98]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/540"}, {"scope061_index": 541, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/collision/cuboid.rs", "sha256": "2d9a1cfbd92acc218b8fb3abaf6f579fde6217c2f3776ece0539c340602baec9", "actual_EOF": 111, "material_ranges": [[1, 111]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/541"}, {"scope061_index": 1917, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-tactical-core/src/scene_input/buildings/placement.rs", "sha256": "8d39af4feaf3413ec32ff198193d1f15b9c029ac9be1f9582f00834976ac1bcc", "actual_EOF": 188, "material_ranges": [[1, 188]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/1917"}], "actual_source_proof": "Actual full axle123/bell205/collision448/admission98/cuboid111 read before continuation; focused collision95-140/265-284 reread now and fresh full placement188 incl original inline tests. All current SHA independently checked. No execution.", "contracts": ["Axle render17-47 and collision51-77 share actual min(Y,Z) diameter, world centre and YXZ orientation; circular mesh32segments versus eight inscribed rotated square covers is deliberately approximate collision (documented radial deficit), not competing editable radius. Bell SECTION is one authored profile used by render23-71 and collision73-136; outer wall chords/crown/clapper boxes intentionally omit cavity while mesh supplies hollow bronze shell/iron clapper. shape_for_role138-147 is one role-to-physical-shape projection, not a second mutable shape table here. Source tests compare geometry but were only read.", "CollisionCuboid stores centre/dimensions/three canonical angles, computes quaternion and absolute half-envelope only on request. Private eight-corner temporary from_pose admits transformed corners, no retained second quaternion/corner cache; twelve edges are topology indices. admission raw SerializedCuboid is native wire DTO whose only conversion calls from_metres for all fields/source ID before Self, not independent accepted geometry.", "compile_building_collision133-217 selects authoritative resolved IDs, actual static source roles and geometric shapes, then computes one completed BuildingCollision. Doors/operable closures stay separate gameplay entities, not missing duplicate static collision. Mesh LOD is not collision authority. Cuboid.bounds79-98 broad envelope differs deliberately from exact ground-floor contact112-127: floor contact recomputes cuboid intersections and fixes datumY0, never trusts broad projection to exclude contact.", "BuildingCollision.bounds100-104 is public alongside cuboids and ordinary Serde. collision_bounds268-283 unions ACTUAL PLAN DIMENSION fallback rectangle with collider envelopes, so it is NOT derivable entirely from cuboids and must retain architectural layout even for no colliders. Actual placement.geometry_datum16-20 reads this envelope centre AND passes same envelope into ArchitecturalPlanProjection before applying explicit floor elevation. Floor datum is orthogonal to collider bottom; tests cover buried slabs. Independent public mutation can decouple envelope/source state, but this proof finds no actual mutation route requiring bounds to follow a collider edit, nor a consumer treating envelope as exact physical contact. Record encapsulation/coordinated replacement candidate only; do not erase plan footprint or claim normal wrong placement."], "disposition": "Complete exact source roles; intentional geometric projections and explicit plan/collision envelope ownership compared. Public aggregate strengthening qualified, no new demonstrated redundant-authority finding.", "acceptance": "Keep canonical shape inputs and geometric approximation purposes; any future retained collider edit must explicitly own envelope recomputation with plan fallback preserved; preserve floor datum vs collider bottom. No tests added/run.", "source_repair": "frozen", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
