s are deliberately omitted when timber frame owns exposed finish43-46; round tower handled separately. Full/detail and exterior selection share this compiler rather than duplicate renderer policy.", "append_shaped_solid75-161 switches canonical shape to same axle/bell/arch owners traced225/224; window leaf derives size/orientation from same current wall and closure state from opening matching exact sourceID. Optional wall absent fallback retains authored solid orientation; no unrelated window meaning inferred. Temporary native vertices projected into material batch, no independently retained closure state in this source.", "Stove tile append14-69 looks up actual heating part solidID/kind and recomputes envelope across current member cuboids per call. Kitchen axis chooses exposed sides; recessed joint backing and ceramic top polygons72-163 are ornamental sampling inside physical shell, intentionally do not create new collision or rewrite canonical dimensions. Global_min/max versus per-face clip is one coherent grid, not duplicate current shell bounds; actual tests172-245 compare within canonical solids but were not run.", "DoorSpec22-34 retains architectural opening/sourceidentity and compiled hinge/closed centre, positive dimensions, orientation/tangent/outward/openangle. Factory119-207 resolves current closure source, normalizes actual frame, computes width/thickness, hinge and inward signed100deg turn together. operable_openings151-160 is same filter reused by static detail dynamic exclusion226. Tangent/outward refer wall/room frame; hinge offset is intentionally allowed (explicit tests255-289 move hinge and recompute sweep), so they are not all derivable solely from closed centre/dimensions. Public independent fields still need coherent geometry API as broader aggregate strengthening, but no source-backed normal live edit or competing current yaw observer established here.", "Manual Deserialize36-71 admits all leaf geometry through canonical leaves and retains structured source/opening error; raw serialized fields are wire-only. Sweep77-115 derives maximum corner radius from actual current centre/hinge/yaw/dimensions each call and rejects nonfinite completed arithmetic; no cached radius/current state. Actual tests include independent finite extremes and transformed hinge offsets; no new execution/assertions."], "disposition": "Exact compiled rendering, immutable source caches and intentional door frame/hinge relations compared; no new redundant-authority finding.", "acceptance": "Keep immutable plan ownership for panel cache, shared shape compiler and canonical source IDs; preserve physical vs tile ornament and independent hinge offset/sweep semantics. Repairs and tests frozen.", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
