es not establish automatic hot synchronization with original plan or a currently trusted edited provenance consumer.", "Exterior641 component_solids9-24 and append_facades26-84 share actual facade_contexts, with authoritative explicit wall.host_solids/opening.closure_solids/timber bay member IDs; owner-wide geometry is deliberately NOT substituted because one church owner may include unrelated vaults/stairs. Same excluded ID set filters actual solid IDs, joins outward contexts for shared solid and visits each physical solid once. retain_inner_skin/minimum_dot are render visibility policies for civilian versus church, not collision or physical wall reclassification. Window bars derive current actual opening membership. Kit F044 remains the exact separate caller-side exposed-instance/private-exclusion issue; this helper adds no independent cache or extra unique finding.", "SmallChurch642 keeps accepted roof tessellation/author finish, explicitly excludes interior roof triangles and chooses exact facade or broad shell. Belfry Shell uses stage bounds as deliberate coarse silhouette; Facade visits actual fitting IDs and clips a cloned exposed solid at stage bottom, coordinating clone centre AND size119-138 before compile. Original accepted structural geometry remains unchanged; hidden floor supports omitted intentionally. small_church expect17-19 is guarded by actual64031-32 Some check. No duplicate source programme dimensions are replayed to regenerate roof shape.", "VertexRemap644 recomputes per-current-index tangent bases and seam flags each invocation, keys all position/normal/UV attributes AND tangent/bitangent. signedzero normalized only in key12-14, consistent deliberate equivalence; no stale persistent key survives mesh mutation. Degenerate/invalid tangent bases intentionally prevent merging. Actual49-52 updates indices using complete remap then replaces vertices, no external observation inside this owned operation. Temporary arrays are derivable but explicitly operation-local preparation rather than competing retained authority.", "MemberUV645 grain_axis is computed from current local size with a documented tie priority; member_uvs uses current rotation inverse and centre for local longitudinal/transverse basis while phase derives same actual centre. Texture repeat and phase are appearance facts, not geometric extent or mesh position authorities. Current689-like separate renderer conventions are not inferred here. Existing full LOD/smallchurch/remap/member UV tests were personally read as source oracles for silhouettes, holes, finish and attribute preservation, not executed or credited as evidence of all generated fixtures."], "disposition": "Accepted semantic geometry and owned render-only projections/current-operation remapping compared; no new redundant-authority finding in these exact source roles.", "acceptance": "Preserve accepted-plan authority, explicit source membership and owned render projection/cache lifetime; do not force exact collision or mesh equality across intentional LOD policies. Existing F044 retained separately. Source/tests/runtime frozen.", "source_repair": "frozen", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-244", "at": "2026-10-23T05:37:24.685820+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope061_index": 646, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/model/layout.rs", "sha256": "f19587b5c651091d18b720268e43f9bdef0e2ca083b33b57d53cbdbccb1be298", "actual_EOF": 452, "material_ranges": [[1, 150], [285, 452]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/646"}, {"scope061_index": 647, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/model/plan.rs", "sha256": "23e353759ff4ea8be954680fcc550feac57d3b56a6e3086d92ad46e5d5692f6d", "actual_EOF": 53, "material_ranges": [[1, 53]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/647"}, {"scope061_index": 648, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/model/resolved_shapes.rs", "sha256": "485156188b8c858094e576418d153b0e315f06c01ef25685a6e11eb97e60a56b", "actual_EOF": 447, "material_ranges": [[1, 447]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/648"}, {"scope061_index": 649, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/model/room_index.rs", "sha256": "09a150e0b0d2873609095c1d8e6f9cf8a4e2117df74ded1787a03d6f647f23cb", "actual_EOF": 45, "material_ranges": [[1, 45]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/649"}, {"scope061_index": 651, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/plan_geometry.rs", "sha256": "a767ca4e45d2c04ddf94d1f23452ecbb3a5c6c864bc8ce63fc673e6f39e5b92b", "actual_EOF": 341, "material_ranges": [[1, 341]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/651"}], "actual_source_proof": "Fresh exact6461-150/285-452; complete64753/648447 in two chunks/64945/651341 in two chunks including scoped original tests; hashes verified. Missing646151-284 explicitly excluded. Current actual243/242/239/234 comparisons are semantic role evidence, not earlier lens verdict carry.", "contracts": ["Layout646 exact1-150/285-452, NOT151-284. First range ends inside RoofEditError declaration; second starts at RoofAssembly field tail, no implied whole missing assembly/error implementation. Room.cells is authoritative authored room shape; WallSegment computes centre/horizontal/exterior on demand from cell/direction/outside_room, no separate retained coordinates or exterior flag. Opening.wall is reference to storey wall index, not self-contained accepted geometry. RoofPiece/RoofDormer documented89-91 INPUT RECIPES while accepted assembly owns rendering/audits. Thus input recipe pitch and accepted edited assembly pitch are NOT automatically redundant current authorities. Actual regeneration from edit-document candidate234 versus render from accepted assembly243 preserves purpose distinction; Native05 roof support-interface update issue remains separate actual correlated-state graph, not proof original input recipe must be rewritten.", "RoundTower646293-403 privately retains grid anchor and cell diameter, computes centre/radius on demand, validates their coupled parity in constructor and decoder. Optional chord interfaces describe actual adjacency, not derivable from anchor+diameter alone. Raw wall height/thickness/optional roof are separate design facts, no automatic geometry consistency guarantee from Option constructor. SquareTower.bell_openings is authored feature request, not inferred solely from kind or postcompile list. Stair tread_count/rise/run/turns are design variables used by actual downstream generators/reservations (233/241/242), not universally one derivable count from fixed tread pitch; current duplicated church literal set-out candidate remains bounded, no fabricated mismatch from raw struct alone.", "BuildingPlan647 stores input layout/recipes plus accepted semantic assemblies and resolved physical geometry, but different roles are explicit. dimensions_metres45-52 derives actual footprint width/depth each call, no stored width/depth cache. Raw public aggregate/Serde can represent incoherent independently edited geometry; declaration alone is not a new normal update-path proof. Actual normal generation/edit-document234 regenerates a local candidate and validates before publish, roof-render243 consumes accepted assemblies; specific F046 constructor mismatch remains actual connected finding rather than blanket equality obligation for every collection.", "ResolvedShapes648 has nominal IDs for separate referents: geometry owner, physical item, wall assembly, opening assembly, structural node. Numerical equality is not semantic identity/duplicated owner. Shape-specific fields are exact geometry and size is documented oriented ENVELOPE358-359; for BellShell hollow mesh, cylinder/arch/annular/sectional shapes, envelope is deliberately insufficient to derive full geometry. Current Solid::new361-379 takes one checked cuboid and copies envelope source/centre/size/allangles; cuboid_envelope381-390 derives full current envelope on demand, no cached duplicate cuboid. Decoder393-427 routes native envelope through same constructor before retaining shape/role/support relations. This gate does not prove every shape parameter fits envelope or support binding, so retain aggregate/admission qualifications rather than infer validity from constructor name.", "ResolvedSurface/ResolvedVoid648430-447 conservative bounds plus exact optional shape are not necessarily equivalent representations. Actualmodelwalls337-340 previously read239 designates sectional shape as subtraction authority and bounds as conservative envelope. Physical support nodes, owner provenance, subtraction target and rendering role identify different relationships, cannot all be derived from item ID or collapsed into numeric alias. Current actual producer239 coordinates selected shape/output except F046; current roof native05 F004 proof requires its own exact update graph, no new duplicate unique finding here.", "RoomIndex649 sole privateu16 representation; ordinal admission narrowsusize to existing packedu16, from_serialized accepts wholeu16 intentionally. Display/index/serialized ordinal derive stored value; no cached text/member flag. It is an ordinal token, not proof membership in any particular RoomVec. Actual callers242 resolve current plan room ID/ordinal explicitly; mismatch cannot be dismissed by type name, and raw parent collection mutation alone does not demonstrate current obsolete lookup.", "PlanGeometry651 has sole owned PlanPolygon vertices with private backing, read-only slice and checked try_map that rebuilds complete mapped polygon. It stores NO independent area/orientation/convex flag. from_ordered_vertices checks actual vertices without reordering, PlanHull sorts/deduplicates computed points then constructs exact empty/point/segment/area variant; lower cross/signed_area use f64 differences. Variant is owned classification of immutable coordinates, not a stale independently mutable flag. Signed-zero equivalence and no proximity epsilon are explicit geometry policy, distinct from actual Navigation bit-key identity242. ArchitecturalPlanPoint is finite 2D point under named architectural frame, not a duplicate 3D floor-elevation owner. Full existing tests read as source-only intended classifications; no execution/new assertions."], "disposition": "Exact raw/input/accepted geometry purposes and immutable computed classifications compared; no new redundant-authority finding beyond prior exact connected graphs.", "acceptance": "Retain explicit recipe-versus-accepted-assembly authority, conservative envelope versus exact shape purposes, immutable polygon ownership and on-demand accessors. Repair only demonstrated connected update/migration graphs; no tests/source/runtime.", "source_repair": "frozen", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-245", "at": "2026-10-23T05:39:27.385694+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope061_index": 652, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/roof_tessellation.rs", "sha256": "1b6392b23903162a4016dd207491880b8fc6d4b6242e1fe516eb8c92ce18634d", "actual_EOF": 426, "material_ranges": [[1, 426]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/652"}, {"scope061_index": 653, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/signs.rs", "sha256": "a289edd3ee387aec2db5dc5cd65b84398c199844256bdba3f6cf1d3a8bb307a8", "actual_EOF": 164, "material_ranges": [[1, 164]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/653"}, {"scope061_index": 654, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/signs/emblems.rs", "sha256": "22775a6695c6acd7655402ff33352ffc6e70a648f70dcf0e29b7d7cce474cf2e", "actual_EOF": 86, "material_ranges": [[1, 86]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/654"}, {"scope061_index": 655, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/signs/lettering.rs", "sha256": "123925e6214be34a423b07c88829feb1e52d9f177de4a3f4347116e34e2a4764", "actual_EOF": 195, "material_ranges": [[1, 195]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/655"}, {"scope061_index": 656, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/signs/mounting.rs", "sha256": "b8304693c8e6698aff2016270d56d35725376c70af25d607855709aac82e0123", "actual_EOF": 132, "material_ranges": [[1, 132]], "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-061.json#/files/656"}, {"scope061_index": 657, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-building-generator/src/signs/rendering.rs", "sha256": "94edb28991714767ff162deb2178ac55612468b458451a7d2ec1f004e85c5c6c", "actual_EOF": 358, "material_ranges": [[1, 358]], "scope