llation652 fresh complete426 takes accepted face.polygon/cutouts/plane/thickness and builds operation-local triangles. Boundary-notch topology/hole_indices/edge-use counts are derived fresh in same call, never cached across mutable face changes. Weather/Interior/Boundary/Enclosure tags identify different physical sides and have different documented exact-detail versus Shell material policy43-54, not duplicate present shape owners. orient_triangle updates winding against supplied normal in same operation. Covering UV follows slope actual normal rather than horizontal projection; plane/polygon consistency of raw input is not newly proven by this render operation or its tests. Actual243 renders accepted faces, not original input RoofPiece pitch.", "Signs653 ShopName derived text is deliberately captured business branding, not the operator personal identity owner. Current actual receiving SceneEstablishment1923 immutable component8-19 explicitly owns captured operator_name for this mission, later missions recapture; validate22-68 obtains current scene building use, binds business usage and compares shop_name to canonical ShopName::for_operator63-64. It does not merely trust two equivalent strings. Actual1960 validate_source26 calls that validator, so comment-only derivation claim is corroborated by actual receiver. Identity/settlement/duplicate references are distinct relationships, not all derivable from displayed shop text. No live character rename synchronization is promised by this mission snapshot.", "ShopSign653 immutable ECS record is constructed with supplied authoritative brand: for_establishment135 compares trade to canonical shop_trade usage, derives emblem from actual654 for_use, and uses distinct deterministic mount/finish streams by establishment ID. Trade display text versus emblem are purpose-specific authored policies: only some public shops have pictograms, so absence is not proof business kind differs. No stale duplicated current operation from independently chosen mount/font/finish; these are independent appearance choices. ShopName text52-54 computed on demand, not retained full concatenated name beside fields.", "SignSite659 for_plan derives actual entrance head/physical wall position/current geometry and SignMounting::find656 selects real structural support reference, full-foot contact and size. Board centre/rotation computed on demand from actual site and selected mount, no stored duplicate board. Mounting support identity/contact are necessary attached snapshot facts; is_supported79-99 rereads referenced current solid, actual rotations/size/role and plate contact, so it does not trust cached supported=true. SignSite.supports113-131 likewise uses current plan solids and actual mounting gate; prepared site does not claim to auto-follow future plan edits. Wall and projecting board layouts intentionally differ from attachment/contact positions and preserve pedestrian/physical clearance.", "ShopSignRenderCache657 private key includes full captured ShopName, font, finish, optional emblem and quantized texture height; paint width is canonical1024. Actual658 painted_material uses all visible per-texture semantic inputs, mount/world origin/physical panel dimensions belong per-instance transforms rather than textureidentity. Backing keyed by actual finish and iron shared; cube/face are unit primitives with current board transform and scale freshly constructed each compile89-134. Changing name/finish/font/emblem chooses a new key, current test mutates name and recompiles to source-check intended behavior. Cache64 limit evicts lookup references only; already-published entity handles continue to identify previous texture intentionally, not retroactive repaint.", "Height key65820-22 and actual paint65539-40 both use quantized height from canonicalwidth and boardaspect but duplicate floating calculation with different multiplication/division association; this is a bounded single-computed-key/painter-height cleanup candidate, NOT a proven divergent valid-site counterexample or a new finding here. No mutable font file revision is a runtime dependency in these exact bodies: font assets are immutable include_bytes per variant65520-24. Asset-store replacement/hot reload behavior outside current resource lifetime remains unproven, no invented normal stale handle defect.", "Lettering655 computes line wrapping, glyph positions, bounds and pixels from current sign and boardaspect in one paint operation. SignTexture.lines is returned diagnostic/render layout provenance, not an alternate authoritative mutable personal name. Finish::colors is one shared policy used by texture and backing65860. Emblem geometry654 single exhaustive per-variant implementation; generated pixel coverage is projection rather than competing semantic badge enum. Full existing652/657/660 tests read as source-only counterchecks for geometry/holes/captured name/cache sharing and mounting, not run or accepted as complete source/fixture validation."], "disposition": "Actual accepted-roof rendering and captured business-brand receiver plus cache dependencies compared; no new redundant-authority finding in exact roles.", "acceptance": "Retain immutable mission branding and explicit receiver comparison; cache texture by actual painter inputs and instance geometry by current transforms. Optional single height computation cleanup requires source-backed numeric policy, no new defect asserted. No source/tests/runtime.", "source_repair": "frozen", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
