rent frozen PR. No compatibility alias or second constructor copied here.", "Bounds664 retains only min/max, computes centre/extent/planhalf on demand; at/union/including select current admitted endpoints, no retained centre, extent or nonempty flag. Clearance665 wraps SAME bounds with positive-volume meaning versus general Bounds contact degeneracy; positive interval and zero contact are distinct contracts, not duplicate equivalent owners. Actual overlap policies differ intentionally: inclusive bounds contact66465-69 versus interior placement positive penetration242. Error role BoundsCentre/Extent labels computed operation fault, not independent data authority.", "Coordinates666 Position/Displacement/Elevation each store one native value plus compile-time frame marker, no runtime duplicated frame code/scale/value. Finite coordinate versus signed translation versus signed elevation are orthogonal semantics even if raw width matches. Actual translated/displacement_to compute new checked result, max selects existing elevation. Pub(super) raw backing remains Root admissionG007 encapsulation qualification, NOT a second current geometry field; current bounds union66473-80 uses componentwise min/max from operands. No new normal invalid fabrication claim or blanket proof from Reflect/tests.", "Dimensions667 LeafDimensions wraps same canonical CuboidDimensions and adds positive-operable-leaf role; PlanDimensions positive XZ versus PlanExtents nonnegative halfwidth permit intentional subnormal halves to zero. half_extents derives current scalarpair, not stored parallel full/half copies. Privatebacking with computed metre access prevents independent dimension mutation. Shared dimensions91-104 is single local finite/negative/zero predicate parametrized by actual role and positivity; repeated checks across canonical cuboid adapters preserve diagnostic role, not independent editable current policy table.", "Error668 finite vector loops actual XYZ and retains first nonfinite axis