ent faces for BVH and contacts. This is F048 qualified cache/dependency binding, NOT a demand remove legitimate temporal history. Normal full body rebuild changes rig and resets start, explicit source tests627-698 preserve ordinary animated history; no actual GUI replacement sequence/run shown.", "SimulationSettings683 defaults define this authoring preview numerical experiment, not tactical gameplay force/fatigue authority. Runtime values are editable control inputs; cloned settings685105-106 deliberately substeps=1 because outer loop owns requested substep count. Delta/count inputs and iteration arithmetic may have separate04 limits, not independent cached defaults from this07 review. Coupled contacts prepare one outfit+body topology/masses for this immutable interval, transfer corrected current and previous together79-89; intentional current/previous positions remain distinct physical history."], "disposition": "Authoring documentation/preview and rest-versus-temporal geometry purposes compared; qualified previous-pose cache invalidation/binding F048, no normal GUI/run defect claimed.", "acceptance": "Preserve rest shape/history and explicit render/physics weighting distinction. Bind prior collider samples to stable actual collider topology/identity, invalidate on changes without clearing ordinary animated motion each frame. Documentation synchronization separate from implementation evidence. No source/tests/runtime.", "source_repair": "frozen", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
