xed surface and native source normals fallback are different-purpose values; weld quantizes source positions to shared-seam groups and writes same averaged position to each output group. No persistent mutation-independent cache here.", "713 validation preserves original encoded face slots for diagnostics and rejects nonfinite fitted coordinates/missing vertices; it intentionally does not impose triangle quality under arbitrary deformation (existing707603-636 test). 708 name/triangle contexts are display/source provenance rather than competing rig identities. No cached error classification or text reparsing consumer.", "715 construction UI retains temporary before snapshot ONLY to return changed bool after actual controls. Construction choice delegates canonical constructors, length sliders derive canonical Plate ranges and native metre/mm conversion constant, lacing Option is itself active state; local checkbox bool written back same operation61-64. Current plate-hole bounds compute lacing eligibility and radius clamp from same current plate. No separately stored enabled flag. Invalid current design displays canonical validate error; no authoring success seal invented.", "716 load functions choose explicit external path or the single authored include asset, parse and canonical validator before returning. Authored absence-path recipe intentionally differs from generic default (actual original test76-77), while checked-in example deliberately mirrors default for example contract. These are separate explicit authored presets versus constructor fallback parameters; no redundant current authoritative runtime policy finding merely because defaults differ. No files were loaded through application/test execution."], "findings": [], "status": "Exact current07 inventory with explicit raw-product/override boundaries; no new redundant-authority finding, no other-lens credit"}
