quire new fit for changed body; data validation85-100 checks lengths/domain/required faces, does not invalidate initialized device. fit_body and wearer expose current backing arrays. Dedicated vambrace211-228 and breastplate237-252 create fresh input/device uploads; underlayer267-282 uses current host. Parametric288-307 routes through DeviceBody; F051 applies that actual branch, not every dedicated generator.", "718 forearm actual selection derives typed lowarm/wrist and full support membership from ForearmSide once, sends status/positions/joints and native uniform slots in same batch. Rust threshold/margin/status constants generate WGSL literals244-246, so shader does not independently edit forearm policy. Native axial clamped0..1 versus support extending margin(-.1,1.1) have different fit/selection purposes. Morphs follow input order with names from exact same slice136-140. Status bits read before output, no duplicate success flag competing with current status.", "719 leg cage computes Hermite section geometry on current body, hip/knee/ankle indices from typed Side+RigJointPart current names. Native shape/section state is local derived scratch, not independently persisted current anatomy. Minimum radius/band and quilt relief are algorithm tolerances not duplicate canonical body dimensions. GARMENT_FIT_MARGIN plus canonical design.clearance/wall thickness262 is composed distinct allowance. record_shells after carrier modification280 explicitly updates dependent shell state.", "720 support primary/extra lists represent different owner versus extension roles, generated from region owners118-123. LowerLeg includes foot conditionally filtered by actual frame; Hand includes forearm. Shared skin_support_wgsl72169 obtains canonical threshold rather than separate editable raw threshold. Host style_words and WGSL style branches are native ABI projection and consumption of same transient variant, not an extra mutable retained gameplay classification.", "720 allocates section