ound references carry same sample.device. No arbitrary later independent binding mutation in normal adapter.", "725 mitten excludes thumb-shell carriers from hand clearance79 while independent thumb frame remains unfitted, explicit distinct ownership. Boot generation first records shells+actual bounds106-123, fits against skin envelope, records NEW shells/bounds147 AFTER first modification, then measures exact normal two chausses on same body and frame, derives dressed sections and applies layer fit/fairing. Thus the second-stage bounds are not stale initial bounds. BOOT_LAYERS constant is intentional conservative fit envelope for both possible garments, not a claim current inventory wears both. No redundant live inventory flag.", "725 BootLayers owns frame/garments/hem buffer produced in same enumerated loop202-213. layer_checks closes device statuses after submission, preserving per-layer failures, before high-level device_fit read publication (actual254). No cached valid field independent of generated geometry. The new layout definition is bounded only; native record_coif lower topology/48-column correspondence has no proof or defect from this packet."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F052"], "status": "Exact current07 inventory WITH_FINDING and bounded native receiver qualification; no other lens credit"}
