ntbodypoints, while local owned-foot bounds use skin weights plus span window: intentionally different measurements. Explicit host_float operation ordering documents why native frame is deterministic rather than recomputing from approximately equal scalar orientation on host.", "730 DeviceFrame is native produced frame plus failure bits; they are parallel validity evidence of same recorded batch, not two editable business classifications in normal producer. frame_constants233-242 generates actual canonical FrameFailure bit values, skin threshold and minimumextent for every native frame producer. ReadFrame139-145 submits, reads status then reads SAME frame. Direct read_async merely converts raw native layout and does not itself certify validity; API admission gap remains separate existing raw-product concern, no current07wrong success path from name.", "730 record_frame obtains typed landmark product and actual owner membership from same host, allocates fresh reductions/status/frame, records actual four passes215-226. read frame returns first15words while16thlandmarkspan is internal numerical work. PartFrame origin/axes/halfextents and landmark input are distinct result/input authorities, no demand to retain alternative exact calculation. Fresh Wearer.upload111-128 reuploads current source, unlike first-upload memoization F051 in separate DeviceBody contract.", "728 region support masks enumerate each region into distinct bits and native sums current skin per region; support bool is a transient union, not lost mutable authoritative set. record_body_points takes exact frame/current devicepositions, attaches support in w, and axial_bounds creates fresh min/max per requested pair. Actual section stages NEAREST,SLICE,ENCLOSE176-184 update same current sections in dependency order. Initial nearest/low/high/scale words reflect temporary reduction state; no persisted stale derived cache across bodies.", "728 common189-234 generates samples and wordstride from Rust constants