d copy. 849 manifest routes shared schema, geometry/determinism/dialogue/puzzle/mechanics dependencies and optional SDK feature, rather than a second executable policy table. Dependency metadata establishes availability, not permission to introduce duplicate owner or blanket native-adapter exemption.", "852 ActivityLocation is a compact authoritative eligibility input designed for shared execution/rendering; case_site derives named outdoors eligibility from actual distance and incident flag. allows is the sole local matrix and unavailable_reason delegates allows first, then selects reason text. No cached independent eligible flag in this module. Raw distance/incident versus closed location class are input/projection stages and actual DB producer authority must still supply current facts.", "852 prayer/caroousing morale values derive immediately from minutes and owning calibration constants; led prayer and meditation are intentionally different effects, not retained duplicate current morale pools. Population level fallback versus positive population estimate are explicit authority precedence, not exact equivalent observations. Earned gold, infamy and discovery/retaliation chances are different outcomes of same duration/skill inputs. Sundays derive canonical calendar helper; no manual competing weekday table. Numerical saturation and arbitrary raw-float behavior remain other-lens issues, not new07 finding.", "853 evening absolute identity, calendar boundary and interval cursor represent linked time roles; evening_boundary uses canonical checked day construction and both crossed/rest enumerators derive endpoints rather than persisting a separate night counter. Rest opportunities overlap sleep window while crossed boundaries are open-start/closed-end; these intervals deliberately differ and require no forced equality. Travel segments preserve nightly attribution and return demand sampling instant=end-1, explicitly independent from future current reducer time.", "853 AlcoholProperties stores authored ABV, useful hydration after diuretic effect, disinfectant potency/focus and potable state. Net hydration is not simply derivable as water_content because declared additional physiological cost; emergency_hydration clamps authored useful value to actual physical water. Potable and disinfectant_focused are different treatment/drinking policies, not equivalent labels forced by ABV. ethanol/water derive immediate fixed-point calculations; actual derived metadata migrations and original decoder gates remain separately tracked.", "853 NightlyMoraleEffect derives kind from sign, magnitude from preference/satisfaction and occurrence from actual evening boundary in one factory. Source ID denotes refreshable current nightly morale event; historical evaluated evenings are idempotence records, not another current morale pool. Public raw effect construction remains admission API exposure rather than evidence actual normal writer disagrees. Canonical source ID avoids multiple hidden impairment sources; no tactical fatigue/encumbrance pool added.", "853 ScopedAlcoholSupply forecast owns disposable cloned quantities, sorts shared/personal then efficacy/item/stableID, applies ordered demands and returns hydration of remaining concrete whole servings. Forecast residual versus real inventory are hypothetical/actual independent states; no cache reuse or committed resource mutation here. Per-evening whole-unit rounding versus one aggregated ethanol request intentionally differs, as actual source fixtures document. best_disinfectant uses canonical potency then lowest stable ID for deterministic selection, not another label switch.", "855 PlayerAttributeValues is the complete framework-neutral base value owner, with pure trait access and feature codec adapter. Effective current attribute multiplies raw base by body health; these are intentionally baseline versus injured capabilities, not redundant copies to collapse. SimpleAttribute to body-part mapping is single local policy; limb weights choose weighted aggregate and do not create another retained player value. Unsupported nonlimb request returns0 in this concrete raw getter, versus generic trait allowance to fail elsewhere; no actual duplicate current classification or hidden fatigue penalty. Existing full PR leaf simple source role remains separately scoped/audited, no included-module body credit from reexport."], "findings": [], "remaining_qualifications": ["AlcoholProperties versus schema/DB adapter field copies require exact current scope recipient comparison at their own queued role; this source receipt does not assert entire native graph cleared. Prior architecture/owner/admission findings retained."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
