rrent state, zero delta at same reference is explicit original fixture197-207. These are not competing current proportions. Actual client retained base and offset coherence remains existing F003/F004 graph and computed finite-overflow Native05 observation separate; this source alone does not prove physical reach changes or bad installed basis. Limits described pinned MHR v1.0.1 contract, foreign current model bound comparison not granted just from comment. No new normal drift claim."], "findings": [], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
