eceiver1212 requires provenance equality AND digest equality AND exact_sources_equal1229; latter compares full captured structs1237-1250, so digest omission is not an accepted replay collision here. Current fixtures1724-1748 explicitly cover changed hidden truth/preparation; source only, no test run. No hash-only stale snapshot finding. Retried receipt historical committed outcome intentionally returned unchanged, never reapplied as current fresh transformation.", "validate_material_commit1266 rebinds every captured source to exactly one current lot, checks identity/custody, revision, overconsume and exact measure/preparation/truth1297-1301. This is actual historical-versus-current boundary preventing old snapshot replay as fresh accepted commit, separate from retry classification. Function does not mutate/persist; reducer must call same transaction before non-replay commit per1263-1265. Caller compliance remains owning DB source obligation, no blanket all materials transactional guarantee.", "PublicMaterialView.sanitized605 publishes same lot/object/measure while caller supplies observer-safe presentation; private truth never inspected by method. It is a projection DTO, intentionally incomplete not a parallel private truth owner. Presentation semantic safety depends owning adapter, not generic marker trait alone. Original fixtures prove only intended cases in source, no runtime/normal malformed-producer claim. Bulk volume capacity, contained displacement, private contaminant load and public hydration must retain their distinct actual units through downstream adapters."], "findings": [], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
