{"id": "CAMERA-INITIAL07-CONTRACT-307", "at": "2026-10-23T12:36:49.744033+00:00", "lens": "audit-redundant-authority", "members": [{"scope072_index": 1124, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/investigation/claims.rs", "sha256": "19ecf9355e0b4d4745fc425ac8c9f8f38f238fc9bb89dc91d4c2da28d0ec3c3a", "actual_EOF": 1771, "material_ranges": [[1, 1771]], "fresh_focused_ranges": [[783, 922], [1140, 1380], [1381, 1771]], "prior_actual_source_proof": "continuation/rig/admission03/native20-support/contracts.jsonl#RIG-NATIVE20-ADM03-540", "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-072.json#/files/1124"}, {"scope072_index": 1127, "source_id": "pr-working:crates/adventuresim-stdb-module/src/investigation/model.rs", "sha256": "ce5e06fe7f483ecbd5c30af9a9475686d4c7acf147a8bb8de2e8a9e738211cb4", "actual_EOF": 1399, "material_ranges": [[1, 1399]], "fresh_focused_ranges": [[357, 515], [620, 711], [812, 1159]], "prior_actual_source_proof": "continuation/rig/admission03/native20-support/contracts.jsonl#RIG-NATIVE20-ADM03-543", "scope_record": "continuation/cumulative-source-scope-parallel-072.json#/files/1127"}], "actual_source_proof": "Personally reconsumed complete source-backed 540/543 narratives and independently analysed every current producer/update/observer role for07; fresh critical source bodies listed per member. Prior admission verdicts grant no07 coverage. Full source facts are reused with explicit purpose comparison rather than unrelated repeated full reads.", "contracts": ["1124 claims pipeline: canonical processed observation/recollection/claim and safe receipt are separate provenance stages, not simultaneous competing versions of the same current belief. Event/observation/recollection reuse checks exact case/proposition/stage payload. Claim reuse checks fewer fields, but receive1244-1380 compares actual publiccase/proposition/statement/source/confidence against its safe receipt and rejects mismatch before current belief. No accepted disagreement inferred from reuse alone; no normal collision producer proved.", "1124 receive inserts immutable revision with statement/confidence/supersedes then inserts or updates current belief from those same values and revision ID. Current belief is an owned summary of the selected revision, not another independently computed confidence policy. Private raw rows admit hypothetical one-sided corruption, but no normal unsynchronized writer found in the complete actual540 source facts. Revision-count u16 narrowing remains operations concern, not an authority finding from numerical capacity alone.", "1124 stagelead1381 checks exact known site+case+coordinates before receipt; discover1457 rechecks current authority before using it. Correction marks prior same-observer/case lead and collects dependent capability IDs, creates replacement from one receipt, then reset_unsupported_capability_progress1533 reconciles current action support. Generated testimony1140-1240 likewise marks same-proposition leads and resets unsupported progress. Exact path is an observer belief, not physical site ownership. Independent false testimony and hidden actual truth must remain distinct.", "1124 lead sharing1550+ copies the sender observed fields including source timestamp/correction state into recipient-owned knowledge with a separate share timestamp. Belief sharing namespaces recipient record by original belief+source revision, then creates recipient revision and selected belief together. These are deliberately versioned communicated observations, not live aliases requiring automatic propagation of every later sender correction. Sender existence/co-location/current party checks and immutable exact share payload bind provenance. Do not collapse history, recipient current acceptance and sender latest state.", "1124 referral and rumor paths personally compared from complete540 facts: immutable catalog revision/referral provenance binds actual consumed rumor/testimony, while current generation/witness location are revalidated at use. Captured grant time is not current location. Presentation text is not a key granting evidence, and uniform testimony confidence6000 describes provenance rather than hidden sincerity. Repeated closed action keys support existing F011 vocabulary graph; no new unique finding.", "1127 raw schema purpose: Belief.current_revision_id/statement/confidence is selected current summary; BeliefRevision is immutable chronology; Lead.corrected_by records supersession; Outcome.recorded_at versus official_recorded_at explicitly different clocks. Capability active and version/seed are evolving action frontier, not derivable solely from historical attempts. PatternTarget captured NPC/demographic/location/presenceversion is generation binding, not a promise of live NPC attributes. Partytracking presentation choice is explicitly not contract/disclosure/movement/reward authority.", "1127 actual deduction rebuild357-425 reads the owner/case receipt inputs, derives the complete new deductions392 before deleting old403, then inserts deterministic per-threat rows with supporting evidence provenance. Normal producer coordinates all computed fields. Inspection476-487 merges successful diagnostic kinds while preserving original successful result; failed previous inspection clears new success contributions. Current skill can add previously unlearned lore to a passed physical inspection, not retroactively change the historical pass into a second check. Existing action receipt exact owner/evidence/topic protects retry; true retries differ from new permitted lore acquisition.", "1127 physical inspection620-711 reads canonical evidence JSON and checks ID/proposition, current actual physical site and selected topic. Generated authority and earned knowledge remain different records: existence alone does not grant observer lore. Full543 facts include passed-only evidence knowledge, deduction rebuild and journal notice. Journal immutable exact notices versus explicitly updateable public threat notices differ in intended lifecycle; no duplicate-truth conclusion from both having text/time.", "1127 occupancy1043-1159 selects exactly one left=None row for current location and a unique half-open entered<=t<left row for history. Setter checks current clock and closes old presence, emits outbreak transition, closes prior occupancy and opens new row at the same clock. Same site no-op is deliberate. Missing living/site existence or monotonic clock checks are upstream contract qualifications, not proof of two normal current locations. Derived id_key is a primitive DB index port to typed site ID; remove redundant first-party representation where connected type migration permits, but no observed inconsistency from coordinated insertion alone."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F011"], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["Whole1128 projections and1130 sites still pending their own current07 comparison; no full parent clearance from calls.", "Raw private DB rows are not sealed accepted aggregates. The inspected normal updates coordinate summaries; no bad actual row/runtime claimed."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
