tual successful history, current exact site and party/cohort state. Execution source1120 revalidates on actual mutation path; preview available is not accepted command authority. Missing-member-clock preview uses available max while actual synchronization is stronger: different projection and commit purposes, retain explicit absent-clock qualification. Immutable generation context/presenceversion is a binding compared with current NPC facts at1390-1439, not a second current location cache.", "1128 generated capability fields are retained typed semantic projections of one authored action, checked against exact method/target/terrain/dependencies/safe summaries and exact outputs/consequence708-759 before pattern use. Manual versus generated is provenance, not arbitrary fallback. exactly_one_generated_authority776-795 rejects different payloads for same case or multiple different cases. Different manifest and context are orthogonal typed facts. Actual validated_generated_authority_candidate801 discards canonical validator result and returns bare string tuple; generated_investigability917 wrongly selects context and decodes it as manifest, while referred contact1394 uses context correctly. ActualRoot078 normal context serialization lacks required catalog_revision, so the modifier is omitted on ordinary no-override context; no runtime claim. Existing RIG-NATIVE20-F002 only, not new07 unique. Reuse canonical validated product end-to-end, not another parser or alternate raw success path.", "1128 observer physical evidence view obtains actual exact pins plus canonical manifest and actual physical evidence authority. It exposes safe topic IDs/labels; hidden check difficulty, stat and source seed remain excluded. Outcome DTO maps safe words, not hidden resolution authority. Corroborated evidence adapters and tracking recursion fail closed on invalid rows/cycles. Temporary parsed maps are recomputed, not caches with separate update policy.", "1130 physical SiteAuthority and observer Lead intentionally differ: knowing/visiting a site requires earned observer knowledge, and original wrong or corrected lead remains history. Exact map pin projects only uncorrected exact stage, actual site identity/case alias/coordinates/provenance equality201-215. Dedup prefers Visited for same owner+site; tracking flag derived from current party selected observer/site, not independently durable bool. Old action missing-site raw ExactBelieved cannot become a pin because lookup20-24 and identity checks reject it. No ordinary user navigation failure inferred from that raw branch.", "1130 generated presentation compares manifest site safe label/name and actual canonical site, then derives current case resolution and combat eligibility from actual group/finale/outcome facts. combat_available means eligible group exists; optional opposition count/power depends on successful enemy construction and checked positive count*power. Failure may leave eligibility true with absent estimate. Eligibility versus estimate is intentionally different purpose; no enforced Some estimate invariant or normal failing group demonstrated, so not a redundant-authority defect by option shape alone. Preserve this explicit aggregate/presentation qualification.", "1130 exact action binding248-286 is current provenance/observer/case/site/coordinate agreement; historical lookup323 uses lead recorded time and correction time plus occupancy half-open interval. Current no-time convenience uses MAX deliberately, while timed physical/context presence uses caller frontier and actual expected membership revision, interval and alive_at. These are current knowledge versus historical observation, not duplicated clocks or permission. Actual reducer checks remain separate from backend raw transport.", "1130 disclosure466-551 compares current canonical coordinates/case/exact stage; reuses matching active record and supersedes duplicate active disclosures, otherwise allocates bounded explicit new revision and marks old records corrected. Fields derive from same current site insertion. Durable per-traveler visited status554-588 survives leader change by design, distinct from current party tracking. Refresh clock error->ZERO remains prior missing-time propagation qualification, not asserted real visit at zero. Generated alias and public/manual identifiers retain distinct meanings.", "Original sites temporal tests591-617 are source-only regression oracles for recorded/correction times, not runtime authority or executed validation. Full current source facts include disclosure-ID parser bounded eight decimal digits, gateway raw row transport, and no body credit for imported child modules beyond separate305 receipts."], "findings": [], "existing_finding_support": ["RIG-NATIVE20-ADM03-F002"], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["combat eligibility versus absent estimate has no proved forbidden normal state.", "Missing referenced action site remains API/raw-stage qualification, actual normal producer absence unproved.", "No blanket raw table/JSON correlation seal, no runtime execution."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
