on oracles, not another live permission resolver. Immutable journal subject933-944 explicitly forbids replacing first subject with lead summary while allowing current timestamp aggregation; actual projections89-184 agrees. Repeated expected wording and sample values do not own gameplay configuration.", "1133 exact-site action test947-1008 checks rights/plan/revalidation/commit/interval order and private receipt separation; source-string inspection does not execute the authority path or prove arbitrary called bodies. Replay deliberately precedes current living/rights recheck for historical completed action. No second current authorization owner from retaining private attempt receipts.", "1134 passed observation fixture47-108 preserves original id, attempt time, stat and narration while augmenting deduplicated learned diagnostic results. Failed inspection111-133 cannot gain lore. Actual model merge/augment476-487 agrees, so immutable perceptual observation versus newly learned interpretation are independent facts. Diagnostic prose retained per kind intentionally, not a cache that must change every revisit. Correction/tracking fixtures compare same owner/case contiguous area-route-site provenance and reset only unsupported descendants; actual claims/model/capability paths307/306 supplied operation proof rather than assuming tests certify it.", "1135 progress fixture95-137 holds a resolution snapshot while passing current live alternate availability separately to wording. These express independent historical attempt and current route support, not duplicate bool truth. Other full551 actualsource facts compare private versus observer-safe deduction, case provenance, exact witness/referral source and full-u64 generated actor IDs. All roster enumerations here are assertion/fixture coverage, not a second accepted gameplay roster or live parser. Actual canonical keys remain production owner; F011 applies actual build/parser lists elsewhere, not blanket any fixture literals.",