dependently analysed current07 producer/operation/recipient purposes, with fresh critical bodies and all three helper bodies freshly full read. No prior lens verdict credit.", "contracts": ["1139 generated case is immutable generation blueprint; local problem authority contains live mitigation/resolution/incident/public awareness state, so these are not exact duplicate live case facts. materialize380 copies common symptom/consequence/scope/window from one generated case into private authority and safe public symptom in one caller-owned transaction. Symptom text/public summary deliberately omits hidden cause/mechanism/disease details; do not collapse privacy projection into exposing canonical hidden record.", "1139 apply_outcome958 checks bounded mitigation and exact source payload retry before current clock. Authority mitigation monotonically maxes and resolved_at chooses earliest; public symptom active_until min is updated on resolve or full mitigation1005-1014. Thus initial copied window and post-resolution projection have coordinated named update path. A separate receipt records original applied outcome, not competing current maximum mitigation. is_active helper additionally checks resolved_at and mitigation, which are distinct causes of deactivation; flags should not be collapsed merely correlated. Raw independent DB writes remain broad API qualification, no normal unsynchronized writer from actual full081 facts.", "1139 validated_problem_generation1030 resolves exactly one canonical/public candidate and consumes canonical validator returned manifest/context; verifies actual problem/case/current settlement name/scope. It does not repeat a separate semantic generator owner. materialize accepts raw GeneratedCase under documented fully validated caller precondition, so no sealed accepted token inferred merely from signature/doc. Existing connected type propagation work should retain canonical validated product, not bolt on duplicate independent validators.", "1139 observer receipt is earned rumor snapshot, not live symptom/case authority. Current learning eligibility uses actual private active problem, observer clock, current persistent witness presence/inn contact and exact generation binding. Already learned receipt and immutable journal remain history after world changes; current followups and newly eligible rumors remain separate knowledge events. Rumor preference selects next requested presentation, not permission; official vs personal/observer clocks remain distinct, missing ZERO fallback retained as qualified source-loss issue. Full actual081 source facts cover bounded hearing graph and deterministic filtered candidate ordering; temporary graph/Vec are recomputed, not separate durable current truth.", "1140 is_active uses starts_at inclusive, ends_at exclusive unless recurring, resolved_at exclusive and mitigation<whole. scaled clips mitigation to10000 and widened arithmetic. Different consequences buy/sell/encounter/disease remain separate named measures, not duplicate impairment pools. Single helper owns local effect scaling; no repeated independent cached coefficient here.", "1141 each incident random stream uses canonical case bytes+ordinal and separate domain label. Ordered candidates by persistent ID, sites lexical canonical ID and circumstance stable wire key are explicit deterministic selection order, not demographic or physical ordering. No stored second random cursor/cache; repeated calls yield purpose-separated deterministic words. Constant stream IDs are names for independent draws, not a duplicate world fact. Parent actual081 ensures nonempty candidates before index; no private-method safety inference beyond that actual caller fact.", "1142 installed inn service and actual dialogue-capable present resident at observer minute are different jointly required facts. Contact current home/settlement/location/presence and dialogue eligibility are read on demand, no cached boolean independently updated. Service flag alone does not imply current available person; no redundancy between these predicates.", "1145 persisted custody enum is actual SpacetimeDB codec boundary, with checked decode to canonical Core custody and encode exact current variant. canonical_custody_binding string is outward stable presentation binding derived on demand. Custody explicitly differs legal ownership and inventory fit/capacity. No second bespoke owner warranted for wire spelling; native codec duplication is intentional boundary while canonical semantics belong low Core.", "1145 direct container edge versus root carried/fixture authority are different graph relations. Resolve321 validates initial backing, direct object/nonself, every actual parent, cycle/depth and consistent character/party backing; returns immediate ObjectCustody plus computed ultimate root. This root is temporary recomputation, not persisted cache with independent mutation. Stored carried backing duplicates root partly for inventory rows, but resolver367 rejects differing carried ancestors before permission recipient. Full557 actualfacts cover exact single backing alias/quantity/item/owner checks and fixture/place constructors. No accepted normal disagreement or legal ownership conclusion from this representation. Preserve exact physical object identity versus stack backing and operational root."], "findings": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["No whole-row raw DB correlation seal or complete transaction theorem from Result.", "Reused full actual source facts cover original tests as source only; none executed.", "Native codec and canonical custody grammar remain separate definitions, current07 semantic policy consumes actual canonical owner comparisons already recorded, not parse-name inference."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
