["1154 canonical pair IDs and active participant uniqueness rows represent unordered pair identity plus active exclusivity index, not independent marital facts. reserve260-332 creates one commitment, escrow, participant bindings and event from one row; event is immutable chronology. transition40 first parses state, removes only participant rows still pointing to this commitment, refunds escrow when not fulfilled, updates status/resolved/reason together then records event. No ordinary divergent active-index update found; partial failure/transaction semantics remain operation qualification, not assumed atomicity from Result.", "1155 approved father and planned dowry are expressly frozen at shared courtship date (1162 docs246-249). Later current wealth is checked only to reserve actual escrow, so frozen approval/amount differs current affordability and must not silently change with opinion/wealth. Weaker deception baseline and observer insight are captured at start, not stale current skill caches. Existing same-kind active/exposed courtship idempotently retained; ended history final. Initial personality/affinity/current adult and co-location are current admission inputs, whereas subsequent discovery uses captured cohort and skill by design. Separate static values do not establish a promise of later live reevaluation.", "1156 discovery reads frozen observer cohort and captured baseline, waits for relevant personal frontiers, writes immutable once-per-observer/day attempt. On success it updates current courtship Exposed and anchors affinity penalty at observer current frontier, while receipt retains historical relationship-day timestamp. Source comments74-79 explicitly avoid double decay from backdating. These are different clocks with distinct authority, not contradictory event times. Death effective-date removes observer eligibility, not retroactive mutation of frozen initial cohort. Chance nonfinite domain remains raw-source API/numeric qualification, not two independent probability owners.", "1157 birth coordinate is authoritative; effective_age_years94 computes it at requested strategic minute and never falls back to cached display age. settle_character_age103 updates only display cache from that calculation. Seeded origin deliberately recomputes birth coordinate from canonical-zero age, while record_character_birth is first-write historical fact. Normal actual demographic planner finalizes before household role creation. This source does not prove every external age reader ignores display cache, so keep earlier age/candidate connected graph qualifications; no blanket freshness guarantee from this helper.", "1157 household membership, kinship edges and residence are different social/physical/legal relations. Seeded fixed family role/edge factory is authoring projection, not equivalence of all cohabitants and kin. join_household leaves prior then installs new membership; derived family plan is temporary. Existing household/kinship IDs are not independent current truth merely because linked by normal wedding. No new inference from allword IDs or private plan visibility.", "1160 wedding210-290 coordinates household membership, effective residence, reciprocal spouse kinship, dowry historical outcome, marriage+active participants and ends courtship before fulfilling commitment. Current courtship ended versus active marriage is intended lifecycle transition, not contradictory flags. resolve325-397 updates marriage termination/resolution together, removes only matching current household/participant bindings, spouse current edges, nonowned occupancy, and updates associated commitment/event. Historical backend projection uses marriage effective interval, not current kinship existence. Do not require old spouse current edge after divorce to answer historical query.", "1160 actual full384 narrative establishes canonical clock and effective legal residence checks before wedding, but late transition parser after some writes is not an early all-fields validation theorem; existing raw row/callee-order qualifications retained. Commitment fulfilled then later Ended records completed relationship lifecycle rather than immutable one-time ceremony alone. No normal independent unsynchronized update proved by private multirow schema.", "1162 persisted raw records expose correlated statuses/options but parsed_state delegates Core canonical strategic_state parser. Those adapters recompute accepted state from raw codec fields, not a second independently stored enum copy. Pregnancy active row versus historical births, leisure cumulative checkpoint versus per-trial receipt, escrow current held funds versus historical outcome and observer discovery history have separate purposes. Closed Kinship/Household/Dowry/Lifecycle variants define distinct kinds, not same-fact duplicate identities. No checked aggregate seal inferred from DB indices/public Rust fields.", "1164 gateway projection reads historical marriage/courtship intervals at each character observer clock and computes spouse/status fields anew. Current global marital status can differ observer-time known state intentionally; pregnancy active due date versus latest born child is expressly separate. Missing clock->ZERO retains source-loss qualification. Backend all-observer transport still requires web session filter; raw DTO is not new persisted authority. Discovery view requires succeeded historical receipt and current courtship link, not freeform narration classification.", "1166 socializing is PairwiseSoft: actual actor interval drives effects, target clock never advanced. Receipts cumulatively record earliest start, last applied endpoint, allocated minutes; actor-day maximum endpoint is replay watermark. Self-target zero-minute record is expressly an impossible real target watermark, not actual social interaction/person identity. Historical availability is chosen at slice beginning to avoid later death/location rewriting past elapsed activity. Party member selects no-familiarity branch by current relationship context, not duplicate affinity owner. Native arithmetic/interval capacity remains operation lens, no authority defect from endpoint versus duration alone.", "1158 original guarded reducer compares chunked checkpoint with canonical Core quantum plan and reverse-pair replay, explicit60/120 fixture crossings. It is source-only acceptance oracle, not an alternate gameplay planner or executed test. Current producer/replay ownership must be established in actual leisure source (separately previously compared), not from assertion equality or fixed IDs."], "findings": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["Raw table/literal mutation alternatives are not sealed accepted state; no ordinary bad row/runtime claimed.", "Original supplier pending parser/affinity references are historical admission notes, not resurrected as unread source where exact current07 canonical definitions previously covered; no inferred callee clearance from this group.", "Transaction/partial mutation and numerical cases remain qualified; this group compares authority purposes only."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
