are examples, not separate cap/default geometry policy. Existing repeated axial-span production F059-like concern remains its actual source graph, no runtime drift from fixture constants.", "1309 runtime bench realbody/selecteddesign generation measures wallclock and emits raw diagnostic row. report179 checks actual positions finite/index membership/morphcount after realResult; does not seal all normals/weights or infer emptynotallowed. Tests capture cache reuse/layers/padding/owner observations, deliberate morph-vs-rigid variants different purpose. CLI rounds0 is no work, not canonical duration0 fault. No launch/test performed.", "1310 runtime ports report136 only requires no morphs+finite positions and prints elapsed/vertices. This is weaker diagnostic subset than browser probe deliberately, not two competing production validity owners. Actual design fit gates remain canonical downstream. Different benchmarks may observe different channels; do not merge merely matching report fields. Native result/JSON ports legitimate, no source mutation/code generation."], "findings": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["Documentation names cache promises but never substitutes actual source invalidation proof.", "Original tests/probes/output predicates are source-only examples, no universal raw mesh/GLB seal or executed validation."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
