ed pairs produce MuscleTarget; body roles, body entities, collider metadata and joint constraints are coordinated projections from one entry plan, not independently editable runtime truth. Private module raw input cardinality/graph assumptions remain broader than this normal producer proof; no general zip/index correctness from type names.", "1397 actual sync uses current authoritative PresentedSkeleton only to enter/exit and carries authoritative owner world movement through captured pelvis_owner_local; limbs remain client presentation dynamics. Enter builds current proportioned bind then captures current live pose/history/scale once, prepares geometry then publishes Ragdolling and Physics pose ownership. Existing active ragdoll intentionally retains fall-time bind/scale/shape/relative targets; no promise of reauthoring mid-fall physical bodies established. Exit retires all parts and returns Authored pose ownership, preserving existing inertial handoff. Orphan owner cleanup is component-presence lifecycle, not independent death state.", "1394 driven body transform is live physics authority; converted back through actual live parent chain and captured bind rotation/entry scale. Undriven ancestors hold exact upcoming pose to avoid shear; undriven leaves retain last pose. Actual pin_joint then apply_ragdoll_poses reasserts pose after procedural passes, so LocalPose/Transform are explicit projected receivers rather than competing winners. Terrain correction reads current scene support heights, max across terrain/sphere samples and checked completed correction, then adjusts native body Position/velocity; existing physics Transform synchronization remains native scheduling boundary, no reset/order proof inferred beyond actual local algorithm.", "1398 age is time since entry, muscle relative target is captured fall pose, current rotations/spins actual physical observations, config is live policy. Rise/stun/release envelope and relative damping are orthogonal dynamics: damping removes relative spin while preserving whole-body motion; kinematic pelvis is never kicked. Checked age and strength are prepared before age store, zero strength intentionally still advances age. Native fixed step clock differs render/sample history by purpose. Config replacement versus entry sample history may share F062 timing-generation concerns but no new invalid ragdoll symptom or immutable-config enforcement proved here.", "Original definition/drive/entry/mod/muscle fixtures are independent source-level oracles for limits, missing roles, mirrored/flex axes, short-arc velocity, tilted capsule terrain samples, muscle envelope and kinematic split; no live second truth or executed fixtures. Raw native vectors/quaternions and current SDK synchronization remain numeric/native ports, not global finite or authoritative tactical-state seals."], "findings": [], "existing_graph_support": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["No actual ordinary hot replacement of bind/config/owner scale during active ragdoll established. Captured entry values intentionally differ live policy/state.", "Malformed private module graph/cardinality/native transforms not universally validated; lower native scheduling not replayed or claimed."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
