own names remain valid open identity and default upper classification, not invalid procedural role. Whole-component replacement can invalidate external rig caches under existing F003 (CON342), not a second independent authority inside this sealed record.", "1407 ClipDuration nonnegative finite and ClipTime signed finite are distinct units/policies, same_sample tolerance deliberately temporal coalescing rather than approximate identity of every scalar. at_phase derives completed time checked finite. No second duration mirror/cached status stored. finite_sample_value remains temporary primitive admission for unmigrated noncyclic channel, not universal CyclePhase semantics despite error quantity label. Existing consumers CON328/331 use actual clip/sample primitives; preserve signed time, zero duration and tolerance boundary.", "1408 SemanticRouteInputs is read-only diagnostic projection of presented skeleton and checked evaluation; trace stores same source evaluation plus input view, requested path and currently equal selected path. Native direction is reporting normalized-or-zero. evaluate clones skeleton and resolves equipped pack/attack set together before evaluating, rejects and removes trace on error. Current counter records each successful evaluation (not current entity population). Inputs/evaluation/raw snapshots are public crate records so arbitrary mutation can fabricate disagreement, but actual normal producer is coordinated and no stable accepted immutable trace contract claims private seal. Actual report validation separately requires runtime-evaluated flag; equal initialized path labels alone do not establish pose execution. No new unique defect or untraced fallback behavior inferred."], "findings": [], "existing_graph_support": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F003"], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["No full report/evidence lens clearance from central scenario metadata; source-specific report inventory remains separate.", "Trace requested-versus-selected path equality is producer observation only; actual runtime evaluation flags and caller consumers must remain separately traced."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
