ent existing semantics; no independent editable cache or actual receiver mismatch newly proved.", "1410 original animation fixtures are source assertions/controlled staging, not production alternate truth. Fresh route inputs verify read-only skeleton and actual evaluation equality, packet jitter tests compare authoritative versus smoothed phase intentionally, span fixtures verify selected exact authored reference frames, fallback tests compare bind restoration/visibility, and contact replay fixtures distinguish gaps/resets/history. Full Native018 actual1524-line facts personally consumed for omitted fixtures; tests not executed and name legacy_tests is no compatibility implementation path.", "1412 private CaptureSequence distinguishes logical plan index, asynchronous view index, applied flag, inflight flag, settled/wait counters and terminal admission. These different temporal states gate different actions: can_drive requires open/notapplied/notinflight/inbounds, capture requires applied/notinflight plus readiness, screenshot callback changes view then advances logical index only after allviews, completion takes retained data. View accessor clamps after terminal view transition; no imported P16 different capture terminal bug inferred. Metadata active_scenario resets skeleton and local histories together; warmup/readiness may drive same plan frame multiple times intentionally before applied, exact sample_tick advances with actual simulations rather than equating plan-frame identity.", "1412/1413/1414 terminal rejection is actual single admission owner: helpers set Rejected, schedule consumes rejection before readiness-gated capture and changes Terminated. Readiness wait is separate temporary status, not contradictory validity; fail_capture reports failure/exit while preserving evidence. Failures can follow earlier mutable fixture updates, but closed admission stops further capture; no transactional rollback contract inferred. Applied frame and plan target versus actual skeleton/body/IK/global pose remain source-versus-observation, not interchangeable current facts.", "1415 fixed native clock uses f64 reciprocal and native nanosecond admission while procedural frame elapsed uses canonical sample-rate f32 interval; deliberate different native representation, not duplicated editable frequency. Global sample ticks remain unique across logical scenarios while first local frame has elapsedZERO; scenario frame/time/index are fixture addressing not authoritative wall clock.1418 warmup count and two consecutive ready observations control startup rather than independently copying motion validity.", "1416 global samples read actual owner-filtered global transforms and actual target IDs, sorted by name+target. Reduced captured semantic bones1419/1420 and full global target list are different report projections, not duplicate membership authority.1417 overlay displays actual bone positions plus canonical locomotion cadence support; report1412 may prefer locally owned raised-footwork step/support or actual IK support. These support concepts are distinct and must retain explicit labels; no proof visual cadence overlay claims physical contact/support-owner equality. Hardcoded visual connections omit some report bones intentionally; topology is drawing policy, not native parent authority.", "1419 first view captures historical baseline, later views compare same logical scenario/frame plus bones/counters/eventcount/IK state; accumulated validity is monotonic historical evidence rather than a second current pose. Missing/extra keys explicitly fail, None versus observed support0 retained. Native NaN compare behavior remains separate evidence/admission qualification, not current07 mirror proof.1412 records actual selected local contact counter even uninitialized across handoff, deliberately avoids replacing it with replicated cadence; logical/runtime/landing occurrences are distinct sources.", "1420 ground selector is explicit Terrain or measured AuthoredPlane; failed authored-plane admission cannot silently choose terrain. Root fixture motion and bone terrain clearance share selected ground datum while subject position includes capsule center offset.1421 projects controller input then applies transition facing and action state at defined seam, preserving actual root orientation versus requested camera orientation. Live fixture action timings19/64 and transition durations32/20/84 are authored fixture policy, not proven duplicate gameplay configuration merely from comments saying matches live server. Capture body/state speed/report labels retain planned versus observed purposes.", "1412 route runtime_evaluated=true is set only after semantic trace presence and successful trace producer344; it does not itself prove a different specialized backend or compare selected path against an independent execution source. Current trace.path/requested_path initialized together and report validity requires equality; keep exact evidence limitation for later audit without claiming concrete fallback mismatch. Screenshot name roster derives allVIEWS at once, actual hashes later check distinct outputs; planned filenames are expectation while captured image hashes are observations."], "findings": [], "existing_graph_support": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["Source reports contain raw absent/nonfinite evidence, no universal successful-view or complete bone assertion inferred.", "No actual native screenshot/deferred-command ordering run; no new capture branch failure from scheduling guesses.", "Cadence overlay versus physical local support is purpose distinction, not established same-fact contract; no silent merge."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
