d-without-render claim established in this cell. Names/cardinality are bounded capture requirements, not universal skin same-rig/topology acceptance; keep limits.", "1426 occupancies derives child placement locations/channels/order and parent attachment association from actual previously equipped authored definitions. First compatible supporting previous garment wins, requires channel/order/positivecapacity/tag intersection and optional actuallocation. IDs generated peritem/placement/requirement for fixture namespace; direct and parent requirement indices intentionally separate rows. No duplicate current topology store outside resulting tactical input. Fixed capacity_index0 is limited fixture selection, not shared graph general admission/consumption algorithm; no actual overcapacity installed roster demonstrated here.", "1427 capture inspection deliberately modifies only renderer material metallic/roughness/alpha for inspection without changing fit. Source material versus overridden rendered material are intentional different presentation modes, not shader policy disagreement. report_json privately captures original constructor settings while pub orbit/diffuse_armor can mutate; run1428 publishes prepared report then uses resource. An arbitrary pre-run field replacement could decouple original options artifact and activeview, but no documented immutable-active versus requested-initial meaning or ordinary mutation path established; retain API purpose qualification, no new unique finding. Converting nativeorbit back to originaldegrees is not lossless, so do not blindly derive original requested evidence fromcurrentQuat.", "1428 run derives scenario metadata/startup IK/actual capture plan before initial artifactpublish, stores requested proportions/config resources and initializes separate nativefixedclock. Config resource versus runtime snapshot installed by main is explicit caller precondition; no hidden assumption that arbitrary CaptureOptions field implies install. Default collider debug registration intentionally mirrors other toolplugin presentation default; no proven canonical authoring policy drift. Fixed native physics simulation disabled while presentation island enabled preserves transient tactical authority. Current localcharacter ID/thirdperson and output state are fixture setup, not independently persistedgameplay truth."], "findings": [], "existing_graph_support": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["Inspection prepared artifact versus mutable active options purpose unresolved for API-only replacement; no ordinary mutation/run claim.", "Actual rendered-material and skin identity guarantees exceed this source readiness predicate; no universal successfulrender assertion."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
