xpected step distance via shared policy rather than cloning it; historicalcontact corrections and phase landmarks are independent observations. Closed scenario metadata344 governs threshold selection coherently, no text reparsing in these sources.", "1430 signed lean response measures stored body-response values while lateral sway reads actual chest/head pose; they are distinct diagnostics, not proof one is always derived from other after all finalpasses. Missing measurement fallback0 remains raw report convention (not measuredzero), acceptance also has separate completeness/finite gates. No universal honest-positive diagnostic guarantee derived from current07; preserve source-specific pending evidence limits.", "1431 REPORT_BONES defines selected17-label report projection, customlexical iteration derives same label table and serializer rejects unknown selectedrole. Reduced parent_bone explicitly different from complete authored hierarchy (e.g Head->Chest skipsneck), so do not substitute native parentage or merge ragdoll15-body roster. Overlay draws a separatevisual subset; no same-topology promise. CapturedBones is retained actual observation map, clone for repeatedbaseline is legitimate history.", "1432 HTML/JSON consume manifest measurements and stored acceptance/score, without another runtimevalidator. HTML manually repeats3view option values despite modelVIEWS/slug owner and /31 denominator despite QualityScore maximum field; current values agree. Source-maintenance suggestion: project selectors/maximum from actual manifest fields so roster/policy edits do not leave rendered controls or labels stale; not DiseaseF011 connected graph, no present drift/run claim. HTML 64Hz labels/playback are another literal temporal display despite manifest.sample_hz; exact actual custom-rate producer/view will be separately compared before treating normal report speed mismatch as finding.", "1433 metrics groups by immutable scenario label, computes whole ScenarioMetrics once from captured samples, stores worst-location/value together at same branch. Root-relative/native-global/bind/target/solved/support roles intentionally different. Guard liveness counts logical contacts separately from visible travel/clearance; actualbody poses are independent cross-check rather than deriving visibility from target. Loopseam deliberately omits stateful lowerlimbs and uses separate actual slip/drift gates. F065 exact fixedflight offset versus configured anatomical offset is connected measurement duplicate; acceptance thresholds remain separate oracle.", "1434 catastrophic displacement is sustained horizontal hip-foot offset;1435 heightpeaks is phase/prominence window evidence;1436 supportedfoot slip requires actual positions+strongsupport+limitedturn then returns checked complete distance. These measure orthogonal symptom/time/frequency quantities, not independently copied state flags. Repeated small0.01 or0.05 cutoffs alone do not prove same owner; each documented purpose and threshold must remain distinct.1433 toe/sole/contact-range deliberately distinguish authored loading and actualIKsupport; missing requiredIKsupport returns error, raw no-observation fallback conventions stay explicit.", "1437 CompletedReport is assembled evidence even when failed, writes global trace/manifest/HTML then separately computes final AppExit from same validation_passed. It invalidates old report filenames at newrun, checks actual expected artifact existence/size using sameVIEWS, and completeness joins captured frame labels/ordinals+all17expectedbones to actualplan. These are live observations versus expectedrequirements, not competing authorities. Byteexists does not prove freshimagecontent; globalreport validity/hostedacceptance not established here.", "1438 raw report aggregate fields are output snapshots, no incoming decoder or authoritativegameplay state. Unit conversion bodydegrees occurs only serializer. Planned speed/guard/directions and actual body/pose/sequence are intentionally represented separately forcomparison, not all current observations. Eventpayload remains canonical typed union until outputprojection kind/sequence; globalfull target IDs and reduced semanticlabels differ scope.1439 event order/unique/count predicates consume actual captured events, not duplicate simulationevent authority; normal single-subject versus arbitrarymultiowner ordering not inferred universally.", "1440 current build computes all named validation booleans from actual metrics/frames/plan/artifacts/events and immutable prior repeated-evaluation evidence. quality_score.acceptance_passed calls same validation_passed, so copied outward boolean coherent in normal constructor. Weightedquality intentionally not acceptance equivalence: selected symptom categories, catastrophic/liveness override and subsetweights31 can differ final acceptance gates or explicit exceptions. Do not infer contradictorycurrenttruth from score100 versus failed unrelated acceptance. Publiccrate raw report mutation remains API broader, not actual production divergence. Shared numeric knee/track/yaw cutoffs repeated in acceptance and category logic currentlyagree but have different scenario applicability; factor only same leafpolicy if later clean-up, retain branch exceptions.", "1440 bouncy validator reads current configured anglecap and stored observed active/max deflection; no-hit fixture explains expectedrest and actual Native spring behavior prior cells. Stopsettle validator requires no captures/plannedcontacts forselected authoredhandoffscenarios while proceduralstate contains other planned branches; scenario-specific expectation, not universal claim finish_terrain_release clears everyplan (CON338 qualification retained). Current support/footclearance source truths are explicitly compared to renderedbone observations; metadata/runtime-selected flags alone remain limited route evidence fromCON345."], "findings": ["CAMERA-INITIAL07-F065"], "existing_graph_support": [], "explicit_pending_qualifiers": ["No executed capture/report/hosted gate; complete artifact existence/summary bits do not prove full renderer evidence.", "Fresh production source plus actual prior fixture narratives used for07; no tests run or new fixture assertions.", "HTML fixed64Hz display/playback versus manifest sample rate needs exact source rate comparison; not yet separate finding."], "repair_status": "frozen", "validation_status": "not_run", "no_other_lens_credit": true}
